<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">ZAB - Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zabuli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha Zabuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zab</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO Kitabu cha Zabuli ni mduganyo wa mila na kulombeza. Mwo ulosi we Kiibulania zabuli ni wila wa kutunyila kint'hu. Mwe kindedi, Zabuli ni mila ya kumtunyila Mnungu, mna iviyaiviya ziyuko zabuli nt'huhu zihengi. Zimwenga ni zabuli za kulombeza wambizi kwa Mnungu, zimwenga nazo ni Zabuli za kuhongeza kulagisa kinyulu kikulu. Naho iyuko mila ya kumtogola seuta, mwenga nayo ni mila ya kuhiniza want'hu mwe mbuli ya mizungu na ivo akuunga Mnungu na kugendeela. Kitabu che Zabuli chawandikwagwa ni wat'hu wengi na kuduganywa kwa miaka ijink'hile Magana. Zabuli zimwenga ni zakale vitendese naho zawandikwagwa mwo lupisi lwa seuta Daudi. Mna ikindedi Bibilia yagamba zabuli zinyingi zawandikwagwa ni seuta Daudi. Zabuli zimwenga zawandikwagwa aho Waizilaeli wandaga wauya kulawa ukwo watahagwa ukwo kwe isi ya Babeli. Wamanyi wahuwila kugamba kuduganya zizabuli kwasilaga mwe kaline ya katatu na ya kane,( BC) aho Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa. Mduganyo uno wo uheelo watendaga zabuli inde na vitabu gana dimwenga na milongo mishano iyo ikepanganize mwe vitabu vidodo vishano. Hata uneva ni mila hegu ni kulombeza, Zabuli zose ziwandikwa enga mashaili. Kwa kukombaganya ludodo ushaili we Kiibulania neinde wambizi mkulu kuzikombaganya Zizabuli. Kuonekela kukulu kwo ushaili we Kiibulania kwetangwa, 'kuligana kwe misafa na mawandiko.' Wawandisi wazoela kuipanga misafa midi kwa hamwenga mwe Zabuli. Enga viya, msafa wa nk'hongo walonga mbuli niyo msafa wa kaidi waguha kint'hu kimwenga mwe zisila zint'hatu. Hamwenga aha yavuzagiza ifanyanyi iidya ilongigwe kwa ulosi mtuhu kwa kuitenda ioneke kugamba yalonga kint'hu hi cha kubela, hegu du kugamba uguha fanyanyi ikuligana na iidya yo msafa wa nk'hongo, hegu naho watambalisa ulosi wo msafa wa nk'hongo kwa kwongezela ayadya yalongigwe mwo msafa udya wa nk'hongo. Kitabu cha Zabuli ya gana na mlongo yagela moyo na makawiilo kwa kubwelekeza ukwiza kwa Masihi uyo akuunga ande seuta naho mlavant'hambiko. Ivo vili vitabu ve Zabuli: 1 Kitabu cha bosi che zabuli ni mwo mnango wa nk'hongo mpaka milongo mine na umwenga. 2 Kitabu cha kaidi che Zabuli ni mwo mnango wa milongo mine na miidi mpaka milongo mfungate na miidi. 3 Kitabu cha katatu che Zabuli ni mwo mnango wa milongo mfungate na mitatu mpaka milongo mnane na kenda. 4 Kitabu cha kane cha Zabuli ni mwo mnango wa milongo kenda mpaka gana dimwenga na mtandatu. 5 Kitabu cha shano che Zabuli ni mo mnango wa gana na mfungate mpaka gana na milongo mishano.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="s">Kinyemi che kindedi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Ana kinyemi yudya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">akuulemela ulangilizi wa want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">Heekutimila miliganyizo ya wata wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:1">hegu kunda hamwenga na wakumbela Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Mna elelwa kutimila zisigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:2">naho mwe izo akehiniza msi na kilo.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Yehe ni enga mti uhank'handa ha kazuto ka mazi yakuseela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">ukweleka matunda mwe misimo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">una mani heye kunyala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:3">Yehe anda mpati mwe kila kint'hu akudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Mna hevinde ivo kwa waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:4">woho ni enga mabunt'hi yakupuluswa ni mp'heho.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Ivo waihi nawasengelwe ni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:5">wata wavu hawande mwo mdugano wa wagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Kwaviya wawagilwa walongozwa ni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 1:6">mna waihile waita kwo kwaga.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s">Seuta asagulwe ni Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Nii si zaunga kusaguka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:1">Ni want'hu wana mizungu heina kint'hu?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Maseuta wa si wasaguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">naho wakulu wafanyanya hamwenga maihi kwa Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:2">na kumhiga seuta amsagule.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Wakakegamba, “Kilaweni mwe minyololo yawe wakikakile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:3">na mwe zisigi zawe wakinyinyile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Mwe difumbi dyo useuta wakwe kwe mbingu, Zumbe Mnungu awaseka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:4">na kuibela mizungu yawe.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Yehe niyo awafank'hila kwa maya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:5">na kuwatisa kwa luhahila.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />“Miye hiika seuta ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:6">mwe Sayuni lugulu lwangu lukukile.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Seuta agamba, “Nenibilikize kiya alongile Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">Yehe kanigamba, ‘Weye u mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:7">Dielo hinda iso.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Unilombeze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">Miye nohwink'he want'hu we zisi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:8">nowikaile si yose.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Nouwahonde kwa ngoda ya kilama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:9">Nouwatuletule enga nyungu.’”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Haluse elo, mwive makanyo nyuwe maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:10">mwinde na mzungu nyuwe wakulu we zisi.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Mdamanyileni Zumbe Mnungu kwa wogohi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:11">mwangileni kwa kuzingiza,<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />na kufunamiza mitwi yenyu ha mwanawe we kilume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">sema anawafiileni maya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">niyo mwabanika aaho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 2:12">Wavikilwa wose wakunyilikila kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mtondo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Zumbe Mnungu, nna wank'hondo wabindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:1">wakunihituka wabinda wingi!<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Wabinda wingi wakugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:2">“Mnungu haamwambize.”<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Mna mazua yose, weye Zumbe ywi nk'hindilo yangu kosekose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">nakunitenda nioneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:3">na kunink'ha nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Namwitanga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:4">niyo anitika kulawa uko kwo mnima ukukile.<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Nehitambaala hasi niyo nagona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:5">nehinuka naho, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu nakanamila.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Miye hikogoha maalufu ya wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:6">awo wanizunguluke kosekose.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Kelavilize we Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">niyokole miye weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">Watowe wank'hondo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:7">naho watende wasekudaha kunilumiza.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Ukombola walawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 3:8">uvikilwa wako unde mwa want'hu wako.<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi mwalagulo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Unitegeleze halombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">weye Mnungu ywangu ukunigombela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Unambize handa mwe makunt'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:1">Nionele mbazi unive kulombeza kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Nomgendeele kunibela mpaka ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">naho nomgendeele mpaka ini kuungisa mbuli heziina kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:2">na kuungisa mbuli za udant'hi?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Manyeni kugamba, Zumbe Mnungu kasagula mhuwilwa kwajili ywakwe mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:3">naho naamwive umwo akamwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Aho nomnande zingizeni kwa kwogoha, naho mse kudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">myafanyanyise aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:4">mkanda mhumula mwe zisazi zenyu.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Mlave malavo yawagilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:5">naho mumhuwile Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Wakulombeza wabinda wingi waka gamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">“Kivikile, weye Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:6">Kikaule kwa ukise wako!”<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Moyo wangu kuumemeza kinyemi kikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:7">kujink'ha uwingi we nk'hande ne divai wananayo.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Neni tambaale hagona kwa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">kwaviya ni weye wikedu, weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 4:8">ukunihumuza haheina nk'huswank'huswa.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Zumbe ywangu, unitegeleze aya hulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:1">aho usinye ivo hufanyanya.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Wive ndilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">seuta ywangu na Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:2">kwaviya weye niwe hukulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, mtotondo wive izwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">mtondo hakulavila nt'hambiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:3">miye nagojela uhituzi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Kwaviya weye Mnungu hukuunga wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:4">kwako mnt'hu mwihi hakudaha kwikala na weye.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Wata weduvi hwaekuungwa kukimala hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:5">weye wawaihiya wose wakudamanya wavu.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Nouwabanange wose walulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:6">wawaihiya wakomi na wadant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Mna kwa uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">miye neniingile mwe nyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nohuvike mwe dihema dyako dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:7">nenifunamize kihanga hasi kwa kukuvika.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Zumbe ywangu, unilongoze mwo uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">kwaviya wank'hondo wangu wanigoja wanikump'hukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:8">wiike vedi sila yako hangu.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Milosi yawe haina kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">mwe miyoyo yawe mmema ubanangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">milomo yawe ni enga kikuta kigubulwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:9">nyimi zawe zimema udant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Uwasengele mwe masa yawe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">wagwe kwa kwa wiihi wawe wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">naho uwakulumbuze kwa wavu wawe ubindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:10">kwaviya wakuleka weye.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Mna nawande na kinyemi wose nawagulukile kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">wakeme kwa kuwanga mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">uwamile wahuwilwa wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:11">vileke wakuonele kinyemi weye.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Kwaviya weye Zumbe Mnungu wawavikila want'hu wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 5:12">wawamila kwa lukunde lwako enga nk'hindilo.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi mwa makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Weye Zumbe ywangu usekunikanya kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:1">naho usekunisengela kwa kuniihiya kwako.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Unionele mbazi Zumbe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:2">naho unihonye, kwaviya hibunt'hika.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Nna kiyangayanga vitendese mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:3">Zumbe Mnungu, housunguze?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Unihitukile Zumbe Mnungu uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:4">unilekele kwajili yo lukunde lwako lukulu.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Uko kwa wabanike hahali naakukumbukile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:5">Uko kwo mnyongomela niani akudaha kukutunya?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Hisokelesa kwa ndilo yangu kwa masozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:6">naho kwa kuila kwangu hikijabaza kigonelo changu.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Ziso dyangu disokela kwa kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:7">wank'hondo wangu waditenda dihwe.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Mhalawe nyuwe nyose mkudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:8">kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ywangu keva ndilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Zumbe Mnungu keva kulombeza kwangu kwa kuonelwa mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:9">Zumbe Mnungu kazumila kulombeza kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Wank'hondo wangu wose nawaone soni na kunda na kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 6:10">nawauye kunyuma na kunda na kwituka.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa mnt'hu akuhujilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Zumbe Mnungu ywangu nakugulukila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:1">Unikombole na kuniyokola kulawa kwa wose wakunitimila.<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Sema akanimofola enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:2">na kunibulumula haheina ywa kuniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />Zumbe Mnungu ywangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">Uneva hidamanya mbuli zimwenga mwa izi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:3">uneva higela usavu mwe mikono yangu,<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />uneva himtendela yeyose yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">hegu himsezenga mbuyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:4">hegu kumkump'hukila mnk'hondo ywangu haheina lema,<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />ivo mnk'hondo ywangu anikulumbuze na kunigwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">ajatangize wikazi wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:5">na kunikomela aaho.<verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Inuka Zumbe Mnungu kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">winule maya yako mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">inuka Zumbe ywangu unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:6">weye kuutenda uwagilwa udamanyike.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Uwaduganye want'hu wose mnk'handa mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:7">weye nawe uwekaile kukongela kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu wasengela want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">unigombele kulagisa kugamba hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:8">viligane na uwedi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Uuheleze wiihi wa want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">want'hu wedi uwatende watoge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">Weye Zumbe muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:9">umanyize zifanyanyi ze miyoyo ya want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Mnungu ni enga nk'hindo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:10">yehe awayokola want'hu wata miyoyo yedi.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Mnungu ni mlamuzi ywa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:11">kila zuwa awasengela wakudamanya wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Want'hu hawanakeiile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">Mnungu naanole jambia yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:12">naahinde uta na kuwiika lumwe.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Aika lumwe vitoanilo vakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:13">na kuika vedi misale yakwe ikukweela moto.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Want'hu waihi wenula nda ya maihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">wana ubovu wa makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:14">wengila nyumba udant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Wasimba mabome na kuyafulikiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:15">niyo wahubugila woho wenye.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Ubanangi wawe nouwauiye woho weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:16">wiihi wakwe nouwauiye wenye.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Nenimtunye Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya yehe ni ywedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 7:17">Nenikeme nt'hogola kwa Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mnungu na nt'hunyo ya mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Ukulu wako waonekela mwe si yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:1">Ukulu wako ubula mpaka kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Kwa nt'hogola za wana wadodo na wakonk'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">kukeikila gomela mwa wank'hondo wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:2">vileke uwanyamaze wank'hondo wako na wahigani wako.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Nekilo hakaula ulanga, ni weye uudamanye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:3">Mnenge ne zint'hondo uziikile,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />mnt'hu niye ani vikuleka weye Mnungu umfanyanye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:4">Mwana mnt'hu niye ani vikutenda umkaulise?<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Kumtenda ande hagihi na Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:5">kumvala nt'hunyo na ukulu;<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />kumwink'ha udahi mwe kila kint'hu ukiumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:6">kuviika hasi viumbwa vose mwo wikaila wakwe;<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />hamwenga na ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe na makala ya kwembago.<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />Madege na samaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:8">viumbwa vose va mwe bahali.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 8:9">ni kindedi zina dyako dikuka mwe si yose!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola kwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Nenimtogole Mnungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:1">nenisimwiile mbuli zose za kweheela izo udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Neninde na kinyemi na kwanga kwajili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:2">weye Mnungu mkulu, nohutogole kwa kukema.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Umwo wanambizaga, wank'hondo wangu wauyaga kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:3">ho undiilo wako, wakobadika na kusila pele.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Kunitoanila mwe kindedi changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">naho kwikala mwe difumbi dyako dyo ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:4">na kulava usengelo wa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Kuwafank'hila want'hu wa si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">kuwabananga waihi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:5">mazina yawe yajaligwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Wank'hondo kuwabananga ulo na nulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">kuimola imizi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:6">nk'humbukila yawe haihali naho.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu niye seuta ywa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:7">kaika fumbi dyakwe dyo ukulu vileke asengele.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Azisengela si kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:8">naho azilamula si uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Zumbe Mnungu ni nk'hindilo kwa want'hu wakuhujilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:9">naho awadima lupisi lwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Wakukumanya Zumbe Mnungu, wakuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:10">weye Zumbe Mnungu hukuwaduula wadya wakukuzungula.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Mkemeleni nt'hogola Zumbe Mnungu akwikaila Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:11">wagambileni mbuli izo adamanye,<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />kwaviya Mnungu alihiza kikoda kwa wakomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:12">naho hakujala ndilo ya wadya wakuhujilwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Unionele mbazi Zumbe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">uwone makunt'ho ayo hupata kwa awo wakuniihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:13">ni weye ukudaha kuniyokola kulawa mwe file,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />vileke nisimuile nt'hunyo yako mwa want'hu wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:14">nenange kwaviya kuniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Want'hu wa si wengila wenye mwe dibome wanisimbilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:15">wagwiligwa nu lwinika waufisile.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Zumbe Mnungu kakelaviliza ivo eli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:16">want'hu waihile wagwiligwa kwa udamanyi wawe wenye.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Want'hu waihile nawasiile kwe vikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:17">hamwenga na wose wakumjala Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Mna want'hu wakiwa hawajalwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:18">kawiilo dya wakuhujilwa hedyage hata zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Inuka Zumbe Mnungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">Usekuzumila mnt'hu akubele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:19">uduganye si ho undiilo wako uzisengele.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Zumbe Mnungu uwatende wazingize kwa wogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 9:20">want'hu wa si wakombaganye kugamba woho ni want'hu du.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Zumbe Mnungu nii wakimala hale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:1">Nii wakefisa mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Wakiwa wasulumizwa kwa kitugu cha wata wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:2">waihi watega lwinika wawagwile wakiwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Mwiihi aketunya kwa kumunk'hwamunk'wa kwakwe kwiihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:3">mhank'hu aligita na kumlemela Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Mwo kitugu chakwe mnt'hu mta wavu, hakumvika Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:4">zifanyanyi zakwe ni kugamba Mnungu haanitende dyodyose.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Sila za mnt'hu mta wavu zina upati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">usengelo wa Mnungu wihale ne zifanyanyi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:5">naho awabela wank'hondo wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Afanyanya akagamba, “Hikogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:6">henipate makunt'ho mazuwa yangu yose.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Mnomo wawe umema maligito na udant'hi na kutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:7">lulimi lwake lwalonga mbuli ziihile.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Akefisa mwe zikaya uku akalota kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">amkoma mnt'hu heena masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:8">emeso kwa kumnyatila msokezi.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Ongola mwe vituka enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">Awanyatila wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:9">awagwile mwo lwinika wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Wasokezi wakump'hukilwa na kukinywa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:10">wagwilwa kwa ukwank'walu wa mnt'hu aihile.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Mta wavu afanyanya mwo moyo wakwe akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">“Mnungu kajala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:11">kafisa kihanga chakwe hakuona kint'hu!”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Inuka Zumbe Mnungu, uwasengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:12">usekuwajala wakuhujilwa!<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Vadahika vivihi mwiihi ambele Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:13">akakegamba mwenye, “Haanitange kwo usengelo”?<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Mna weye wayaona makunt'ho ya wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">naho mazuwa yose wawambiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Heina kint'hu akuhuwila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:14">Weye kunda mwambizi ywa wanank'hiwa.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Ubanange ludole lwa mnt'hu aihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:15">uheleze wavu wakwe wose usekuutenda naho.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Zumbe Mnungu ni Seuta ywa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">wose wakuvika milungu mituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:16">nawahauswe mwe isi yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Zumbe Mnungu kuyamanya makawiilo ya heweina wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:17">wawenk'ha mhuwi naho waitegeleza indilo yawe,<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />wawagombela wanank'hiwa na wakuhujilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 10:18">vileke want'hu walaile mwo ulongo wasekudaha kwigala wogofi naho.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s">Kumkawiila Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Nagulukila utondowazi kwa Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">Mwadaha vivihi kunigamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:1">“Puluka enga dege mwe milima,<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />kwaviya waihile wavuta uta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">waigela chalumwe imisale vileke walase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:2">wawalase misale mwo lwiza want'hu heweina lema.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Uneva nk'hongelo inabanangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:3">mnt'hu ywedi naadamanyei.”<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Zumbe Mnungu emwe nyumba yakwe ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">difumbi dyo ukulu dya Zumbe Mnungu di kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">kwa meso yakwe akaula want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:4">naho amanya icho wakudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Zumbe Mnungu awahima want'hu wedi na want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:5">naho awaihiya wata wavu na wank'humbizi.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Neiwanyeele fula ye nk'hala zo moto na madini ya chola want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:6">mp'heho ya nk'hungunt'ho neinde usengelo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Zumbe Mnungu ni ywedi naho aungisa uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 11:7">want'hu wedi nawekale naye.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Sunguza Zumbe Mnungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">want'hu wedi wasila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:1">wahuwilwa wahauka mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Kila yumwenga amdant'hiliza miyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:2">walonga kwa lulimi naho kwa moyo wa finju.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Zumbe Mnungu inyamaze milomo ikudant'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:3">na kila lulimi lukukeduvya,<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />awo wakugamba. “Kwa milomo yetu chapata kiya kikuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">nekilonge ivo kikudaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:4">hahali yeyose akudaha kukinyamaza?”<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu agamba, “Haluse neza,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">“kwajili yo kuhujilwa kwa wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">na kulabilkwa heweina kint'hu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:5">name neniwenk'he utondowazi nawakakukawiila kulawa kwangu.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Milosi ya Zumbe Mnungu ni yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">ni yedi enga masawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:6">naho enga zahabu isunt'higwe nk'hanana mfungate.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Uchamile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:7">ukidime mazuwa yose ne cheleko iki cha wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Want'hu waihile wazunguluka kila hant'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 12:8">wavu watunywa mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya kukombolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Ni kwa lupisi lwani nounijale weye Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Togola hounikumbukile mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:1">Naho noukefise nise kukuona mpaka ini?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Neninde na kiyangayanga mwo moyo wangu kwa lupisi lwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">na kunda na kinyulu msi mgima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:2">Wank'hondo wangu nawanihume mpaka ini?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Unikaule na kunihitula Zumbe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:3">uyakaulise meso yangu yase kugona nt'hongo za file.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Use kuzumila wank'hondo wangu wagambe, “Kimhuma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:4">Wata finju wasekunda na kinyemi mwo kuhumwa kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Mna miye nakukawiila lukunde lwako holikusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:5">moyo wangu wanda na kinyemi mwo uyokozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Nohukemele weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 13:6">kwo uwedi mkulu unidamanyile.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s">Wiihi wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Wahezi wakelongela mwo moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">kugamba Mnungu hakuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">wose waganika vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">wadamanya mbuli za kwiihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:1">hehali hata yumwenga adamanye yedi.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Zumbe Mnungu awakaulisa want'hu kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">akaule uneva naone hata yumwenga mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:2">uneva kuna yeyose akumzungula Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Mna wose wana malema naho waganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">hehali akudamanya ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:3">hehali hata yumwenga.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />“Togola awo wakudamanya yaihile hawamanyize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">Wawabwant'ha want'hu wangu enga mikate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:4">naho hawakunitunya miye Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Mna nawande na wogofi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:5">kwaviya Mnungu ehamwenga na want'hu wakumwiva.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Wadaha kwazaganya mizungu ya mnt'hu mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:6">mna Zumbe Mnungu niye unyilikilo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Wandile uyokozi wa Izilaeli wezile kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Zumbe Mnungu umwo akadamanya uhya wikazi wa want'hu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">Welekwa wa Yakobo nawange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 14:7">naho Waizilaeli nawande na kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s">Yadya akuunga Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Zumbe Mnungu ni ani neekale mwe dihema dyako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:1">Naho niani naahumule mwo mnima wako ukukile?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Ni mnt'hu akwikala haheina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">akudamanya yedi mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:2">akukelongela ikindedi kulawa mwo moyo wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />ni mnt'hu hekusezenga weyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">heekumdamanyila mbwiyaye yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:3">hegu kumnuola finju miyawe,<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />ni mnt'hu akuwabela want'hu wakuhujila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">mna akuwatunya wakumvika Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:4">ni mnt'hu heekuhitula kilapi chakwe hata uneva hakina mwink'hile upati,<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />heekwink'hiza matundu yakwe kwa kuunga mgenyezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">hegu kuhokela matundu ya soni kulawa kwa mnt'hu heena masa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 15:5">Kindedi mnt'hu akudamanya ayo haabanangwe.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="q">Kulombeza wamizi <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Mnungu, Unamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:1">kwaviya kwako nagulukila utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Namgamba Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:2">“Weye ywi Zumbe ywangu, kila kint'hu chedi nnanacho chalawa kwako.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Watendesa uwedi wakukile wa mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:3">nelelwa kwikala nawo.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Mna wakuvika milungu mituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">nawapate makunt'ho makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">nt'hambiko ya sakame heniilave naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:4">na mazina ye milungu yawe heniyatambule.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ni weye ukunink'ha vint'hu vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:5">upati wangu umwako.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Kunihimila hant'hu hedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:6">kindedi ukipe wangu ni wedi vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Namtunya Zumbe Mnungu kwa kunilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:7">hata nekilo moyo wangu wanihinza cho kudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Zumbe anilongowela mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:8">ehamwenga na miye hakihali cha kunisingisa.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Kwa ivo neninde na kinyemi na kwanga mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:9">name nenikale kwa utondowazi,<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />kwaviya nounamile no ludole lwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:10">hounileke mhuwilwa ywako nibanike.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Wanilagisa sila ya mpaka kwo ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">kwa weye kunda na miye kwanitenda ninde na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 16:11">naho nenange mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa mnt'hu ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Zumbe Mnungu wive ndilo yangu ye kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">wive kuila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:1">tegeleza kulombeza kwangu hokwiina nyambi.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Uwagilwa wangu wize kulawa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:2">kwaviya weye kumanya mbuli zo uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Weye kumanyisa ivo nili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">kwiza nekilo kunipelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">Kunigela mwe magezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">huone wiihi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:3">hyalongaga kint'hu kiihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Mwo udamanyi wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">miye hikuzumila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:4">hikesumsa na sila za waihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Hitimila sila zako mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:5">naho hidamanye yaihile.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Nakwitanga Mnungu ywangukwaviya weye wanitika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:6">nakulombeza wive kulombeza kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Unilagise udamanyi wako mkulu wa kweheela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">weye ukukombola kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:7">wadya wakugulukila utondowazi kwako.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Unamile enga ziso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:8">unifise mwa mawawa yako,<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />kulawa kwa wiihi wakunisulumiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:9">hale na wank'hondo wangu wakunizunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Awo hawana mbazi mwe mioyo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:10">wamema mbuli za kukeduvya.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Wanitimila na kunizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:11">waninyatila wanikinye hasi.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Wekeika lumwe wanibwant'he enga simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:12">enga mwana simba akongola.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Inuka Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">towana nawo na uwahume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:13">kwa jambia uyokole wikazi wangu kulawa mwa waihi.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />Kwa udahi wako Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">uniyokole mwo udahi wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">awo wakuungisa vint'hu va mwe si du.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">wawegusa kwa kuwenk'ha ugoli mwingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">uwo wakuwalekela wana wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:14">usigale nawo wawalekela wezukulu wawe.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Mna miye neniuone udahi wako kwaviya hina idyo nibanange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 17:15">Henuka neninde na kinyemi umwo hakuona weye.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Daudi wa uhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Nakuungisa weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:1">weye ni chotoko cho ludole lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Zumbe Mnungu ni mwamizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">gomela dyangu na mkombola ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">Mnungu ywangu na luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:2">nk'hindilo yangu na ludole lwa uyokozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Namwitanga Zumbe Mnungu akuwagilwa nt'hunyo anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:3">miye name nayokolwagwa kulawa kwa wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />kubiilika kwe file kwanizungulukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:4">malao ya wiihi yanigela wogofi.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Sigi ze file zanizungulukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:5">lwinika we file nounibwiila.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Mwa makunt'ho yangu namwitangaga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">namwiilaga Mnungu anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">evaga izwi dyangu umwo mwe dihema dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:6">ndilo yangu yambwiilaga kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Umwo isi ikazingisika na kuzingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">nk'hongelo zo mnima zazingizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:7">kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kandilisa na maya.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Mosi wafunk'haga kulawa mwe zimp'hula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:8">moto na nk'hala za moto ukoka zalawaga mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Aifunamizaga ulanga na kuseela hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:9">na vunde titu hasi he viga vakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Akwelaga kiumbwa kina mawawa kikupuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:10">na kupulukisa kulanga mwa mavunde.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Akegubikaga na ziza nt'hendelo zose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:11">mavunde yazamile yamemile mazi yamzungulukaga.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Kwajili yo ung'azi wo undiilo wakwe mavunde matitu yagubikaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">hamwenga na fula ya maiwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:12">na lukuwa lwa lumwemwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Zumbe Mnungu alavaga izwi kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:13">izwi dya Mnungu mkulu dyevikaga kose.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Awalasaga wank'hondo ne misale yakwe na kuwatenda wasambale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:14">aduulaga lumwemwe na kuwagulusa.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Mwina we bahali wagubukaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">nk'hongelo ye isi yaonekaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kwajili ye diizwi dye nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:15">kulawa mwe zimp'hula zako.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Zumbe Mnungu niyo achulula mkono wakwe kulawa kulanga na kuniguha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:16">aniinulaga kulawa mwa mazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Aniyokolaga kulawa mwa wank'hondo wangu wata ludole lutendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">aniyokolaga kulawa kwa awo nawakaniihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:17">kwaviya nawanda na ludole lwa kunihuma.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Nawanikump'hukila handa mwa makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:18">mna Zumbe Mnungu anamilaga.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Aniguhaga na kuniika hant'hu ha kutondowala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:19">aniyokolaga kwaviya aniungisaga.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Zumbe Mnungu anink'haga geleko kwa uwedi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:20">anamilaga kwaviya nehinda hina masa.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Kwaviya nehitimila sila ya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:21">hegu hisaguke kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywangu kwa uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Hiyatoza malagizo yakwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:22">hilekile kutimila sigilizi zakwe zose.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Hakwe shandile na masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:23">hekeamila nisekunda na lema.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Zumbe Mnungu anink'haga nt'hunyo kwaviya nandaga ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:24">yehe kamanya mikono yangu haina masa.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Weye ni mhuwilwa kwa wadya wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:25">houne masa kwa wadya heweena masa.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Weye uywedi kwa wadya awedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:26">mna umkwakwa kwa waihi.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Weye wawayokola wakukeseleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:27">mna wata weduvi wawaseleza.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Naho weye Zumbe Mnungu wanimulikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:28">weye Mnungu ywangu wadihausa diziza dimwangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Kwa wambizi wako nawahuma wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:29">weye kunink'ha udahi wa kumola magomela yawe.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Uyu Mnungu udamanyi wakwe hauna lema dyodyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">kilapi chakwe Zumbe Mnungu ni cha kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:30">yehe ni mwamizi kwa wadya wose wakumgulukila.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Niani eli Mnungu kujink'ha Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:31">Niani eli mwamizi kujink'ha Zumbe Mnungu ywetu?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Mnungu niye akuniink'ha udahi kila hant'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:32">ni yehe akuidamanya isila kunda itondowale.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Kavitenda viga vangu kunda na ludole enga mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:33">na kunitenda nidahe kukimala mnanga mwe milima.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Akanihiniza kutowana nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:34">mikono yangu yadaha kulasa ne misale ye shaba.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Kunink'ha nk'hindilo yako ya kunamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">mkono wako wa kulume unambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:35">kukeseleza kwako kunitenda ninde mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Kuitenda sila yangu kunda yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:36">naho viga vangu haviteele.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Nawatimilaga wank'hondo wangu niyo nawagwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:37">shauyaga kunyuma mpaka niwakome.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Nawagwesaga hasi hawadahaga kwinuka naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:38">na kugwa hasi ye viga vangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Weye kunik'ha ludole lwa kutowana nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:39">wawaselezaga hasi yanguhwank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Kuwatenda wank'hondo wangu wanyilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:40">na wadya nawakaniihiya nawakomaga.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Wagutaga lukunga mna hakwandile na yeyose ywa kuwaambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:41">wamwilaga Zumbe Mnungu mna hawahitulwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Nawatowaga niyo wanda enga luvumbi lukwinulwa ni mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:42">naho nawajataga enga nt'hope yamwe sila.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Weye kuniyokola mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">na kunitenda kilongozi ywe ziisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:43">want'hu hiwamanyize wanidamanyilaga ndima.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Weze weve mbuli zo uhumi wangu nawanizumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:44">watakwiza nawo wezaga na kunitunya,<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />watakwiza nawafa chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:45">wezaga wakazingiza kulawa mwa magomela yawe.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Zumbe Mnungu mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">atunywe digomela dyo uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:46">avikilwe Zumbe ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Yehe kanink'ha udahi wa kulihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:47">na kuwahuma want'hu wa si nt'huhu.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />Aniyokolaga kulawa kwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">aninulaga mwa want'hu wakwank'walu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:48">na kuniyokola mwa wahigani wangu.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Ivo nohutunye mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:49">Zumbe Mnungu neniditogole dizina dyako kwa kukema.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Mnungu amwink'ha seuta ywakwe uhumi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">na kumlagisa uwedi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 18:50">na kumvikila Daudi na welekwa wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">Ung'azi utendese wa Mnungu mwo uumbi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Zimbingu zabwelekeza ung'azi utendese wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:1">ulanga nawo walagisa zindima izo adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Zuwa dya dielo dyalonga na zuwa dya luvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:2">kilo cha haluse chalonga na kilo kikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Hauhali ulosi ukwivika ukalongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:3">hegu izwi dyodyose kwivika.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Mna du izwi dyawe dyevika kwe zi isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">ne zimbuli zakwe zibula uheelo wa si.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:4">Mnungu kadiikila dizuwa hant'hu ha kwikala mwo ulanga. <verse eid="PSA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />Uko nuko dikutont'homoka enga sekilozi akufosa kwe chumba chakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:5">enga mnt'hu mta udahi akutimila sila yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Dyatont'homoka kwo ulailo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">niyo dyaita mpaka kwo usweelo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:6">hakihali nekinyilike mbwikanizo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi za Zumbe Mnungu zikint'ha</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Sigilizi za Zumbe hazihungukilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">kwaviya zegala ugima mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">miko yakwe ni ya kuhuilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:7">yawenk'ha mizungu wose wahungukilwe.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Sila za Zumbe Mnungu zina uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">na wose wakuzitimila wana kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">sigilizi zagela ung'azi mwa meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:8">zakink'ha kukombaganya.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Ni vedi kumwogoha Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">ni mbuli ikukile ya mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">usengelo wa Zumbe Mnungu ni wa kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:9">uwo ni uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Ni ya yombe kulu kujink'ha zahabu nt'hana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">zina mwiile kujink'ha mwile wa uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:10">uki ukulawa mwe kivuna.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Mwa uwo miye nakanywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:11">kuyatimila ayo kuna geleko kulu.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Mna niani akudaha kubunk'hula mbuli za kifiso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:12">Weye Zumbe Mnungu uniusile wavu wangu wa kinyele.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Umdime mndima ywako asekudamanya wavu kwa kasidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">Usekuzumila ayo yanikaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">niho neninde ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:13">naho heninde na masa.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Yadya hulonga ne zifanyanyi zangu zizumilwe ni weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 19:14">Zumbe, unyilikilo naho myokozi ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza uhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Zumbe akwink'he uhituzi, akwambize ukadugana na makunt'ho!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:1">Zina dya Mnungu ywa Yakobo dinde nk'hindilo yako.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Akwigaile wambizi kulawa kwe Nyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:2">naho akwink'he kawiilo kulawa mwo mnima Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Naahokele malavo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:3">naho neelelwe ni nt'hambiko zako.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Akwink'he yadya ukuunga mwo moyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:4">naho akukint'hizile imizungu yako yose.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Naswe nechange kwa uhumi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">naho nekinule bendela zetu kwa zina dya Mnungu ywetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:5">Mnungu akwink'he yose ukulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Haluse elo himanya kugamba Zumbe Mnungu enk'hiza uhumi kwa seuta amsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">naamwink'he uhituzi kulawa hakukile hakwe kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:6">kwa udahi wakwe amwink'ha uhumi mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Wamwenga wahuwila magali ya kink'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">wamwenga nawo wahuwila falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:7">mna suwe chahuwila zina dya Zumbe Mnungu ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Want'hu nawakobadike niyo wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:8">mna suwe nekinuke niyo chakimala kitogile.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, umwink'he uhumi seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 20:9">ukitike kikakwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola za uhumi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, seuta ana kinyemi kwaviya kumwink'ha ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:1">kwaviya kumtenda mhumi.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Kumkint'hizila yadya akuunga mwo moyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:2">kumzumila yadya akulombeze.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Kwaviya nokumhokela kwa kinyemi kikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:3">naho kumvala taji ya zahabu yedi mwo mtwi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Akulombezaga ugima, nawe niyo wamwink'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:4">mazuwa yabindile ingi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Nt'hunyo yakwe ikula kwa wambizi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:5">weye kumwink'ha nt'hogola na ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Ikindedi kumvikila mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:6">wamtenda ange kwa kinyemi cha undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Kwaviya seuta kamhuila Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:7">kwa lukunde holuukusila lwa Zumbe Mnungu haasingisike.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Mkono wako nouwagwile wank'hondo wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:8">naawatahe wose wakumwihiya.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Akabwiilana nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">nawande enga wokigwa mwe nunda yo moto.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 21:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">Zumbe naawabinde pele kwa maya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:9">niyo moto wawatikinya taka.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Naawakome welekwa wawe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:10">na wana wawe mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Wakaika mizungu na minyanyiko ya kukuhiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:11">woho hawabule hohose.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Kwaviya nouwatise niyo wakunyilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:12">nouwataile ne misale yako.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu chakutunya kwo ukulu wo ludole lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 21:13">naho nekikeme niyo chatogola udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ndilo ya kinyulu na wila wa nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Ho! We Mnungu, we Mnungu nii kunasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">Uyokozi wangu nii ukanda hale nawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:1">ne milosi yangu yo kulabila?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />We Mnungu ywangu, hikwitanga nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">mna hunitike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">hikwitanga nekilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:2">mna hione lwedi.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Mna hata ivo weye kukuka naho kwikaila difumbi dye kiseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:3">ni weye nt'hogola ya Waizilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Wakale wetu wakuhuwila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:4">wakukawiilaga niyo wawayokola.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Wakwitangaga niyo wawayokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:5">wakuhuwilaga niyo hawaone soni.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Miye hiye mnt'hu, miye ni kadudu du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:6">hibeligwa na kugelwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Wose wakunikaula wanitendela lubezo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:7">wanibekuila milomo wakasingisa mitwi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />Wakagamba, “Nakamkawiila Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">haya naamyokole elo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:8">uneva Mnungu kamwelelwa naamwambize.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Ni weye walekaga helekwa haheina wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:9">naho umwo nandaga katiti ni weye wanidimaga.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Miye nehiikwa kwako aho nize ninde du hyelekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:10">kukongela aho mnala anelekaga, weye kunda Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Usekunasa hale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">kwa viya makunt'ho ye hagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:11">naho hahana mtuhu ywa kunambiza.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Wank'hondo wengi, enga majeku wanitemangiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">wose wanizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:12">enga majeku yakulawa kwe isi ya Bashani.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Wasama milomo yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:13">enga simba ikubuma ikufunc'ha unga inibwant'he.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Ludole lwangu lunisiila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">netika enga mazi mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">mavuha yangu yose yatigint'hika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:14">moyo wangu nawo enga nt'ha ikulujuka.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Ludole lwangu lunyala enga kazae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">lulimi nalo luketozela mwe milomo ya kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:15">kwaviya kunitambalika mwo luvumbi lwe file.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Fyo dya waihi dinitemangiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">enga makuli mengi yakunibasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:16">wanibwant'ha mikono ne viga vangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Mavuha yangu yose yekuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:17">woho wanikont'hoela meso na kunibela.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Wapangilana zisuke zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:18">na kutowela simbi mavalo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Zumbe Mnungu ywangu, usekunikaila hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:19">weye ludole lwangu sunguza kunizila.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Niyokole ne sime ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:20">kombola ugima wangu kulawa kwa makuli aya.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Niyokole kulawa kwe zisimba izi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">miye hina mwambizi kwa mahembe ya mbogo aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:21">wive malombezo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Neniwagambile want'hu wangu kiya udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:22">nohutogole mwo mdugano wawe.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Nyuwe nyose mkumvika Zumbe Mnungu mtunyeni yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">welekwa wa Yakobo wose mwink'heni yehe ukulu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:23">Nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli mvikeni yehe.<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Kwaviya hakubela na kuona hikint'hu makunt'ho ya wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">hakuhitukila hale nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:24">yehe awetika umwo wakamwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Mwo mdugano mkulu nohulavile nt'hogola kwa yose udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:25">nenilave nt'hambiko ho undiilo wa wose wakukuvika.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Wakiwa nawadye niyo weguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">wose wakumtimila Zumbe Mnungu nawamtogole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:26">Mnungu awenk'heni ugima wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Want'hu wa si yose nawamkumbukile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">kulawa nt'hendelo zose za si nawamuuiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:27">vyeleko vose nevimvike yehe.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu niye seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:28">yehe ekaila si yose.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Wagoli wose mwe isi naweze na kufunamiza mitwi yawe hasi ho undiilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">wose wakugojwa ni ifile nawafike madi hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:29">na wadya wose hewekudaha kuulela ugima wawe.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Vyeleko vikwiza nevi mvike yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:30">nevigambilwe zimbuli za Zumbe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />want'hu hewenati kwelekwa nawagambilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 22:31">udamanyi wo uyokozi uwo adamanyaga Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mnungu niye Mdimi ywangu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Zumbe niye Mdimi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:1">heni swese kint'hu chochose.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Yehe anitambalika mwa madimilo ya mani yekwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:2">anigala kwa mazi yalenguke.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Yehe anivuzila ludole luhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:3">naho anilongoza mwe zisila za uwagilwa kwajili ye dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Hata uneva nomboka mwe dikolongo dina lwiza lutithale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">henogohe uihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ywi hamwenga na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:4">nk'home yako ne ngoda yako vanink'ha kukawiila.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Kuniikila lumwe fugo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">iivi wank'hondo wangu wakanikaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kunihaka mavuta mwo mtwi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:5">kiyamp'ha changu kukimemeza niyo chetila.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Ikindedi, uwedi wako no lukunde lwako nevinde na miye wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 23:6">naho nenikale mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s">Seuta mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Si na vose vimndani ni va Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:1">na wose wakwikala umwo ni wakwe yehe.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Si aizengaga mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:2">na kuikila nk'hongelo mnanga mwe mito ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Niani akudaha kukwela mwo lugulu lwa Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:3">Naho niani naakimale hakukile hakwe?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Ni wadya du wakudamanya ayedi na fanyanyi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">wadya hewekuvika mahili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:4">hegu kukelisila milungu ya udant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Zumbe Mnungu naawavikile na kuwayokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:5">Mnungu naawatambule woho kunda wawagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Awo ni wadya wakuzungula yakumwelela Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:6">naho ni wadya hewe kukwiihiya weye Mnungu ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Inuleni mitwi yenyu nyuwe nk'hili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">ink'hizeni sila nyuwe nk'hili ze kikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:7">vileke seuta ywo ukulu engile.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Ni yuhi uyu seuta ywo uwedi utendese?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Yehe ni Zumbe Mnungu mta ludole naho mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:8">Zumbe mhumi mwe nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Inuleni mitwi yenyu nyuwe nk'hili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">ink'hizeni sila nyuwe nk'hili ze kikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:9">vileke seuta ywo ukulu engile.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Ni yuhi uyu seuta mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 24:10">Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi niye Seuta ywo ukulu.<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza Ulongozi na Wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Kwako weye Zumbe Mungu naika dikawiilo dyangu,<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />nakuhuwila weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">usekunileka nengila niyo nengila soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:2">hegu wank'hondo wangu waonele kinyemi kuhumwa kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Wose wakukuhuwila hawahumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:3">mna wose wakukuhiga nawo nawengile soni.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Zumbe Mungu nihinize zisila zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:4">vileke miye nidamnye yakukwelela.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />Nihinize viligane ne kindedi chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">kwaviya ni weye Mnungu ukuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:5">naho mazua yose nakukawiila weye.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Ukumbukile weye Zumbe Mnungu mbazi zako na lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:6">kwaviya zandaga uuko kukongela aho kale.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Usekukumbukila wavu na malema yo ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">no wavu wangu wo ukwank'walu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">unikumbukile kwajili yo lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:7">kwaviya weye Zumbe Mnungu uywedi.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ni ywedi na muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:8">awahiniza wata wavu zisila zo kutimila.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Awalongoza wakweseleza kudamanya yakuwagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:9">naho wajalamu naawahinize zisila zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Sila zose za Zumbe Mnungu ni za lukunde no uhuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:10">naho ni kwa wose wakutimila indagano yakwe, na yadya yakumwelela.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />Na kwajili ye dizina dyako weye Zumbe Mnungu niusile wavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:11">kwaviya utendesa.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Wose wana wogofi kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:12">yehe naawahinize zisila zo kutimila.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Mazua yose nawande wapati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:13">welekwa wawe nawo, isi neinde yawe.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Zumbe Mnungu awalongoza wadya wakumwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:14">yehe awagambila yakuungwa mwe indagano yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Miye namkaula Zumbe Mnungu mazua yose anambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:15">kwaviya naaniyokole ne mitego.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Unikaule na kunionelea mbazi weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:16">kwaviya miye nikedu naho nakunt'ha.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Uuse sungusungu dyo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:17">naho uniyokole mwa makunt'ho yangu yose.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Fanyanya disungusungu na kiyangayanga cho moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:18">uniusile wavu wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Kaula wank'hondo wangu ivo wabindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:19">sinya ivo wakuniihiya kwa luhahila.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Uniyokole naho unamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">usekunileka hengila soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:20">kwaviya nanyilikila kwako.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Uwedi na uhuwilwa vinamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:21">kwaviya kawiilo dyangu dikwako.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Wayokole want'hu wako Waizilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 25:22">walawe mwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mnt'hu mhuwilwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Unigombele weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">kwaviya nadamanya ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:1">naho hikuhuwilisa weye du.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Unihime miye weye Zumbe Mnungu na kunigeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:2">uupelembe umoyo wangu na ubala wangu.<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Lukunde lwako lunilongoela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:3">naho uhuwilwa wako wanilongoza mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Miye hikale na want'hu walulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:4">hegu kunda hamwenga na watondwe.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Naihiya mdugano wa waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:5">nawanyilika wakutenda wavu.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Nahaka mikono yangu kulagisa hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:6">naita hagihi ne kilingo chako weye Zumbe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />vileke ninule izwi halava nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:7">nakusimwiila yakweheela ayo udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Naiungisa inyumba yako weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:8">aho wili ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Use kuusa ugima wangu hamwenga na wata waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:9">hegu kunikoma na wakomi.<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />awo wakudamanya yaihile lupisi lwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:10">awo wakukeika lumwe kuhokela matundu ya soni.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Mna miye nenidamanye yakukwelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:11">unionela mbazi na kunikombola.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Miye hikimala hant'hu hwamilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 26:12">nenimtogole Zumbe Mnungu mwo mdugano wa want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola kwa Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niye ung'azi wangu naho niye akuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">nogohe ani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">Zumbe Mnungu anamila kwa yose yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:1">hina cha kogoha.<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Umwo waihi wakanikump'hukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">wakaunga wakikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">awo wak'hondo wangu naho wakomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:2">nawakobadike niyo wagwa.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Hata uneva fyo dyose dikanitemangiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">miye henogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">hata heziilwa ni nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:3">miye neninde na mhuwi du.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Mbuli imwenga humlombeza Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">kint'hu icho huzungula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">miye nikale mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">vileke niuone uwedi wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:4">na kumlombeza ulongozi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Kwaviya umwo makunt'ho yakanizila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">yehe naanifise mwe diheha dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:5">naho naaniike hant'hu hatondowale halanga ho luwe.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Name neninde kulanga ha wank'hondo wanitemangize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nenimlavile nt'hambiko kwa kwanga na kinyemi uko kwe dihema dyakwe dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:6">nenikeme na kumtogola Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Unitegeleze weye Zumbe Mnungu umwo hakuiila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:7">unionele mbazi unink'he uhituzi.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Moyo wangu wanigamba mwa weye, “So umvike Zumbe Mnungu,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:8">Zumbe Mnungu, miye neza huvike.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Usekukefisa vileke nise kukuona,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 27:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">Usekunionela maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">usekuleka kumkaula mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">kwaviya weye kunda wambizi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">usekunileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:9">weye Mnungu myokozi ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Hata uneva tate na mnala wana nileka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:10">mna Zumbe Mnungu naanidime.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu nihinize miye yadya ukuunga nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">naho unilongoze mwe sila heiina wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:11">kwaviya wank'hondo wangu wabinda wingi.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Usekunasa, wank'hondo wangu wanitende ivo wakuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">kwaviya walava uwona wa lulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:12">wanitisa wakakeha kwa kukeduvya.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Mna miye nahuwila kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">neniuone uwedi wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:13">mwe isi ya wata ugima.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">utoge usekwingila chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 27:14">weye mkawiile yehe.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s">Lombezo dya wambizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu nakwitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">weye mwamizi ywangu usekuleka kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:1">hunanitegeleze neninde enga ni wadya wakuita kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Nitegeleze kulombeza kwangu umwo hakuiila unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">henuila mikono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:2">haionyekeza uko kwako kukukise.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Usekunikulumbuza hamwenga na want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">awo wakudamanya yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:3">want'hu wakulonga na weyawe mbuli za utondowazi, q mna mwe mioyo yawe mmema wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Walihe kwa ayo wadamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">viligane na maihi yo udamanyi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">wasulumize kwo udamanyi wawe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:4">wenk'he yadya yawawagile.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Hawakukumbukila kiya adamanye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">ne zindima izo atendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">kwaivo naawasulumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:5">na kuwakoma pele mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Ditogolwe zina dya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:6">kwaviya keva indilo yangu haunga wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Zumbe Mnungu nuwo udahi na nk'hindo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">miye namhuwila kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">yehe anambiza naho anitenda nimwangile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:7">ivo namtogola na mila ya kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Zumbe Mnungu nulo ludole lwa want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:8">amwamila na kumuyokola seuta ywakwe amsagule.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Zumbe Mnungu wayokole want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">naho wavikile wose unanawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">unde mdimi ywawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 28:9">uwadime vedi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">Izwi dya Zumbe dina udahi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Nyuwe viumbwa va kwe mbingu mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:1">mwink'heni nt'hogola itendese na udahi.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Mwink'heni nt'hogola itendese ye dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:2">mvikeni Zumbe Mnungu hant'hu hakwe hakukile.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu divika mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">ung'azi utendese wa Mnungu utowa lukuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:3">ne diizwi dyakwe divika mnanga mwa mazi mengi.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu dina udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:4">Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu dikulisa.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu dyavuna maziti yakwitangwa mielezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:5">Zumbe Mnungu avuna maziti yakwitangwa mielezi ya Lebanoni.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Aitenda milima i Lebanoni ipilikepilike enga ndama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:6">naho aitenda milima ya Helimoni ijink'hejink'he enga njeku.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Izwi dya Zumbe dyalava ndilija za moto.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu dyasingisa dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:8">Zumbe Mnungu atint'hila mwe dijangwa dya Kadeshi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Izwi dya Zumbe Mnungu dyakungudisa mivule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">naho dyahulula mani mwa maziti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:9">mwe nyumba yakwe Zumbe Mnungu, wose nawalonge kwa izwi kulu, “Ung'azi utendese ni kwa Zumbe Mnungu!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Zumbe Mnungu ekala mwa mazi mengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:10">Yehe ni enga seuta ywa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Zumbe Mnungu awagela ludole want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 29:11">naho awavikila kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Nakutogola weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">kwaviya kuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:1">huwalekele wank'hondo wangu wasekukeduvya kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Nalombezaga wambizi kwako weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:2">niyo nawe wanihonya.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Weye nokuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">nokunikombola kulawa kwe isi ya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:3">niyo wanink'ha naho ugima.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu mila ya kumtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">nyuwe wahuwilwa wakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">Kumbukileni kiya adamanye uyo akukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:4">niyo mwamwink'ha nt'hogola.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Maya yakwe ni ya lupisi luguhi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">mna zimbazi zakwe ni za mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">ndilo yeza hata nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:5">mna kinyemi cheza nomtondo.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Name nize nione ni mpati nagambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:6">“Henihumwe naho.”<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Kwo uwedi wako Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">wautendaga useuta wangu enga mnima houkusingisika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">Mna wize ukefise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:7">miye nengilaga kinyulu.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Nehikuiila weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:8">niyo namlombeza Zumbe Mnungu anambize.<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Nikihi noupate uneva nna banika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Upati wako nounde ni uhi uneva nnaita kwe isi ya wabanike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Wabanike nawadahe kukwink'ha nt'hogola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:9">Awo nawadahe kubilikiza uwedi wako?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Zumbe Mnungu, nitegeleze naho unionele mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:10">Nambize weye Zumbe Mnungu!”<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Nokuyahitula mahongezi yangu kunda kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">nokunihambula suke za magunia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:11">na kunivala luseko.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Miye heninyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">nohukemele mila ya kukutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 30:12">weye Zumbe Mnungu nohutogole mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya kumhuwila Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Miye nanyilikila kwako weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">nnase kwingila soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:1">uniyokole kwa uwagilwa unanawo.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Unitegeleze uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">unde unyilikilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:2">gomela ditogile dya kuniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Ni weye unyilikilo na wamizi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:3">unilongoze na kunamila kwajili ye dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Uniyokole ne mitego wanitegele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:4">ni weye unyilikilo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Miye nakeika mwo udimi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">uniyokole weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:5">Mnungu mhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Miye nawaihiya wadya wakuvika mahili kunda milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:6">Mna miye namhuwila Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Nenionele kinyemi na kwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwajili yo lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kwaviya wayaona masulumizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:7">kuyamanya makunt'ho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Weye huwalekile wank'hondo wangu wanihume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:8">kunink'ha ulekelwa wa kuita kudya huunga.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Zumbe Mnungu, unionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">meso yangu yasokela kwa kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:9">hisiilwa pele ni ludole.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Miye hisokezwa ni kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">heiye, wikazi wangu kwa kuila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">ludole lwangu lubindwa kwajili yo wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:10">mavuha yangu nayo yasokela.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Wank'hondo wangu wose wanibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">naho vitendese ni kwa wa hagihi na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">wambuya zangu nao waniona mnt'hu ywa kutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:11">kikadugana mwe zisila waninyilika.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Wanijala enga mnt'hu abanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:12">hinda enga nyungu ya muufi itulike.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Naweva want'hu wakatakamizana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">va kutisa, kila hant'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">walangilizana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:13">wakaika mizungu ya kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Mna miye nakukawiila weye du Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:14">nagamba, “Weye ni we Mnungu ywangu!”<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Wikazi wangu wose nadimwa ni weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">uniyokole nifose mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:15">mwa wadya wakunongola.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Unikaule mndima ywako kwa wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:16">uniyokole kwa lukunde lwako holwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Usekunileka hageligwa soni weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">kwaviya miye hinyilikila kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">wageligwe soni want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:17">wekale kinyamaile kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Milomo ya wakudant'ha inyamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">wakulonga kwa weduvi kwa want'hu wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:18">want'hu wakukefenya na kukekweza.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Uwedi wako weye ubinda wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">uwo uwaikile wahuwilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">kwa kila amanyize ivo wili ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:19">haaone wiihi, wose wakukuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Wawadima vedi haheina wiihi ho undiilo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">hale na mizungu iihile ya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">wawafisa hant'hu hedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:20">kuse na milosi ya wasezengi.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Zumbe Mnungu atogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">yehe nakakilagisa lukunde lwakweheela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:21">aho natemangizwe enga mzi ukump'hukilwe.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Miye nehyogohesa niyo nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">“Nakelava ho undiilo wako!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">Mna kumbe waivaga indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:22">aho nakwitangaga kwa wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Muungeni Zumbe Mnungu want'hu wakwe wose mkukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">Zumbe Mnungu awadima wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:23">mna awasulumiza wose wakukeduvya kwa yadya yawawagile.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Mnde wadahi na kukegela moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 31:24">nyose mkumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s">Kinyemi cha kuusilwa wavu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Wana kinyemi wausilwe wavu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:1">niyo masa yawe yajaligwa.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Ana kinyemi yudya hee kuwazwa mwo wiihi ni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:2">uyo heena nyambi mwo moyo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Umwo nandaga hinati nilonge kindedi cho wavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:3">nabunt'hikaga kwa kuila msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Kilo na msi noukanisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">ludole lwangu lwasilaga pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:4">nehinda enga mazi yanyazigwe ni zuwa dya kiangazi.<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Niho nalongaga kindedi cho wavu wangu kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">naho hifisile maihi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:5">nawe niyo wayagubika masa yo wavu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Ivo wahuwilwa wose nawalombeze kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">kwaviya weye wiyaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">umwo malao ya makunt'ho yakalaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:6">houdahe kuwakubila.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Weye niwe gomela dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">wayakindila makunt'ho yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:7">nounizunguluse mila ya uyokozi.<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Naho Mnungu agamba, “Nohusigiile na kukuhiniza sila zo komboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:8">nohulangilize na kukukaulisa vedi.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Usekunda enga falasi hegu nyumbu hezikukombaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:9">zikuunga kulongozwa kwa mikoa na makube niho zikutimile.”<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Mnt'hu mwiihi ana makunt'ho mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:10">mna lukunde lwawazengela gomela wose wa kumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Nyuwe wawagilwa, yangeni kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">kwajili ya kiya awatendeleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 32:11">nyuwe mkumwiva yehe yangeni kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hunyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Mkemeleni kwa kinyemi Zumbe Mnungu nyose mno uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">mwangileni kwa yadya adamaye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:1">mwink'heni nt'hogola nyuwe mkutimila yadya yakumwelela.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu, mtoeleni mazeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:2">mkemeleni mila kwa kutowa zeze dina nyuzi.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Mkemeleni wila mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:3">mtoeleni kinubi kwa umanyi niyo mwanga kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Mbuli ya Zumbe Mnungu ni ya kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:4">naho yose akudamanya ni uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Zumbe Mnungu aungisa uwagilwa no uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:5">lukunde lwa Zumbe Mnungu holwiina uheelo, lumemeza isi.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Mbingu ziumbwa kwa ulosi wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:6">zuwa, mnenge, ne zint'hondo ni kwa kiya alongile.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Kaziduganya zibahali zose hant'hu hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:7">mina ye bahali kaivugaila mwe zimp'hako za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Si yose zimwogohe Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:8">want'hu wose we si mtunyeni yeye.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Alongaga niyo vanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:9">kwa mbuli yakwe kila kint'hu kilaila.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Zumbe Mnungu ausa miyanyiko ya want'hu wa si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:10">ausa ne mizungu yawe.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Mna mizungu ya Zumbe Mnungu ni ya mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:11">naho yadya akuunga hayana uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Wana kinyemi awo, Mnungu ywawe akanda ni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:12">want'hu awasagule mwenye kunda wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Zumbe Mnungu akaula aha hasi kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:13">yehe awaona want'hu wose.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Kulawa kwe difumbi dyakwe dyo useuta akaula uku hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:14">awaona wose wakwikala mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Uyo niye aumbile miyoyo ya want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:15">kamanya kila kiya want'hu wakudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Seuta hakupata uhumi no ukulu we difyo dyakwe dya watowani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:16">naho mtowani mdahi hakukombolwa nu ludole lwakwe lukulu.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Falasi za nk'hondo hazikwigala uhumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:17">naho ludole lwawe lukulu halukudaha kuyokola mnt'hu.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Zumbe Mnungu awakaula wadya wakutenda viya akuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:18">wadya wakuhuwila lukunde lwakwe lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />Vileke awayokole ne file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:19">mwo msimo we digumbo.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Suwe chamkawiila Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:20">yehe niye wambizi wetu na nk'hindo yetu.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Mwa yehe suwe kina kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:21">kwaviya chahuwila mwe dizina dyakwe dikukile.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, lukunde lwako helwiina uheelo lwikale mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 33:22">kwaviya suwe chakuhuwila weye.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo kwa uwedi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Nenimtunye Zumbe Mnungu mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:1">nt'huyo yakwe heifose mwo mnomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Miye nenikeduvile mwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:2">wadya wabeligwe weve naho wande na kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Nyuwe na miye kibwelekeze kugamba Zumbe Mnungu ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:3">kwa hamwenga kiditunyeni dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Nalombezaga wambizi kwa Zumbe Mnungu niyo anihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:4">aniyokolaga mwo kogoha kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Wose wakuunga wamkauwiile yehe, nawande na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:5">naho woho hawageligwe soni.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Mkiwa amwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu niyo apata uhituzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:6">niyo ahonywa mwa makunt'ho yakwe yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Mtumigwa wa kwe mbingu naawazunguluke wose wakumwiva Zumbe Mungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:7">naawayokole mwa maihi yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Gezeni mmuone Zumbe Mnungu ivo eli ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:8">wana kinyemi wose wakumhuwila.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Mwogoheni Zumbe nyuwe wakukile wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:9">kwaviya wose wakumwogoha hawahungukilwe ni kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Simba zahungukilwagwa niyo zalumwa ni sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:10">mna wakumwogoha Zumbe Mnungu hawahungukilwe ni chochose chedi.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Nyuwe wana, hake soni kwangu mnitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:11">neni wahinizeni kumwogoha Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Togola waugisa ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:12">na kumunk'hila mazuwa mengi naho yedi?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />kedime usekulonga maihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:13">naho mwo mnomo wako msekunda na udant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Usekudamanya yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:14">zungula utondowazi na kuutimila.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Zumbe Mnungu awakaulisa wawagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:15">naho ategeleza wakamwiila.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Mna awahiga wose wakudamanya maihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:16">awatenda wajaligwe mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Wawagilwa wakalombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:17">Zumbe Mnungu awategeleza na kuwayokola mwa makunt'ho yawe yose.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Zumbe Mnungu ehagihi na wose wafile chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:18">awambiza waswesile kawiilo.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Wawagilwa wandilisa na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:19">mna Zumbe Mnungu awayokola.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Zumbe naawadime vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:20">hakihali chochose nekibanike mwo wikazi wawe.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Wiihi wawakoma awo wakuutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:21">wakuwaihiya wawagilwa nawasulumizwe.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Zumbe Mnungu aukombola ugima wa wandima wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 34:22">wose wakunyilikila kwakwe hawaone masulumizo.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuyokolwa mwa wank'hondo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, wahige wadya wakuhigana na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:1">naho watowe wadya wakutowana na miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Uguhe nk'hindo zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:2">wize unambize.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Inula mjungo ne majabia yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">uwahige awo wakunitimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:3">ulagane kugamba niweye nouniyokole.<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Wagelwe soni na kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wose awo wakuunga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wavuzwe kunyuma kwa kwazaganywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:4">wose wakuniikila mizungu ya wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Wande enga mabunt'hi yakwinulwa ni mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:5">umwo wakakulumbuzwa ni mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Sila yawe inde lwiza na kuteela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:6">umwo mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu akawakulumbuza.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Kwaviya waninikila lwinika haheina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:7">haheina dyodyose nibanage, wanisimbila luka nihubugile.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Ubanangi uweziile kipump'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">wagwilwe mwo lwinika wawe wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:8">naho wahubugile mwe diluka dyawe wasimbile.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Name nenimwangile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:9">nenione kinyemi kwaviya kaniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Nenimgambe Zumbe Mnungu kwo moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">“Hahali yeyose enga weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">wawagombela wasokezi kwa wata ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:10">watowanila wakiwa kwa wahoki.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Walonga uwona heweina mbazi walundumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:11">wanilongeleza kwa mbuli heziihali.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Waniliha maihi kwa ayedi nidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:12">niyo name nanda hiina ludole.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Mna miye navalaga magunia kwa kinyulu umwo woho wakanda wanyonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">nakesulumizaga kwa kufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:13">miye nalombezaga kwa kufunamiza mtwi hasi,<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />nangadikaga uko na uko enga nehawahongezela wambuya zangu na wandugu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:14">naho enga mnt'hu akuhongeza file ya nine.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Wose wandaga na kinyemi miye handa na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">naho niyo wanizunguluka waka nitendela lubezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">watakwiza nawo wanitowaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:15">haheina kuleka.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Wandaga enga want'hu hewe mmanyize Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:16">wanitendelaga lubezo, wanihomolaga na kuniihiya.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Zumbe, nouyakaule aya mpaka ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">Niyokole mwa kunikump'hukila kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:17">uniyokole kulawa mwe zisimba izo.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Name nohutogole mwo mdugano mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:18">nohutogole ha want'hu wengi.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Usekuwaleka wank'hondo wangu wakeduvye kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">awo wakuniihiya haheina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:19">vileke waonele kinyemi makunt'ho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Kwaviya milosi yawe hiyo ya utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:20">woho wabwelekeza mbuli za lulimi kwa want'hu wakwikala vedi mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Wanilongeleza kwa kubongeela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:21">wakagamba, “Kimuona suwe wenye akadamanya ayo!”<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Zumbe Mnungu kuiona mbuli iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">ivo elo usekunyamala ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:22">naho usekunda hale na miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Inuka weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu unigombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:23">wize weye Zumbe Mnungu ulamule amasa yangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Haya sengela weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu mwo uwagilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:24">naho usekuwalekela wank'hondo wangu wakaonela kinyemi makunt'ho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Use kuwalekela wakakegamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">“Haluse kaheza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:25">ivi nivo nekikaunga ande!”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Woho wagelwe soni na kwaganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wakuona kinyemi kwaviya nakunt'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">wagubikwe ni soni na kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:26">na wose wakukeona kunda wedi kujink'ha miye.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Wande na kinyemi na kwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">wadya wakwelelwa nu uwagilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">nawalonge mazuwa yose, “Zumbe ni mkulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:27">akwelelwa ni uhumi wa mndima ywakwe.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Name lulimi lwangu nolulonge uwagilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 35:28">naho nohutunye msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s">Wiihi wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Wiihi walonga na mnt'hu aihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">wandilisa mwo moyo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:1">mbuli ya kumvika Zumbe Mnungu haimuli mwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Mwiihi akeduvya yehe mwenye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:2">akafanyanya kugamba wiihi wakwe houmanyike na kuligitwa.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Icho naalonge ni lulimi naho ni uwiihi du.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:3">Kaleka kutimila umanyi na kudamanya ayedi.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Umwo akagona afanyanya yaihile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">naho atimila mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:4">hegu hakulekana no wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwedi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu lukunde lwako lugenyela hata kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:5">uhuwilwa wako ubula kwa mavunde.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Uwagilwa wako ni enga mnima mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">usengelo wako ni enga mina ye bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:6">weye Zumbe Mnungu wawamila want'hu na viumbwa vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Lukunde lwako holukusila ni lwedi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:7">want'hu wagulukila kwe kizuli cha mawawa yako.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Wawegusa kwa ugoli we nyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:8">wanywa mazi kulawa mwo mto wo uwedi wako.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Weye ni weye chotoko cho ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:9">kwa ung'azi wako chauwona un'gazi.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Ugendeele kulagisa lukunde wadya wose wakukuvika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:10">utendese kunda ywedi kwa wadya awedi.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Usekuzumila wata weduvi wanikump'hukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:11">hegu want'hu waihi waniguluse.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Awo wakudamanya yaihile wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 36:12">wagwelesa hasi hehali akudaha kuwenula.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s">Uheelo wa mnt'hu mwavu na mnt'hu muwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Usekupata makunt'ho kwajili ya waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:1">usekuwaonela finju wakudamanya yaihile.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Kwaviya awo nawasunguze kubanangwa pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:2">nawanyale enga mabwali mateke.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu na kudamanya ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:3">vileke wikale mwe isi na kunda na utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Uzungule kinyemi chako kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:4">yehe naye naakwink'he yadya ukuyaunga mwo moyo wako.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Mwink'he Zumbe Mnungu wikazi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:5">mhuwile yehe naye naakwambize.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Naautende uwedi wako unde enga ung'azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:6">uwagilwa wako enga zuwa dya nomsi.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Ikala ha Zumbe Mnungu naho umgoje kwa kufinyiliza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">Usekupata kiyangayanga kwa wadya wakupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:7">want'hu wakupata mwe mizungu yawe ihile.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Usekunda na maya hegu kuihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:8">kwaviya ayo yongezela uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Want'hu wakudamanya yaihile nawabanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:9">mna kwa wadya wakumvika Zumbe Mnungu nawande wakipe mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Kwaviya hakei ludodo mwiihi naabanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:10">hata mkamzungula homumuone.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Mna wakukeseleza naweikaile isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:11">naho nawekale kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Mwiihi amwiihiya mnt'hu ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:12">na kumtendela uwihi,<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />mna Zumbe Mnungu amseka mwiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:13">kwaviya kamanya uheelo wakwe wi hagihi.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Want'hu wavu waguha jambia na nyuta zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wakaunga wawakome want'hu wakiwa naho heweena kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:14">wawachinje wakwikala kwa kutimila malagizo ya Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />mna sime zawe neziwakome woho wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:15">naho nyuta zawe nezivunwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Ni vedi ugoli mgeke wa mnt'hu ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:16">kujink'ha ugoli ubindile wingi wa want'hu wavu,<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />kwaviya udahi wa want'hu wavu noubanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:17">mna Zumbe Mnungu awamila want'hu wata uwedi.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Zumbe Mnungu amila wikazi wa want'hu wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:18">ukipe wawe nawo noukale mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Hawaone makunt'ho yakabula mazuwa ya yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:19">mazuwa ya gumbo nawande na nk'hande zimemile.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Mna waihile nawabanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:20">wank'hondo wa Mnungu nawanyale enga mabwali ya kwe mbago, kwaviya nawahauke enga mosi.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Mnt'hu mwavu aguha cha mnt'hu haheina kuvuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:21">mna mnt'hu ywedi alava kwa ukise.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />Wavikilwe ni Zumbe Mnungu nawande wakipe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:22">mna waligitwe ni Mnungu nawabanangwe pele.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Sila za mnt'hu ywedi Zumbe Mnungu azilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:23">naho amwamila yudya akumwelela,<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />hata anakobadika haagwe hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:24">kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu amwinula.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Nehinda mbwanga haluse ni mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hyaonaga mnt'hu ywedi alekigwe ni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:25">hegu wana wawe wakalombeza lombeza nk'hande.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Mazuwa yose awenk'ha watuhu kwa kinyemi na kuwakopesha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:26">wanawe nawo ni uvikilwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Lekana na wiihi, udamanye uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:27">weye nawe nowikale mwe isi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu aunga uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">naho hakuwaleka wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">awamila awo mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:28">mna welekwa wa waihi noubanangwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Want'hu wedi nawande wakipe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:29">naho nawekale uumwo mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Mnomo wa mta uwagilwa alonga mbuli za umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:30">kwa lulimi lwakwe alonga ya kindedi.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Aizumila sigilizi ya Mnungu ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:31">yehe naye hakuzembeduka mwo lugendo lwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Mnt'hu mwiihi amnyatila mnt'hu ywedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:32">na kugeza kumkoma,<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />mna Zumbe Mnungu hamleke mnt'hu ywedi mwo udahi wa mnt'hu aihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:33">hegu kumwasa asezengwe na alongelezwe haheina lema.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu na kutoza sigilizi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">yehe naye naakuvikile uikaile isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:34">na kuona waihi wakabanangwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Nehimuona mnt'hu aihise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:35">akekwezaga kulanga enga miti ya mielezi ya Lebanoni,<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />akajika aho nombokaga aho naho hyambwiilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:36">namzungulaga mna haonekaga naho,<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Mkaule mnt'hu ywedi naho mhuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:37">mnt'hu akuungisa utondowazi naande na cheleko,<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />mna waihi wose nawabanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:38">welekwa wawe nawo nawasile pele.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Zumbe Mnungu awayokola want'hu wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:39">naho awamila mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Zumbe Mnungu awambiza na kuwayokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">awayokola mwa want'hu waihile na kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 37:40">kwaviya wagulukila utondowazi kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Zumbe Mnungu, usekunikanya kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:1">naho usekuni sengela kwa maya yako yatendese.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Misale yako initunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:2">mkono wako unibwiila.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Hahana hant'hu hedi mwo mwili wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwaviya kuniihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">hahana hant'hu hana uwedi mwa mavuha yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:3">kwajili yo wavu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Higubikwa vitendese nu wavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:4">naho wanizamila enga, nt'hwika izamile kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Nk'hwenge zangu ziola na kununk'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:5">ayo nayo ni kwaajili yo uhezi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Hifunama mpaka hasi na kuvunika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:6">msi wose nazungulukaga hahongeza.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Mgongo wangu uhambigwa ni maine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:7">mwo mwili wangu wose hamna wedi wowose.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Hitigint'hika na kuhondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:8">nasulumila mwo moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Zumbe ywangu weye kumanya kawiilo dyangu dyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:9">kwako hakihali kikukefisa.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Moyo wangu wagulukisa, ludole lwangu lusila pele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:10">Hata meso yangu nayo yakonga kwaza kuona.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Wambwiyazangu na weyangu wanyilika kuyaona makunt'ho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:11">wandugu zangu nawo wekala hale na miye.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Wakuunga wanikome wanitegela mitego yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">wakuunga nilumile wanitisa kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:12">msi wose waika mzungu iihile mwa miye.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Mna miye hinda hikwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:13">naho hikudaha kulonga kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Heiye hinda mnt'hu hekwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:14">enga mnt'hu heena chochose cha kukegombela.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Mna nakuhuwila weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:15">weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu ni weye nounihitule.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Nakulombeza du kugamba, wank'hondo wanase kunda na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:16">wakangila kuhumwa kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Nihagihi na kuhumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:17">nagojelwa na masulumizo ya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Nalombeza unilekele uwihi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:18">wavu wangu wanink'ha kinyulu.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Wank'hondo wangu wabinda wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:19">wadya wakuniihiya haheina lema hawakuwazika.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Awo wakuniliha yaihile kwa yadya ayedi niwadamanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:20">wanihiga kwaviya nadamanya ayedi.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Unase kuniduula Zumbe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:21">Zumbe Mnungu unase kwikala hale na miye.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Usunguze kunizila unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 38:22">Zumbe Mnungu ywo uyokozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s">Kweiila kwa mnt'hu akusulumila</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Nagambaga, “Nenidime wikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">sema nnadamanye wavu kwa milongele yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:1">neninyamale umwo waihi wangu wakanda hagihi na miye.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Mna umwo nanyamalaga enga kimumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">haheina kulonga dyodyose dyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:2">makunt'ho yangu yatendesaga kunda madala,<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />kwangadika kwangu nalumilaga mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">umwo nafanyanyaga nivo naangadikaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:3">niyo mbuli izi zanilawa.<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Zumbe Mnungu ywangu unigambile uheelo wo wikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">mazuwa yangu yo kwikala mwe isi yasigala mengahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:4">Vileke nimanye ivo yakusunguza komboka.”<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Kaula kunihimila wikazi mgihi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">wikazi wangu hiyo kint'hu hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:5">kindedi kila mnt'hu ni enga muye du.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Kindedi kila mnt'hu omboka enga kizuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">kukombeka kwake kose hiyo kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:6">aduganya ugoli haheina kumanya niani naapate.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />Haluse Zumbe ni kihi hukawiila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:7">Kawiilo dyangu di kwako weye.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Uniyokole mwo wiihi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:8">usekuzumila wahezi wanibele.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Hinyamala enga kimumu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:9">kwaviya weye ni weye udamanye ayo.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Usekunisulumiza naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:10">nabindilikila kwa masulumizo yako.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Umwo ukamsengela mnt'hu kwa wavu wakwe kwa kumkanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">wahausa uwedi enga mswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:11">kindedi kila mnt'hu ni enga muye du.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />Wive malombezo yangu Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">wive ndilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">wive ivo huila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">Kwaviya miye ni enga mta kwiza du akomboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:12">ni mtafi enga wadala wetu wose ivo wandaga.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Nilekele nisangaale mwa meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 39:13">umwo hinati kubanika na kulawa mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s">Ukemi wa nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Nehimgoja Zumbe Mnungu kwa uhuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:1">anivaga indilo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Anihausaga mwe dibome diihise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">naho anihausaga mwe nt'hope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">na kuniika hant'hu hatondowale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:2">na kuniika vedi lugendo lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Anihinizaga wila mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">ukemi wa kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">want'hu wabindile wingi nawogohe na kuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:3">na kumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Ana kinyemi mnt'hu yudya akumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">mnt'hu hekukelunganya na want'hu wakukeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:4">want'hu wasaguke wa kuvika milungu yawe yo udant'hi.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu, kudamanyila mbuli zibindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">naho mizungu yako mwetu heikuwazika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">kudamanya mbuli za kweheela kwetu, naho hakuli naadahe kuikimalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">neniyabwelekeze na kuyalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:5">mna yabinda wingi mwo kuyasimuila.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Weye hukuunga nt'hambiko hegu malavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">mna kukomola magutwi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:6">malavo ya kokwa na malavo ya kuusila wavu huyaungile<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Naho nalongaga, “Ni miye aha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:7">ayo huungwa nidamanye yawandikwa mwe kitabu che sigilizi.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Kukint'hiza yadya ukuunga mwangu ni kinyemi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:8">sigilizi yako hiitozesa kwa moyo wangu wose.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Hisimuila mbuli zedi zo uyokozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">ho mduganyo mkulu wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">enga ivo ukumanya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:9">miye hilemele kuibwelekeza.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Hilekile kulonga uwagilwa wako unink'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">hibwelekeza mazuwa yose kugamba ni weye myokozi mhuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">hiufisile lukunde lwako mwo mdugano mkulu wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:10">uwedi wako na uhuwilwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu usekunikindila uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:11">uwedi wako na uhuwilwa wako, waniamilaga mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malombezo yo wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Makunt'ho heyekuwazika yanizungulukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">wavu wangu wanigwilaga, hyadahaga kuuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">watendesaga kunda mwingi kujink'ha zifili zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:12">miyename hifa chefu.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Uunge mwenye Zumbe Mnungu kuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:13">Zumbe Mnungu usunguze kwiza kunambiza.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Wakuunga kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">wengile soni na kuona kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">awo wakuunga nisulumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:14">naho wadunduge na kuhuza.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Awo wakunibela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:15">wahuze na kuhumwa kwawe.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Mna wadya wose wakukuzungula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wande na kinyemi na kwanga kwajili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wakuungisa uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:16">wagambe mazuwa yose, “Zumbe Mnungu ni mkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Miye ni mkiwa na heena kint'hu Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">mna weye Zumbe wanikumbukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">ni weye uyokozi wangu naho mwambizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 40:17">usunguze kwiza Zumbe ywangu!<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo mwo unyonge</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Ni vedi kwa mnt'hu yudya akuwakaula wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:1">Zumbe Mnungu naamuyokole mwo lupisi lwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Zumbe Mnungu naamwamile na kumuyokola ugima wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">naho naavikilwe mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:2">Mnungu haamleke mwa wank'hondo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Zumbe Mnungu naamwambize umwo akanda mnyonge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:3">naho naamhonye unyonge wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Naho niyo nagamba, “Miye name univikile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:4">unionele mbazi kwaviya hikutendela wavu.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Wank'hondo wangu walonga vihile mwangu wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:5">“Naabanike ini vileke zina dyakwe dijaligwe?”<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Umwo wakanitalamkila walonga mbuli nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">wakaduganya maihi mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:6">umwo wakabula kuse wawabwelekezele watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Wose wakuniihiya watakamizana mwa miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:7">wakanifanyanyila yaihile ya kunibananga,<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />wakagamba, “Maine aya nayamkome</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:8">naho heenuke mwo lusazi.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Hata mbwiyangu namhuwile mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">uyo nadile naye nk'hande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:9">kanihituka na kuunga nibanikilwe.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Zumbe Mnungu unionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:10">unink'he uwedi na miye nilihize kikoda.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Ivo nenimanye kugamba miye nakwelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:11">wank'hondo wangu wanase kukeduvya mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Weye kunihuwila kwaviya nadamanya uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:12">naho waniika hako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 41:13">kukongela ivi haluse, na mazuwa yose! Taile! Taile!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mnt'hu ehale na kwakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Enga swala ikuunga mazi mwe kazuto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:1">nivo hukuungisa Zumbe Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Naona nk'hilu ya Mnungu, Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:2">nenibule ini na kuiona futa yakwe?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Masozi yanda nk'hande yangu msi na kilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:3">umwo wakanigamba, “Ekuhi Mnungu ywako?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Nakumbukila naho mbuli izi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">kwa usungu mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">enga ivo niitile na fyo kulu idi dya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">na kuwalongoza kwe nyumba ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">wakatoa nk'helegele zo uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:4">na fyo dya want'hu niyo wadamanya zuwa dye kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Nii nanda na kinyulu mwo moyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Nii naho naangadika mwo moyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">Namhuwila Mnungu, naho nenimtunye naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:5">yehe niye wambizi wangu na Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Hinda na kinyulu mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">ivo nakukumbukila weye Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">Kulawa Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:6">na kulawa mwo mnima wa Helimoni na Mizali.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Mto una mwina uujink'ha mtuhu,neva izwi dya lubant'ha lwa mazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:7">mjubwaniso wako na malao yako yanididimiza.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Zumbe Mnungu naanilagise lukunde lwakwe nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">miye name nenimkimele ukemi wa nt'hogola aho nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:8">na kumlombeza Mnungu anink'he ugima.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Namgamba Mnungu mdahi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">“Nii kunijala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">Nii niite uko na uko hahongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:9">kwa kuhujilwa na wank'hondo wangu?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Hihomoleswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">umwo wakaniuza kila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:10">“Ehahi Mnungu ywako?”<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Nii nenda na kinyulu mwo moyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Nii naho naangadika mwo moyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">Namhuwila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">kwaviya nenimtunye Mnungu naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 42:11">yehe niye wambizi wangu na Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya mnt'hu hale na kwawe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Lagisa kugamba hina masa Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">unigombele mwa want'hu waihile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:1">uniyokole mwa want'hu waihile na walulimi.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Nagulukila kwako kwo utondowazi Mnungu ywangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Nii kunda hale na miye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">Nii niite uko na uko hahongeza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:2">kwa kuhujilwa ni wank'hondo wangu?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Wigale ung'azi wako na ukindedi wako unilongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">unigale mwo mnima wako ukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:3">kwe nyumba yako.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Aho neniite kwe kilingo chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">nenize kwako kwa kinyemi kikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:4">nohutunye kwa zeze weye Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Nii nenda na kinyulu mwo moyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Nii nangadika ivo mwo moyo wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">Nohuhuwile Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 43:5">naho nohutunye kwaviya weye niwe Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Mnungu suwe kiva suwe wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">wakale wetu wakisimuila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:1">mbuli izo udamanye uko kale.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Kwa udahi wako mwenye wawagulusaga want'hu wa si nt'uhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">na hant'hu hawe niyo wawaika want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">naho wawasengelaga want'hu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:2">na kuwatenda want'hu wako wagenyele<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Want'hu wako hawaitahile isi kwa vitoanilo vawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">hegu hawapataga uhumi kwa ludole lwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">mna ni kwa ludole na udahi kwa uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:3">kwaviya weye wawaungisaga.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Weye niwe seuta ywangu na Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:4">wawatendaga welekwa wa Yakobo wande wahumi.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Kwa udahi wako chawahuma wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:5">kwa zina dyako chawajata wakukibela.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Miye hikuhuwila uta wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:6">hegu sime iniyokole,<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />mna ni weye ukiyokole mwa wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:7">wawagelaga soni wadya wakukiihiya.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Mazuwa yose nekikutumye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:8">naho nekikutogole mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Mna wakilekaga niyo chahumwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:9">hwi hamwenga na watowani wetu naho.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Kukitenda kiwanyilike wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:10">woho nawo niyo wataha ugoli wetu.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Kukitenda enga ngoto zikuita kwo kuchinjwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:11">niyo chasambala mwe ziisi zint'huhu.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Kuwataga want'hu wako kwa yombe dodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:12">huungile kuuza diyombe dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Kukitenda kibeligwe ni want'hu wa hagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:13">wakizunguke kwe mihaka yetu wakiseka.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Kukitenda kibeligwe na na si nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:14">watakwiza wakibela na kukiona hi kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Msi wose wanibela du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:15">futa yangu nayo ingila soni,<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />kwa milosi na mabelo yawe ya kunihomola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:16">na kunda hagihi na wank'hondo na wakuniihiya.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Ayo yose yakibwiila suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">enga viya hakikujaile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:17">hegu kubananga ndagano yako.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Hakikulekile weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:18">hegu kuleka sila zako.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Mna ivo kukileka mwa makala yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:19">naho kukileka mwe diziza ditendese.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Uneva chakujaile weye Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:20">na kuvika milungu yo udant'hi,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />Zumbe Mnungu kumanya kale mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:21">kwaviya weye wazimanya fanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Kwaviya kihagihi no kubanika kwajili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:22">chadamanyilwa enga ngoto zikwigalwa kwo kuchinjwa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Inuka Zumbe! Nii kugona?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:23">Setuka sema unakiduule mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Nii wakefisa hale na suwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:24">na kujala makunt'ho na masulumizo yetu?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Kigwa hasi mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:25">kigwa kifulifuli mwo luvumbi.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Winuke wize uchambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 44:26">ukikombole kwa lukunde lwako.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa ndoza ya kiseuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Moyo wangu umema fanyanyi zedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">himtuwila wila seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:1">lulimi lwangu ni enga kalamu ya mwandishi ywedi.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Weye ywi mbwanga kujink'ha want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">mbuli zako ni zedi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:2">kwaviya Mnungu kakuvikila mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Kekake sime yako mtowani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:3">weye ni mkulu naho mta nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Ukulu wako ugenyele upate uhumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">mwo kwikaila falasi ugombele ikindedi, kukeseleza na kwamila uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:4">mkono wako wa kulume ulagise udamanyi mkulu wa kweheela.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Misale yako yatwelesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">yawalasa wank'hondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:5">want'hu wa si zose yagwa ahako.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Weye Mnungu difumbi dyako dyo ukulu ditoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">nedikale mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:6">weye wawalongoza want'hu wako kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Waungisa uwedi naho wauihiya uwavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">kwaivo Mnungu ywako kakusagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:7">na kukuink'ha kinyemi kujink'ha weyawo.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Mavalo yako yana mhemp'he wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:8">wakemi wakubwedeza mwe nyumba, ihambigwe na mp'hembe ze nt'hembo.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Wanakike wa maseuta ni wamwenga mwa wavele wa nt'hunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">naho kulume kwako kakimala mwali ywe ndoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:9">kavala mahambo ya zahabu yedi kulawa Ofili.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Tegeleza weye mwana kike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">ika gutwi dyako wivilise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:10">haluse jala want'hu mwe isi yako na wanduguzo.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Undele wako wamtenda seuta akumunk'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">yehe ni zumbe ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:11">vaungwa umwive.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Wanakike wa Tilo nawakwigaile geleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:12">wagoli nawaunge kukehembeleza kwako.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Mwana kike ywa seuta ana kinyemi vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:13">valo dyakwe disumigwa kwa uzi una langi ya zahabu,<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />akanda kavala valo dya langi nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">akalongozwa kwa seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">asindikizwa ni wambizi wakwe, wali na mazanga weyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:14">woho nawo wegalwa kwako seuta,<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />kwa kinyemi na kwanga wabula uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:15">na kwingila mwe dizumba dye kiseuta.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Seuta noupate wana wabindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">nawalongoze hant'hu ha wakale wawe enga maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:16">nouwatende wekaile si yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Neniditende zina dyako dikumbukilwe mwe vyeleko vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 45:17">na ivo want'hu wose nawo nawakutunye mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu ehamwenga na suwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Mnungu ni unyilikilo wetu naho ludole lwetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:1">yehe ni wambizi wetu mwo lupisi lwose lwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Kwaivo hechogohe chochose umwo isi ikeza kusingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:2">milima nayo ikazingiza kwe kisingisa icho,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />Hata uneva bahali neinde mwo kujubwanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:3">milima nayo ikasingisika kwa mjubwaniso uwo.<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Kuna kazuto kakwigala kinyemi mwo mzi wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:4">kwo ukalo wa Mnungu mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Mnungu eyaho ho mzi, woho haukudaha kusingiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:5">yehe naakink'he wambizi mtondotondo.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Want'hu wa si nawengile wogohi mkulu, useuta nawo nowituke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:6">Mnungu atint'hilaga niyo si yalungulumka.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Zumbe Mnungu ywa watowani ehamwenga na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:7">Mnungu ywa Yakobo nuwo unyilikilo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Soni mkaule udamanyi wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:8">mkaule vihungi ivo adamanye mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Atenda nk'hondo ihalawe mwe isi yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">avunavuna zinyuta ne mijungo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:9">na nk'hindilo nazo azoka.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />Akagamba, “Nyamaleni mkamanya ni miye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">miye nenitogolwe mwe ziisi zose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:10">naho nenitunywe mwe si yose.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Zumbe Mnungu ywa watowani ehamwenga na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 46:11">Mnungu ywa Yakobo naho ni unyilikilo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye mkulu mwe si yose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Want'hu wose toweni magasa kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:1">mwangileni Mnungu kwa maizwi makulu,<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu mta ukulu wa kogofya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:2">yehe ni Seuta Mkulu ywa si yose.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Kakink'ha uhumi mkulu mwe si yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:3">kakitenda wadahi mwa want'hu wose wakwikala mwe ziisi.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Kakisaguila isi ino inde yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:4">iyo akukeduvila Yakobo, uyo amuungise.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Mnungu akwelesa kulanga kwe difumbi dyakwe dya kiseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">yeyuko maizwi ya kinyemi na magunda yakutoigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:5">umwo Zumbe akakwela kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Mtogoleni Mnungu kwa ukemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:6">seuta ywetu kwa mila,<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />kwaviya yehe niye Seuta mwe si yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:7">mtogoleni kwa kumkemela mila.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Mnungu kekala mwe difumbi dyakwe dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:8">yehe ni mta udahi mwa want'hu wa si yose.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Wakulu wa si yose wakeduganya enga want'hu wa Mnungu ywa Ibulahimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">kwaviya maseuta wa mwe si ni wakwe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 47:9">yehe ni ywa kulanga vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s">Sayuni mzi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niye mkulu awagilwe kutogoleswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:1">mwo mzi wa Mnungu ywetu, mnima wakwe ukuka.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Mnima Sayuni uhombweela mwo utali wakwe kuita kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">chotoko cha kinyemi mwe si yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">waligana na mnima Zafoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:2">ni mzi mkulu wa seuta mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Mnungu niye gomela dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:3">yehe kakelaviliza mwenye kunda mwamizi ywakwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Maseuta waduganya hamwenga watowani wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:4">niyo waita hamwenga wakautowe mzi wa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Mna weheelwagwa weze waone ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:5">wogohesaga niyo wanyilika.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Wengilwagwa ni kizingizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:6">na usungu enga mvele ehagihi na kwingila nyumba,<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />wawakomaga enga meli zitogile za Talishishi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:7">zabogozolwagwa ni nk'hung'unt'ho ya ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Ayo kivile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">nayo kione,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">mwo mzi wa Mnungu ywetu, mta udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:8">uwo naaudime mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Mwe nyumba yako weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:9">chafanyanya lukunde lwako holwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Weye Zumbe enga ivo zina dyako dikutunywa kila hant'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">naho walongoza kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:10">kwa mkono wako kudamanya yakuwagila.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Want'hu wa Sayuni nawande na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">wakwikala mwo mizi ya Yuda nawange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:11">kwajili yo usengelo wako wo uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Iteni mkauzunguluke mzi na kuwaza vigela vakwe.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Kauleni zink'handula zakwe na magomela yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:13">vileke mwize muwasimulizile welekwa wakwiza.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />“Uyu Mnungu ni ywa mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 48:14">naakilongoze lupisi lwose lukwiza.”<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s">Kukawiila ugoli ni uhezi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Mwive nyuwe nyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:1">mtegeleze nyose mkwikala mwe si ino,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />wata nt'hogola na wadya wabeligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:2">wagoli na wakiwa hamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Nenilonge mbuli za mizungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:3">fanyanyi zo moyo wangu zegala ukombaganyi.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Nenitegelezese milosi ye zingelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:4">no kufyambula lusimo umwo hatowa dizeze.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Miye henogohe mwa mazua yo wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:5">umwo hatemangizwa ni wiihi wa wank'hondo,<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />awo wakukawiila viya wananavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:6">no kukedivila ugoli wawe.<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Hahali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kukombola wikazi wa miyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:7">hegu akudaha kulava maliho ya kugula ugima wakwe kwa Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />kwaviya maliho yo ugima wetu yakulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:8">naho hahana maliho yoyose nayakint'he,<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />vileke yakitende kikale mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:9">naho asekubanika.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Kwaviya wose waona kugamba, hata wata mizungu wabanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">wahezi na wabwalasi wose wabwiilwa ni file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:10">no kuwasa ugoli wawe kwa want'hu watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Vikuta nizo zikaya zawe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">nawekale uumwo lupisi lwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:11">hamwenga na kugamba wandaga na nk'honde zawe wenye.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Hamwenga no kutogolwa kwakwe, mnt'hu haakehonye ne file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:12">yehe naye naabanike enga viumbwa vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Nuwo uheelo wa wose wahezi wakukeduvila ugoli wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:13">na wadya wakuwatimila na kuzumila yadya wakulonga,<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Nawolongozwe enga ngoto kuita kwo kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">ifile neinde nuyo mdimi ywawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">nawajatangizwe ni wawagilwa wa Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">vimba vawe neviole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:14">kwe isi ya wabanike hale ne zikaya zawe.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Mna Mnungu naanikombole kulawa mwo udahi we file.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:15">Mna ikindedi yehe naaniyokole no ludole lwo kubanika.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Usekuona kinyulu mnt'hu akanda mgoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:16">akandilisa na vint'hu vingi,<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />kwaviya mwo kubanika kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:17">ugoli wakwe haaite nawo kwe kikuta.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Hata uneva mnt'hu mwo ugima wakwe ana kila kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:18">na kutogoleswa kwajili yo upati wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />naande hamwenga na wakale wakwe wamlongowele kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:19">hawaone ung'azi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Mnt'hu mta ugoli heheina ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 49:20">nawabwiilwe ni file du enga viumbwa vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s">Mviko we kindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Zumbe Mnungu mdahi kalonga niyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:1">aduganya want'hu wa si yose usweelo mpaka ulailo wa zuwa.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Mnungu ang'aza kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:2">mzi ukint'hile kwa utana.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Mnungu ywetu eza haheina kunyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">moto ukoka tiki ukulongole kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:3">kazungulukwa ni nk'hung'unt'ho nk'hulu.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Azitanga zimbingu na si zinde waona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:4">zikaule umwo akawasengela want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Agamba, “Niduganyileni wahuwilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:5">wadya waikile ndagano na miye kwa kulava nt'hambiko.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Mbingu nazo zabilikiza uwagilwa wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:6">Mnungu mwenye niye mlamuzi.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />Nyuwe want'hu wangu tegelezeni, name neni longe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">neni walongelezeni nyuwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:7">ni miye Mnungu, Mnungu ywenyu.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Hikukufank'hila kwajili ye zint'hambiko zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:8">na malavo yako yo kokwa pele ukunilavila mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Hiyo kugamba naunga majeku yemwe didewa dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:9">hegu mbuzi za mwo mngo wako,<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />kwaviya makala yose mwe mabago, yangu miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:10">ne zing'ombe mwe milima maalufu, mwenye ni miye.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Madege ulanga yose, nayamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:11">naho viumbwa vose vimwe si, mwenye ni miye.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />“Uneva nandile na sala hegu hehakugambila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:12">kwaviya si na vose vimemile umwo, vangu miye.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Ivo miye ni ywa kudya nyama ya majeku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:13">hegu kunywa sakame ya mbuzi?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Mlavile Mnungu malavo ya nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:14">naho ukint'hize kiya ukelisile kumdamanyila yehe ekulanga vitendese.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Ukanitange mwe dizuwa dya makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">name nohuyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:15">nawe nounitunye.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Mna Mnungu amgamba mnt'hu mwavu ivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">“Una uwagilwa wani kubilikiza zisigilizi zangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:16">Naho wasimwiila vivihi indagano yangu?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Kwaviya wayaihiya mahinizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:17">na kuyallemela makanyo yangu.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Ukamuona mbavi wanda mbuya naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:18">mhabwasi naye watimilana naye.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Mnomo wako ni wa milosi iihile du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:19">lulimi nalo ni lwa kutula nyambi.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Kwikala lumwe kwa kuwateta wanduguzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:20">na kuwaziga wadya, mwelekanywe mamiyenyu yumwenga.”<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Kuyadamanya aya yose mna miye hinyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">weye wagamba miye ni enga weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">mna haluse nohufank'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:21">na kukulongeleza iivi ukakaula.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />“Myafanyanye ayo nyuwe mkumjala Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">Cheivo naawalwebuleni vilebetulebetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:22">naho hokunde na ywa kuwayokolani.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Akunilavila malavo ya nt'hogola niye akunogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 50:23">uyo akeikila lumwe sila vileke nimlagise uyokozi wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuusilwa masa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Weye Mnungu unionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwajili yo lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">uuse wavu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:1">kwo wingi we zimbazi zako.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Nisunt'he maihi yangu yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:2">naho unitende nikuke, nilawe mwo wavu.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Kwaviya hiyamanya malema yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:3">naho wavu wangu nauwona lupisi lwose.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Miye hikutendela wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">naho hidamanya maihi ho undiilo wako;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">Weye unde muwagilwa mwo kunisengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:4">usengelo wako haukukalalizwa.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Miye ni mwiihi kulawa mwo kwelekwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:5">nenda mta wavu kukongela aho nenuilwagwa ubovu kwa mwelesi ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Ikindedi, weye welelwa ni kindedi kikulawa kwo moyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:6">Unihinize mizungu kundani kwo moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Unisunt'he na kosombwe kakwitangwa hisopo name neninde hikuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:7">uusunt'he moyo wangu nawo noung'ale mbee.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Unitende ninde na kinyemi na kwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:8">yatende yande na kinyemi mavuha yadya uyahondile.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Usekuukaula wavu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:9">uuse uwihi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Umba moyo ukukile mwangu weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:10">unink'he miye moyo mh'ya naho wedi.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Use kunigulusa ho undiilo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:11">use kuusa mwangu muye wako ukukile.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Nivuzile kinyemi cho uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:12">unitende nikawiile kudamanya yadya ukuunga.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Aho niho neniwahinize wata wavu zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:13">nawo nawakuwiye.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Uniyokole mwa masa yangu yo ukomi weye Mnungu, Mnungu ywo uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:14">lulimi lwangu nolukeme kwa izwi kulu dya kinyemi kwajili yo uwagilwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Weye Zumbe unambize nilonge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:15">mnomo wangu ubwelekeze zint'hunyo zako.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Vandile kikukwelela ni nt'hambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">hegu nehikulavila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:16">mna weye hukwelelwa ni malavo ya kokwa pele.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Nt'hambiko ya kukwelela weye Mnungu, nu moyo wa kweseleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:17">moyo wa kweiila kwako Mnungu houubele.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Kwa kuunga kwako uutendele uwedi mzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:18">uzizenge uhya zink'handula zo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Niho nowelelwe ni nt'hambiko za uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">na malavo yetu yo kokwa pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 51:19">majeku nayo nayalavigwe kunda malavo hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s">Usengelo wa Mnungu na mbazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Weye mkwank'hwalu, nii wakeduvila uwihi wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:1">Mna weye ubeligwe ho undiilo wa Mnungu, ni kihi ukukeduvila msi wose?<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Weye waika mizungu ya ukomi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">nyuwe mna nyambi, ni enga lumo lunoleswe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:2">lupisi lwose ni want'hu mkudant'ha.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Mwaungisa uwihi kujink'ha uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:3">mwadant'ha na kuleka ukindedi.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Waungisa mbuli zose za kuwabananga want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:4">na lulimi lukudant'ha.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Ivo Mnungu naakubanange mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">naakung'ole na kukuusa mwe kaya yako hata uneva hukuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:5">naakuuse mwe isi ya wagima.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Wawagilwa nawakaule na kogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:6">nawamseke wakagamba,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Kauleni, yudya hemhuwilaga Mnungu kunda unyilikilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">ni yudya ahuwilaga ugoli wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:7">na kukawiila kukehonyela mwe vint'hu ivo na kunda mdahi kwa kuwakoma watuhu.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Mna miye ni enga mti ukwitangwa mzeituni ukukula mwe Nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:8">nahuwila mwo lukunde lwakwe lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Weye Mnungu nohutogole mazuwa yose kwa yadya udamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">nohutunye ha want'hu wako wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 52:9">naho nenidibwelekeze dizina dyako kwa viya ni dyedi.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s">Uwihi wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Wahezi walonga mwe mioyo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">“Mnungu hakuli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">Wose waganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">naho wadamanya zikuihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:1">hahali hata yumwenga akudamanya ayedi<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Kulawa kulanga, Mnungu akaula uku hasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:2">uneva naaone yeyose mbala akumzungula Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />mna kumbe wose wakulemela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">wose waga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">hahali yeyose akudamanya ayedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:3">hahali hata yumwenga.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Mnungu auza, “Togola hawamanyize?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">“Awa wakudamanya uwihi wahezi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">Wakuwadya want'hu wangu enga wadya mikate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:4">naho hawakunogoha miye Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Ivo, woho nawengilwe ni wogofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kutiswa hekwiinati kulaile kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwaviya Mnungu naayamwaganise mavuha ya wank'hondo ya want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:5">kwaviya Mnungu kawalemela.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Nevindilisa vedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">uyokozi wa Izilaeli wabuile kulawa Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">Want'hu wa Izilaeli hegu nawanda na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 53:6">aho Mnungu akawavuza mwo uvikilwa naho!<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Weye Mnungu, uniyokole kwa zina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:1">uniike ulekelwa kwa udahi unanawo.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />We Mnungu, unitegeleze aya hulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:2">unive kwa aya hulonga.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Weduvi wanibasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">want'hu makwank'walu waunga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:3">ni want'hu hewekumwogoha Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Mna ikindedi, Mnungu niye wambizi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:4">Kaula, Zumbe Mnungu niye dikawiilo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Hake Zumbe Mnungu awavuzile wank'hondo wangu uwihi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:5">naawabanange kwaviya yehe ni mhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Nohulavile nt'hambiko kwa kinyemi weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">nohwink'he nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:6">kwe dizina dyako kwaviya ni dyedi.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Kunikombola mwa makunt'ho yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 54:7">niyo nawaona wank'hondo wangu wakahumwa.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa mnt'hu asezengwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Mnungu usekuleka kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:1">unive kwa kiya hukulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Nitegeleze niyo wanihitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:2">Fanyanyi zangu zingila kiyangayanga.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Nawogoha wank'hondo wangu ivo wakunitisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">na kwa kuhujilwa ni want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">want'hu awo wanigela nk'huswank'huswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:3">wana maya na miye naho hawakuniunga.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Moyo wangu una kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:4">naho una wogohi wa kukomwa.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Nna wogohi na kizingizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:5">naho lukeng'ent'ha lwinizila.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Vilekile hagamba, Vandile nna mawawa enga suwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:6">hegu nehipulukila hale niyo nahumula uuko.<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Hegu naitile hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:7">naho hegu nazengile kaya yangu kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Hegu nehisunguza kuita hekwiina makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:8">hale no mjubwaniso na nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Zumbe, wazaganye wank'hondo wangu, naho watende wase kuivana mwe milosi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:9">kwaviya naona ukwank'walu na nk'humbizi mwo mzi,<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />kilo na msi wazunguluka zink'handula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:10">wiihi na nyambi zimndani mwawe.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Kubananga, kwenela kila hant'hu mwo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:11">kuhujila na nyambi havikuhalawa mwe zisila zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Andile mnk'hondo ywangu anihomole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">hegu nehifinyiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">vandile want'hu waihi nawakanitendela lubezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:12">hegu nehiwanyilika.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Mna kumbe ni weye miyangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:13">mbuyangu ywa hagihi kimanyane,<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />uyo nekikaonela kwa hamwenga kinyemi cho umbuya wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:14">na kuvika hamwenga mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />File iweziile kipump'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">nawaseele hasi kwe isi ya wabanike!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:15">kwaviya wiihi umwe zikaya zawe na wamwenga mwa woho.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Mna miye namlombeza Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:16">naho Zumbe naaniyokole.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Mtondo na nomsi na nekilo, naila kwa kusulumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:17">yehe naye naanive.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Naaniyokole haheina kulumizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">kulawa mwe nk'hondo hutowana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:18">kwaviya nahigana na wank'hondo wengi.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Mnungu, uyo akwikaila si yose mazuwa yose heekuhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">naaweve na kuwahitula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">kwaviya hawakuunga kuuleka uwihi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:19">naho hawakumwogoha yehe.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Uyu miyangu awatowa wambuyaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:20">kaibananga indagano aikile.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Simulizi zakwe ni enga mabongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mna zifanyanyi zakwe zaika mizungu ya nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">ana milosi enga mavuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:21">mna yasenga enga sime ikutwelesa.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Mwasile Zumbe Mnungu akudime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">yehe naande mwigamo wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:22">heize ilaile amwase mhuwilwa ywakwe ahumwe.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Mna, weye Mnungu, wakomi wose na wadant'hi nouwegale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">kwa mabome yo kuwoela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">umwo inusu yo wikazi wawe ukanda ukei kusila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 55:23">Mna miye, nakuhuwila weye Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s">Kumhuwila Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Mnungu unionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">kwaviya wank'hondo wangu wanisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:1">wanigela makunt'ho lupisi lwose.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Msi mgima wahigani wangu wanikump'hukila, wabinda wingi awo wakunitowa nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Umwo hogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:3">miye nakuhuwila weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Namkawila Mnungu na kuitunya mbuli yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">namhuwila yehe naho hikogoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:4">Mnt'hu mta mwili naanitendei?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Msi wose wahitula milosi yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:5">mizungu yawe yose ni kuunga kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Wadugana kwa kifiso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wakapelemba lugendo lwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:6">wakawiila kunikoma.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Haluse, walihe viligane no uwihi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:7">uwakome awo kwa maya yako weye Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Weye kuyamanya makunt'ho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">kuika nk'humbukila zo kuila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:8">aya hayawandikwe mwe kitabu chako?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Kila hakwitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">wank'hondo wangu wavuzwa kunyuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:9">iki nicho nimanyize kwaviya Mnungu kakimaila kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Mwa Mnungu uyo hutunya imbuli yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:10">na mwa Zumbe uyo huutunya ulosi wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />miye namhuwila yehe, henogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:11">mnt'hu mta mwili naanitendei?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />We Mnungu, miye nenilave kiya nilagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:12">nohulavile malavo ya nt'hogola,<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />kwaviya kuniyokola kulawa mwe file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">na kunamila nise kukobadika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">Naivo nagenda ho undiilo wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 56:13">mwo ung'azi wo ugima.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s">Daudi alombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />We Mnungu nionele mbazi, nionele mbazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">kwaviya miye nanyilikila kwako nihone nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">miye nakenyilisila mwo ugubiko wa mawawa yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:1">mpaka aho mjubwaniso wo ukomi nousiile.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Namlombeza Mnungu ywa kulanga vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:2">ni Mnungu akunikint'hizila yadya huyaunga.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Naanink'he uhituzi kulawa kwe mbingu na kuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">naawagele soni awo wakunisunk'hasunk'ha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:3">Mnungu naanilagise lukunde lwakwe holuukusila hamwenga no uhuilwa wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Hizungulukwa ni wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">wakwinga simba zina sala ya nyama za want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">ngeso zawe enga mijungo naho enga misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:4">zinyimi zawe nazo enga sime ikutwelesa.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Weye Mnungu, ukulu ni wako uko kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:5">naho ung'azi wako utendese wenele mwe isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Waniikila lwavu vileke wanigwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">moyo wangu wingila kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">wanisimbila bome vileke nihubugile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:6">mna wahubugila wenye.<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Mnungu, miye moyo wangu utoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:7">nenikeme na kukutunya weye!<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Winuke weye moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">winuke weye zeze dyangu ne kinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:8">naho neni dinule ditont'homoko.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Weye Zumbe, miye nohwink'he nt'hogola mwe si zose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:9">naho nohutunye mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Kwaviya lukunde lwako holukusila, ni enga ivo zili zimbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:10">uhuilwa wako nawo ni enga kulanga kwo ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Weye Mnungu wink'we ukulu kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 57:11">ung'azi wako utendese nawo wenele mwe ziisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s">Kumlombeza Mnungu awasengele waihi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Nyuwe wakulu we isi mwalamula mwo uwagilwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:1">Nyuwe mwasengela want'hu haheina kwazagula?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Bule! Mwafanyanya du ivo mkudaha kudamanya yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:2">naho mikono yenyu ni ya kuhujila du mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Waihi wasaguka kukongela mwo kwelekwa kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:3">kukongela aho wenuilwagwa ubovu woho waganika wakadant'ha du.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Wana usungu enga usungu wa nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:4">woho ni enga nyoka heikuunga kutegeleza,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />uyo heekutegeleza izwi dya wasai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:5">hata uneva ana umanyi mwo uganga wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Weye Mnungu, uyang'ole ameno yawe, ng'ola zingeso ze zisimba izo.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Wage enga mazi yakunyweela mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:7">wakalasa misale yawe inde mafifigu.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Woho wande enga kove dikulungulumka umwo dikagenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:8">naho wande enga katiti kabanike kakanda kakei kuona ung'azi.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Aho nyungu zenyu zikand zikei kukola moto wa nk'huni za miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">zikanda nt'heke hegu zinyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:9">waihi nawande wapuputisilwa hale.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Wawagilwa nawande na kinyemi wakaona waihi wakalihizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:10">umwo viga vawe vikajata sakame ya waihi.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Naho want'hu nawagambe, “Ikindedi wawagilwa wana mageleko yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 58:11">ikindedi, eyuko Mnungu akusengela si yose.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuyokolwa mwa wank'hondo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Weye Mnungu uniyokole mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:1">unamile mwa awo wakunikump'hukila.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Uniyokole kulawa mwa want'hu wakutenda wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:2">unikombole mwa wakomi awo.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Hata haluse wanongola vileke wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">makwank'walu yaihile waniikila mizungu iihile miye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:3">Zumbe, miye hina wiihi wowose hegu wavu niwatendele.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Zumbe miye hiwabanange dyodyose, woho wakeika lumwe wanikump'hukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:4">inuka unambize uone ivi nikailwe vihile.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Winuke weye Zumbe Mnungu ywa wose weye Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">kimala uwatowe want'hu wa isi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:5">usekunda na mbazi kwa awo wakuika mizungu ya uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Kila kisingi umwo wakauya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:6">wabuma enga makuli waka uzunguluka zunguluka umzi.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Tegeleza icho kikulawa mwe milomo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">milosi yawe yasenga enga sime inoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:7">wenye waona enga hawakwivika.<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu uwaseke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:8">uwatendele lubezo want'hu wa si zose.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Weye ludole lwangu, nakukawiila weye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:9">kwaiya weye Zumbe Mnungu, niwe digomela dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Mnungu ywangu neeze kwangu kwa lukunde lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:10">yehe naanilagise wank'hondo wangu wahumigwe.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Mna, Zumbe weye niwe nk'hindo yetu, use kuwakoma kwaviya want'hu wangu nawajale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:11">Wangadise kwa ludole lwako na kuwa seleza hasi.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Wavu umwe milomo yawe, yose wakulonga ni wavu du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">wagwilwe kwa wefenyi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:12">kwajili ya maligito yawe no udant'hi wawe,<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />wakome wose kwa maya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">uwakome pele wose,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PSA 59:13">niho nawamanye kugamba Mnungu niye Zumbe mwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:13">hata na mwe ziisi zose.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Wank'hondo wangu wakauya nekisingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:14">wabuma enga makuli wakauzunguluka umzi,<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />wangadika wakazungula cho kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:15">naho hawanapatile wabuma enga makuli kilo chose.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Mna miye nenikeme hatunya ludole lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">nohutunye mtondo kwajili yo lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">weye kunda unyilikilo wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:16">gomela dyangu heziilwa ni makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Weye wili ludole lwangu, nenikeme hakutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">weye Mnungu niwe digomela dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 59:17">Mnungu ukuniungisa.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kukombolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />We Mnungu kukilemela, niyo wakihonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:1">kunda na maya na suwe, mna kivuze naho.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Isi kuigela kisingisa, naho niyo waigela wawi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:2">Sita aho hengile lwatu kwaviya hasingisika.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Kuwagela want'hu wako mwa masulumizo makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:3">kukinywesa mp'hombe, kikolwa naho chazembeduka.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Kuwenk'ha kilagiso wadya wose wakukogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:4">vileke waink'he sila misale.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Kiyokole na kuchambiza kwa udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:5">vileke want'hu wako uwaungise wakombolwe.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Kulawa uko kukukile kwakwe kutendese, Mnungu alaganaga akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">“Shekemu neniipange kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:6">naho nenidihime dikolongo dya Sukoti.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Gileadi ywangu, Manase naye ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">Ifulaimu niyo ink'hofia yangu ya kilama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:7">Yuda naye niyo ink'home yangu ye kiseuta.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Moabu nulo lwiga lwangu lwo kuhakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">kilatu changu nenikiduile uko Edomu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">kinde kilagiso kugamba Edomu ya kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:8">Naho neni gute lukunga lwa kuihuma Filisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Niani naanigale kwo mzi uzengelwe gomela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:9">Niani naanilongoze kuita Edom?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Mnungu weye kukilemela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:10">hakikudaha kufosa naho na watowani wetu!<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Chambize kikatowana na wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:11">wambizi wa kimnt'hu haukudaha.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Mnungu ananda na suwe nekinde wahumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 60:12">Nekiwahume wank'hondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Mnungu, unive hakulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:1">utegeleze umwo hakwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Nakulombeza weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">kulawa kwo uheelo we si!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 61:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">netangea uku moyo wangu ukanda wingila chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:2">unilongoze kwo unyilikilo wa kulanga kujink'ha miye,<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />kwaviya niwe unyilikilo wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:3">ni gomela dyangu ditogile wank'hondo wasekuniona.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Naungisa nikale mwe kaya yako mazua yangu yose ninde na ukalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:4">unigubike na mawawa yako, nisekubwiilwa ni maihi.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Icho nilagane kukiva weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:5">naho kunink'ha kiya ichangu mwa kiya ukuwenk'ha wadya wakukogoha.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Mwongezele seuta mazua yo wikazi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:6">miaka yakwe vyeleko na vyeleko.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Ande seuta ho undiilo wa Mnungu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:7">umwamile kwa lukunde lwako no uhuwilwa wako houkusila.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Miye nenikeme nt'hunyo ze dizina dyako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 61:8">na kukulavila nt'hambiko mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye akunamila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Hinyamala, namgoja Mnungu ekedu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:1">uyokozi wangu walawa kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Ikindedi yehe niye unyilikilo wangu na uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">yehe ni gomela dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:2">henisingisike.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Ivi nyuwe nyose nomgendeele kumtowa mnt'hu, vileke mumkome nyuwe nyose kwa hamwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:3">enga lukazi lwiname, naho enga lukandula lukuunga lumoke?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Mwaunga du kumkinya mnt'hu kulawa mwe nt'hunyo yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mwaona ni kint'hu chedi kwenyu kudant'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mwavikila kwa milomo du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:4">mna mwe miyoyo yenyu mwaligita.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Miye ninyamale nimgoje Mnungu du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:5">kwaviya miye namkawiila yehe ekedu.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Yehe ekedu niye nk'hindo yangu na uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:6">niye gomela dyangu miye henisingisike.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Uyokozi na nt'hunyo yangu valawa kwa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">yehe nk'hindo yangu itogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:7">ni unyilikilo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Nyuwe want'hu mhuileni yehe mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">mhuwi we mioyo yenyu yehe aumanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:8">kwaviya yehe niye unyilikilo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Want'hu wose ni enga muye du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wakulu wose wadant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:9">wanagelwa mwe kihimo hawana kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Use kuhuwila kuhujila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">na kukawiila vint'hu va ubavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:10">hamwenga na kugamba ugoli wagenyela, use kukawila umwo.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Mnungu kalonga lumwenga du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">miye hiva mbuli mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:11">kugamba udahi ni wakwe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />kwaiya weye Zumbe Mnungu, ni mta lukunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 62:12">kwa kindedi noumlihe kila mnt'hu viligane na ivo adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s">Kunda na nk'wina na Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />We Mnungu, weye ywi Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">nakuzungulisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">miye naungisa kunda na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">moyo wangu ukaluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:1">ukaluka enga mnt'hu mta nk'hilu. Nna nk'hilu enga isi ibabaluke.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Hihaona hakukile hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:2">naho hiuona udahi wako no ung'azi wako utendese.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Kwaviya lukunde lwako helwiina uheelo ni wedi kujink'ha ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:3">na kwa ayo miye nohutunye.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Nohutogole mwo wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:4">naho kwa zina dyako neninule kulanga mikono yangu halombeza.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Name neninde higuta enga hidya nk'hande ya wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:5">kwa mnomo wangu nenikeme nt'hunyo zako.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Umwo hagona mwo lusazi lwangu nohukumbukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:6">na kukufanayanya mwe kilo icho,<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />kwaviya kunda mwambizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:7">naho handa mwe mp'heho ya mawawa yako nenikeme kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Miye nanda kimbambati na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:8">udahi wako wanidima kwa vedi.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Wose wakuunga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:9">nawahubugile hasi kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Nawakomwe kwa sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:10">vimba vawe nevinde nk'hande ya mauzi.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Kwaviya Mnungu naamwink'he uhumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">sueta naange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">Wose wakuika lagano mwe dizina dya Mnungu nawamtogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 63:11">mna milomo ya wadant'hi neinyamazwe.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />We Mnungu, nitegeleze kulombeza kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:1">wamile ugima wangu kwa wank'hondo wakutisa.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Unamile ne mizungu ya waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:2">na kulawa mwe vifyo va waihile.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Wanola zinyimi zawe enga sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:3">wafyusa milosi yawe ikutwa enga misale ya usungu.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Wakalawa kwo ufiso, wawalasa want'hu heweina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:4">wasunguza kuwajunga haheina kogoha.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Walangilizana mwe mizungu yawe iihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">watalaula mwe kwinika mitego kwa kinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:5">wakagamba, “Hahali akudaha kukiona.”<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Waika mizungu ya wiihi wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">“Kidamanya mzungu ukint'hile”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:6">Ikindedi mizungu ya kinyele ikefisa mwo moyo wa mnt'hu.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Mna Mnungu naawalase ne misale yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:7">naho nawalumizwe kwa kwitukiza.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Naawakome pele kwajili ye zimbuli zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:8">naho wose wakuwaona nawasingise mitwi yawe kwa kuwabela,<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />naho want'hu wose nawogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">nawabwelekeze kiya adamanye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:9">na kufanyanya udamanyi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Wawagilwa wose nawaone kinyemi mwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">na kunyilikila kwakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 64:10">want'hu wose wedi nawamtunye yehe.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hunyo na nt'hogola.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Utogolwe weye Mnungu ywa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:1">naho want'hu nawakint'hize kiya wakulagane.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Ni weye ukutegeleza kiya want'hu wakulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:2">want'hu wose naweze kwako.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Kikazamilwa ni malema yetu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:3">weye mwenye wakiusila wavu wetu.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Wana kinyemi wadya uwasagule</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">wadya ukuwaleta wekale hakukile hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">naweguswe ni ayedi ye kaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:4">na uvikilwa wa mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu ikukile.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Kwa kweheelesa weye wakink'ha uhituzi na kukikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">weye Mnungu ywo uyokozi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">ni weye dikawiilo dye vint'hu vose mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:5">na uko hale kwe bahali.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Kwa udahi wako nokuiika milima hant'hu hawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:6">mwenye ukalagisa ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Weye wanyamaza mtindilo we bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">no ukwivika kwo mjubwaniso wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:7">naho wanyamaza nk'humbizi ya want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Si zose zeheelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kwo udamanyi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">yadya ukudamanya yegala kwanga kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:8">kulawa nt'hendelo umwenga kuita int'huhu.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Weye wailela isi kwa kuigaila fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">waitenda inde na uwolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">vizuto vose wavimemeza mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">want'hu wakwe wawenk'ha nk'hande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:9">Ivi nivo ukuidamanya isi.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Waitenda fula inyelese mwe migunda ilimigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuijabaza na mazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">mikologombe yakwe nayo waijabaza na fula ndodondodo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:10">na kuihoteza maziti ye hengi.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Uvikilwa wako waoneka mwaka mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:11">kila hant'hu hamema uwedi wako.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Nyika za mani zimema mifugwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:12">milima nayo yanga kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Madimilo yamema ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">makolongo yamema ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 65:13">kila kimwenga changa na kukema kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s">Kumtunya Mnungu kwo uwedi wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Want'hu wose yangeni kwa kinyemi na kumtunya Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Ukemeleni ukulu we dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:2">mwink'heni nt'hunyo zo ung'azi wakwe utendes.<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Mgambeni Mnungu, “Udamanyi wako ni wa kweheelesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">udahi wako ukulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:3">vikuleka wank'hondo wako wenamiza mitwi yawe hasi kwa kukogoha weye.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Isi yose yenamiza mitwi yawe hasi ahako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">wakema nt'hunyo kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:4">ukemi wa kuditunya dizina dyako.”<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Hake soni, mkaule icho adamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:5">kadamanya ya kweheela mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Aihitulaga ibahali kuda hant'hu hanyaile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">wakale wetu wadendelukaga ibahali ne viga vawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:6">hadya chaonaga kinyemi mwe kiya adamanyaga.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Yehe ekaila si kwa udahi wakwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">na kuwakaula wa mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:7">Yeyose asaguke ase kuhigana naye.<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Nyuwe want'hu wa isi zose, mtunyeni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:8">maizwi ye zint'hunyo zenyu nayevike.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Yehe kakiika kunda wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:9">naho hakilekile suwe kigwe.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Kukihima weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kukigeza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:10">kukisunt'ha mwo moto enga shaba.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Kukileka kigwiligwe mwo lwinika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:11">na kukigela mwa makunt'ho yakulumisa.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Kuwaleka wank'hondo wakijatangize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">chombokela mwa mazi na mwo moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:12">mna kukibuza hant'hu hatondowale.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Nenize kwe nyumba yako na malavo ya kokwa pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:13">nenikint'hize kiya hulagane kwako.<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />Nohwink'he kiya nalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:14">kiya nalagane umwo nandile mwa makunt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Nohulavile malavo yo kokwa pele, mifugwa igimbale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nt'hambiko ya ndolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:15">nenilave ng'mbe na mbuzi.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Soni nyuwe mkumvika Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:16">name neniwagambileni kiya anidamanyile.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Namlombezaga wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:17">namtunyaga kwa kumkemela.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Wandile naikile wavu mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:18">Zumbe hegu hanitegeleze,<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />mna ikindedi Mnungu kaniva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:19">kayategeleza niyo anink'ha yadya nimlombeze.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Namtunya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">kwaviya halemele kulombeza kwangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 66:20">hegu kunilemela mwo lukunde lwakwe holukusila.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Mnungu kionele mbazi na kukivikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:1">ukikaule kwa ukise,<verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />vileke isi yose imanye yadya ukuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:2">uyokozi wako mwa want'hu wa isi zose.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Want'hu wakutunye weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:3">want'hu wose wakutunye weye.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Want'hu wa isi zose wande na kinyemi na kukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">kwaviya wawasengela want'hu haheina kwazagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:4">naho walongoza isi zose mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Want'hu wakutunye weye Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:5">want'hu wose wakutunye weye.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Isi ilava ulozo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:6">Mnungu ywetu kakivikila.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Mnungu agendeela kukivikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 67:7">want'hu wose wa isi zose wamogohe.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kwangila uhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Mnungu ande kulanga, wank'hondo wakwe wamwaganike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:1">wose hewekumuunga wamnyilike.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Enga mosi ivo ukuhumunt'hwa ni mp'heho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">nivo nawo wakuhumunt'wa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:2">enga ivo nt'ha ikulujuka ho moto, nivo waihi nawande ho undiilo wa Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Mna wawagilwa, nawande na kinyemi ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:3">wana kinyemi na kwanga.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Mkemeleni Mnungu, ditogoleni dizina dyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">mdamanyileni sila yakwe uyo ekulanga kwa mavunde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:4">Zina dyakwe niye Zumbe Mnungu, indeni na kinyemi ho undiilo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Mnungu emwe nyumba yakwe ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:5">niye tati yawe ywa wana nk'hiwa, naho mwamizi ywa wabanikilwe ni wagosi zawe.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Heweina ndugu, Mnungu awenk'ha kaya ikutoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">awalekela wavugailwa na kuwenk'ha upati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:6">mna wasaguke nawekale mwe isi ibabaluke.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />We Mnungu, umwo wawalongoele want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:7">umwo wandile ukomboka mwe dijangwa,<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />isi yasingisikaga niyo ulanga wanya fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">kwajili yo undiilo wako weye Mnungu ywa Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:8">heiye, mwo kwiza kwako weye Mnungu ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Weye Mnungu, watendaga fula inyelese mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:9">waivuzaga uhya isi yako iyo yanyalaga.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Niyo want'hu wako wapata kaya aaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:10">wawenk'haga wakiwa yadya waungaga.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Zumbe Mnungu alavaga sigilizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:11">niyo wavele wabindile wingi waubwelekeza ulosi uwo.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Maseuta na wata mafyo ya watowani wawe wanyilikaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:12">Wavele mwe kaya wakepangilaga vitahigwa,<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Hata ukagona mgatigati ye mimoto ya he nk'hambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">mawawa ye suwa yangu yakizigwa kwa masawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:13">mazoya yakwe nayo kwa zahabu ikun'gala.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Umwo Zumbe Mnungu awa mwaganisaga maseuta mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:14">ni enga seluji igwele mwo mnima wa Salimoni.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Weye mnima mtali wa Mnungu, mnima wa Bashani, mnima una vinenengwa vingi,<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />nii unafinju no mnima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">mnima usagulwe ni Mnungu mwenye vileke ekale uumo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:16">Zumbe Mnungu neekale uuko mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Akanda ne dikulajunga dikuile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">maalufu na maalufu na maalufu ya magali yakugendezwa ni falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:17">Zumbe Mnungu eza kulawa Sinai, eza hant'hu hakwe hakukile.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Kakwelesa kulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">kataha watahigwa, ahokela mageleko kulawa kwa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">kulawa hata kwa want'hu wasaguke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:18">Zumbe Mnungu neekale uuko.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Atunyigwe Mnungu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">yehe akuguha zint'wika zetu mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:19">Niye Mnungu akukiyokola.<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Mnungu ywetu ni Mnungu akuyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">kwakwe yehe nuko kwili zisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:20">zisila zo kuinyilika ifile.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Ikindedi Mnungu naaihonde mitwi ya wank'hondo wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:21">wose wadya wakugendeela mwo wavu wawe.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Zumbe Mnungu agambaga, “Neniwavuze wank'hondo kulawa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:22">neniwavuze kulawa kwe minyongomela ye bahali,<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />vileke usunt'he iviga mwe sakame ya wank'hondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:23">uku makuli yako nayadye zinyama zawe.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />We Mnungu, makulajunga yako ya uhumi yaonwa ni wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:24">makulajunga ya Mnungu, seuta ywangu mpaka hakukile hakwe.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Wakemi walongola, wakutimila watowa makopo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:25">wana kike we hagati wakatowa vigoma.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />“Mtunyeni Mnungu mwo mdugano mkulu wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:26">nyuwe mdugano wa Yakobo mtunyeni Zumbe!”<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Nk'hongo ni Benjamini, dikabila didodo mwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">akatimilwa ni vilongozi wa Yuda ne difyo dyawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:27">wakatimilwa ni vilongozi wa Zabuloni na Nafutali.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />We Mnungu, kilagise udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:28">kik'he ludole lwako enga ivo watendile hadya nk'hongo,<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />kulawa kwe Nyumba yako uko Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:29">uko maseuta nawakwizile na mageleko yawe.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Mfank'hile dikala mbago dikwikala mwe nyasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">fyo dya majeku na ndama za want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">vileke wename hasi na kukulavila masawa yawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:30">Wamwaganise wose wakuungisa nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Wegala ulosi naweze kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:31">Waesiopia nawenule mikono yawe kulanga wakamlombeza Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Mkemeleni Mnungu nyuwe useuta wa mwe si zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:32">mkemeleni nt'hunyo uyu Zumbe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />mkemeleni yehe akomboka mwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">kukongela aho kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:33">mtegelezeni akabuma kwa mtindilo.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Bwelekezeni udahi wa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">yehe ni Zumbe mwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:34">uyo udahi wakwe ukwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Mnungu atisisa aho hakukile hakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">yehe ni Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">enk'hiza udahi na ludole kwa want'hu wakwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 68:35">Nt'hunyo ni za Mnungu!<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi mwa makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Niyokole weye Mnungu kwaviya mazi yanibula mwe singo.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Natotohela mwe nt'hope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">hehekudahika kukimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">Hididimila mwa mazi matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:2">mazi nayo yanijubwanisa.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Hisokezwa kwa kulombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">dilaka dyangu nadyo dinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">meso yangu nayo yadumila unk'hundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:3">hakukawiila weye Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Wakuniihiya haheina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">uwingi wawe ujink'ha wingi we zifili zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Wank'hondo wangu walonga lulimi mwa miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">wana ludole naho waunga wanikome.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">awo wakunikumphukila kwa mbuli za udant'hi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:4">Togola nivuze kint'hu hikibaile?<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Weye Mnungu kuumanya uhezi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:5">malema nidamanye hayakefisile vileke use kuyaona.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Miye nisekuwagela soni wadya wakukuhuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">weye Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">weye Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:6">wadya wakukuvika, wase kwingila kinyulu kwajili yangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Kwaviya hingila kinyulu kwajili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:7">naho meso yangu yengila soni.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Miye hinda mtakwiza mwa wandugu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:8">enga mnt'hu heemanyike mwa want'hu wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />Lukunde lwangu kwako lwanikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:9">nk'halalizi zose wakukukalaliza zimwangu miye.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Nize nikeseleze kwako kwa kufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:10">want'hu wanibelaga.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />Hakevala mavalo ya kuhongeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:11">woho waniseka.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Umwo mwe zisila want'hu wanisimuila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:12">wakozi nawo wanituila wila.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Mna miye nalombeza kwako weye Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Nik'he uhituzi weye Mnungu mwo lupisi lukukwelela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">Nink'he uhituzi kwajili yo lukunde lwako lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:13">kwa wambizi wako wa uhuwilwa,<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />uniyokole nifose mwo kutotohela mwe nt'hope</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">unihonye na awo wakuniihiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:14">unilave mwa mazi matali.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Usekuleka mazi yakanikubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">hegu kudidimila mwa mazi matali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:15">na kumeligwa ni isi ya want'hu wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Zumbe nink'he uhituzi mwo uwedi wo lukunde lwako holuukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:16">unihitukile kwajili ye zimbazi zako.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Usekuleka kumkaula mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:17">nink'he uhituzi kwaviya ni mwa makunt'ho makulu.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />So uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:18">unikombole kwa wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Kuvimanya ivo hugeligwa mabelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">ivo nigeligwe kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:19">haheina kutunywa.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Kugeligwa mabelo kunigela chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">naho hingila usokezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">higoja ywa kunigela moyo mna himuone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:20">ywa kunihoza mna hahali.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Umwa nandile na sala woho wanik'ha vikukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:21">wanink'ha siki umwo nandile na nk'hilu.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Fugo zawe zinde mitego yawe wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:22">mazuwa ya kinyemi ya malavo yawagwile wenye.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Wagele unt'hunt'hu wase kudaha kukaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:23">migongo yawe nayo igolome mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Wakupuile maya yako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:24">maya yako yawabwiile.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Nk'hambi zawe zinde mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:25">nk'hambi zawe zisekwikalwa ni yeyose.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Wawasezenga wadya weye uwasulumize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:26">wasimuila masulumizo ya wadya uwalumize.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Ika nk'humbukila zo wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:27">usekumwink'ha yeyose hant'hu mwo uyokozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Mazina yawe yafutigwe mwe kitabu cho ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:28">usekuwahanganya mwo ludongo lwa wawagilwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Mna miye ni mnyonge naho nna usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:29">we Mnungu ninule naho uniyokole.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Neniditunye dizina dya Mnungu kwa ukemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:30">name nenibweleke dizina dyakwe kwa kumgamba nivedi.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Ino neimwelele Zumbe Mnungu kujink'ha kumlavila ng'ombe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:31">naho kujink'ha kumwink'ha jeku dikulise.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Umwo wabeligwe wakaona ivi, nawande na kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:32">wose wakumvika Mnungu nawagelwe moyo.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Kwaviya Mnungu aweva want'hu wakwe heweina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:33">naho haawajale want'hu wakwe watahigwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Nyuwe zimbingu ne zi isi mtunyeni Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:34">hamwenga ne bahali na vose vimndani mwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Kwaviya Mnungu naaiyokole Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">na kuizenga uhya mizi ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:35">want'hu wakwe nawekale umwo na kunda yawe.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Welekwa wa wandima wakwe nawande wakipe we mizi iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 69:36">naho wose wakumuunga nawekale uumwo.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />We Mnungu uunge kuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:1">Zumbe Mnungu nambize usunguze kunambiza!<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Wadya wose wakuzungula kunikoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wengile soni naho wahuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wakuona kinyemi handa na makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:2">wavuzwe kunyuma na kubeligwa.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Wose wakuniseka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:3">weheelwe na kuhuza kwa kuhumwa kwawe.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Wande na kinyemi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">wose wakwiza kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">wose wakugamba nivedi kwo uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:4">mazua yose wagambe, “Mnungu ni mkulu!”<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Miye ni msokezi naho mkiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">sunguza kwiza kwangu weye Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Ni weye myokozi ywangu naho mwambizi ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 70:5">Zumbe Mnungu sunguza unambize!<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi na wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Miye nanyilikila kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:1">nisekwingila soni.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Mwo uwagilwa wako nambize na kuniyokola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:2">Nitegeleze na kukombola!<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Unde unyilikilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">naho unde gomela dyangu ditogile dya kuniyokola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:3">kwaviya weye ni unyilikilo wangu naho gomela dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Niyokole weye Mnungu kulawa mwa want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:4">mwo udahi wa makwank'walu na waihi.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Kwaviya weye Zumbe ni weye kawiilo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:5">hikuhuwila weye kukongela kwo ubwanga wangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Nakukawiilaga weye kukongela kwo kwelekwa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">kwaviya ni weye unilavile mwe nda ya mnala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:6">miye nohutunye haheina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Hinda kilozo kwa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:7">mna weye niwe unyilikilo wangu utogile.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Miye nakutunya mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:8">na kuubwelekeza ukulu wako kilo na msi.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Hadalahala use kuniduula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:9">hasiilwa ni ludole usekunasa.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Kwaviya wank'hondo wangu walonga yaihile mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:10">wadya wakuunga wanikome waika mizungu iihile.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Hambwe wagamba, “Mnungu kamwasa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">mguluseni mumgwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:11">kwaviya hahali yeyose naamyokole.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Weye Mnungu ywangu, usekwikala hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:12">Sunguza uniyokole weye Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Wose wakunikump'hukila wahumwe na kuuswa pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:13">wadya wakuunga wanilumize wagelwe soni na kinyulu.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Mazuwa yose neniike kawiilo dyangu kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:14">nohutunye na kukutunya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Mnomo wangu noulonge udamanyi wako wo uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">udamanyi wo uyokozi wako msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:15">hata uneva ayo yajink'ha ubala wangu.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Nenize nibwelekeze udamanyi wako mkulu weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:16">nenibwelekeze uwedi wako weye wikedu.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Wanihinizaga kukongela kwo ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:17">naho nagendeela kubwelekeza udamanyi wako wa kwehela.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Hata hadalahala na kunda na fi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">usekunileka weye Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:18">mpaka nibwelekeze udamanyi wako mkulu kwe vyeleko vikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Uwagilwa wako wabula kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">Kudamanya mbuli zikulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:19">hahali yeyose enga weye.<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Kunink'ha makunt'ho na masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">mna nounivuze naho mwo ugima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:20">Nouniuyule naho kulawa kwe kikuta.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Nounongezele nt'hunyo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:21">na kunigela moyo naho.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Nohutunye hatowa kinubi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">neniutunye uhuwilwa wako weye Mnungu ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">nohu kemele nt'hunyo ne kinubi changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:22">weye ukukile ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Nenikweze izwi kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">umwo hakukemela weye nt'hunyo zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:23">name nohutunye kwaviya kuniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Nenisimuile uwagilwa wako msi mgima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">kwaviya wose nawakaunga wanilumize</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 71:24">watoigwa na kugelwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s">Kumlombezela seuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />We Mnungu, mhinize seuta asengele kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:1">mwana kiseuta haeina kwazagula.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Awalamule want'hu wako kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:2">na wakiwa wako haheina kuwahujila.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Milima yeleke upati kwa want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:3">vigulu navo viuone uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Naawagombele wakulumizwa kasidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">na kuwayokola wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:4">na kuwabananga haweina lema.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Seuta ekale wikazi mtali enga zuwa naho enga mwezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:5">vyeleko vose.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Seuta ande enga fula ikunya mwe nk'honde ihumunt'we,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:6">enga manyunyu yakunyunya mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Mwa mazuwa yo useuta wakwe uwagilwa ugendeele vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:7">upati nounde aho mpaka umwo mnenge nouheele .<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Useuta wakwe ni kulawa bahali mpaka bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:8">kulawa kwo mto Eufulate mpaka kwo uheelo we isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Makabila ya kwe dijangwa nawenamize mitwi yawe hasi aho eli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:9">wank'hondo wakwe nawagwe wenye hasi.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Maseuta wa Talashishi na wa mp'wani ya hale wamwigaile kodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:10">maseuta wa Sheba na Seba wamwigaile mageleko.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Maseuta wose wenamize mitwi yawe hasi hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:11">want'hu wa si yose wamdamanyile ndima.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Kwaviya naawaonele mbazi wakiwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:12">na wadya wahujilwe haweina kint'hu naho heweina wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Awaonela mbazi haweina kint'hu na wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:13">wakiwa awahonya kulawa mwe file.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Awayokola kulawa mwo kulumizwa haheina lema na ukwank'walu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:14">ugima wawe kwakwe ni kint'hu chedi.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Seuta ekale wikazi mtali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">ahokele mageleko ya zahabu kulawa Sheba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">want'hu wamlombezele kwa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:15">naho wamvikile mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Isi indilise na ulozo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">vigulu vimeme nk'hande enga ya Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:16">na want'hu mwe mizi enga mani yatimile.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Zina dyakwe dikale mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">dyenele enga zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:17">want'hu wose wamlombeze Mnungu na kumwitanga mvikilwa.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:18">ni yehe ekedu akudamanya mbuli za kweheela.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Utunyeni ung'azi wakwe utendese we dizina dyakwe mazuwa yose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Ukulu wakwe wiimemeze isi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 72:19">Taile! Taile!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Uno nuwo uheelo wo kulombeza kwa Daudi mwana Yese.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="s">Uwagilwa wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Ikindedi Mnungu ni ywedi kwa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:1">kwa wose wata mioyo yedi.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Mna miye nehiteela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:2">nihinda hagihi na kwazaganya mhuwi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Kwaviya nehawaonela finju wakukefenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:3">nize nione wata wavu wanda wapati,<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />kwaviya woho hawakubwiilwa ni masulumizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:4">miili yawe ni yedi, naho ina ludole.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />hawakubwiilwa ni makunt'ho ya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:5">hawakupata makunt'ho enga ayo yakuwapata want'hu watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Naivo elo wefenyi kwawe ni enga mkufu wa mwe singo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:6">wakevala mbuli za kukekweza.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Mioyo yawe yalava wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:7">fanyanyi za kutenda wavu mwawe hazina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Wawabela watuhu na kuwalonga vihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:8">wakeduvya na kuika mizungu ya kuwalumiza watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Wamlonga Mnungu vihile ne milomo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:9">naho kwa milosi yawe waikaila isi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Hata want'hu wa Mnungu wawatimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:10">na kuhuwila kila kint'hu icho wakulonga.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Wagamba, “Mnungu hakuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:11">Mnungu Mkulu haabunk'hule.”<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Ivo nivo weli want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:12">wana kila kint'hu naho wapatisa.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Togola, hiwiika moyo wangu kunda ywedi bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:13">na kukeyamila nise kudamanya wavu?<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Msi mgima miye hipata makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:14">hinda hasulumizwa kila mtondo.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Name nalongile enga woho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:15">hegu name nehinda msezengi.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Nize nigeze kufanyanya zimbuli izi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:16">nehiziona zanigele kiyangayanga,<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />mna nize ningile hakukile ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:17">niho nabunk'ule uheelo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Ikindedi wawaika hant'hu hakuteela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:18">wawatenda wagwe niyo wabanangwa pele.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Wetukila wabanangwa pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:19">wauswa pele kwa kutiswa.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Zumbe, weye ukenuka woho wasunguza kwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:20">yanda enga sozi ya mnt'hu akwinuka mwe zint'hongo.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Aho nize nione usungu mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:21">naho moyo wangu wize ugelwe kinyulu,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />nehinda enga mhezi hiina ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:22">naho nehinda enga kala ho undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Mna hata ivo mazua yose ni hamwenga na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:23">kunitoza mkono wangu.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Wanilongoza kwa kunilangiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:24">naho nounihokele kwo ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Miye ni ani mtuhu uko kwe mbingu uneva hi weye wikedu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:25">Naho kwaviya nna weye naungai naho mwe isi ino?<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Mwili wangu no moyo wangu vadaha kudunduga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:26">mna weye Mnungu niwe ludole lwangu na upasi wangu mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Wose akepagule kwako nawasile pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:27">nouwabinde wose hiwahuwilwa kwako.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Mna miye ni vedi ninde hagihi na Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">Zumbe Mnungu kanda niye unyilikilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 73:28">nenibwelekeze mbuli zose udamanye!<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza ukombozi we isi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Weye Mnungu nii kukileka mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:1">Nii maya yako yalawa mosi mwe zingoto za madimilo yako?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Wakumbukile want'hu wako wawasagulaga uko kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">want'hu awo awakombole wande wako mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:2">ukumbukile mnima Sayuni aho ukwikala.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Gendeela umu mnanga mwa mank'hala nk'hala aya ya mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:3">wank'hondo wabananga kila kint'hu mwe Nyumba yako.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Wank'hondo wako wabuma mwe Nyumba yako ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:4">waika ne bendela yawe inde kiwalo cha uhumi.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Wanda enga want'hu wenule hoya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:5">vileke wayakant'he maziti.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Watulagatulaga zinyivi zose ze kiunt'handa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:6">kwa mahoya na vigomandilo vawe.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Wahokaga moto hakukile hako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:7">na kuhagela usavu aho want'hu wakukuvika.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Waungisaga kukibinda pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:8">wokaga moto kila hant'hu mwe isi aho nekikakuvika weye.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Hakikuviona naho vilagiso vikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">hawahali walotezi wasigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:9">naho hahali yeyose amanyize kugamba mbuli izi nezisile ini.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Wank'hondo wetu nawaleke kukubela weye Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:10">Nawadihomole dizina dyako mazuwa yose?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Nii wauvuza mkono wako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">Heiye, mkono wako wo kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">ulave mwe kifuwa chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:11">ukawakome pele<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Mna Mnungu niye Seuta ywetu kukongela aho nk'hongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:12">egala uyokozi mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Ni weye waipangile ibahali kwa udahi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:13">waitulaga imitwi ya makala makulu ya kutisa mwa mazi,<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />waitulaga mitwi ya Leviatani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:14">niyo ikimba chakwe wayenk'ha makala ya kwe nyika yapate nk'hande.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Ni weye watumbulaga nc'hoko ne vizuto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:15">naho ni weye wanyazaga mito yandaga akaseela haheina kuleka.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Msi, wako, kilo nacho chako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:16">naho ni weye waikaga dizua no mnenge.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Ni weye waikaga mihaka yose ya si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:17">niyo waika misimo ya masika ne kiangazi.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Mnungu, hake kumbukila ivo wank'hondo wakukubela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:18">ivo want'hu wahezi wahomolaga dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Use kwink'hiza ugima we zisuwa zako kwa makala yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:19">use kuujala wikazi wa want'hu wako wakusulumila.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Ikumbukile indagano yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">kwaviya hant'hu hana lwiza mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:20">kumema ukalo wa ukwank'walu.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Usekuleka wakutendelwa ukwank'walu wageligwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:21">wakiwa na heweina kint'hu uwenk'he kuditogola dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Winuke weye Mnungu, ukegombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:22">ukumbukile ivo wahezi wakukutendela lubezo msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Use kujala izwi dya wank'hondo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 74:23">na nk'humbizi heziikusila za wahigani wako.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye mlamuzi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Chakutogola weye Mnungu, chakutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">chabwelekeza ukulu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:1">na kusimuila ukulu we zimbuli izo udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Mnungu agamba, “Hiika lupisi lwedi lwa kusengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:2">lupisi ulo nenisengele kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Umwo isi ikazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">na vose vimndani vikasingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:3">ni miye hudamanya zink'hongelo zakwe zitogile.<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Nawagamba wakukeduvya wase kukefenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:4">naho hemwiina uwagilwa msekukeona, <verse eid="PSA 75:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />naho wasekunda na keduvya, naho wasekulonga kwa kukefenya.”<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Usengelo haukulawa nt'hendelo zose za si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">hegu kulawa kwe dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:6">akudaha kumkweza mnt'hu<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Mnungu niye akusengela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:7">amseleza mnt'hu yeyose naho amkweza yeyose.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Zumbe ana kikombe mwo mkono wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">kimema divai ikukola ya maya yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">naaigide naho want'hu waihi nawainywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:8">heiye, nawainywe mpaka twent'he yo mzigilizo.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Mna miye neniibwelekeze mbuli ino mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:9">nenikeme nt'hogola kwa Mnungu ywa Yokobo.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Naauuse udahi wa waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 75:10">mna udahi wa wawagilwa nougenyezwe.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye mhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Mnungu kamanyika mwe Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:1">zina dyakwe dikulisa mwe Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Dihema dyakwe diiyuko Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:2">ukalo wakwe wi Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Kudya kaipochola misale yandaga na moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:3">zink'hindo zawe ne zisime, heiye, ne vitowanilo vawe vose vituhu.<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Weye Mnungu una ung'azi utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">kutunyiswa kujink'ha milima imemile makala yakudigwa nyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:4">umwo wawakup'hukilaga na kuwahuma wank'hondo wako.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Watowani wawe wahokigwa vose wandile navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">naho haluse wagona nt'hongo za file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:5">ludole lwawe no umanyi wawe hauwambize kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Wize uwafank'hile weye Mnungu ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:6">zifalasi hamwenga na awo wakuzigendeza, wagwaga hasi na kubanika.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Weye wikedu niwe ukwogohwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">niani akudaha kukimaala ho undiilo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:7">mwo lupisi lwa maya yako.<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Kutambula usengelo wako kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:8">isi niyo yogohesa na kwikala kinyamaile,<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />aho weye Mnungu wize winuke vileke usengele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:9">uwayokole wose wahujilwe mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Ikindedi maya yako yatendese kwa want'hu yakutunya weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:10">wasigale na kuhona mwa maya yako nawayokolwe.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Mwink'heni Zumbe Mnungu kiya mumlagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">si zose zimzunguluke mwink'heni mageleko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:11">uyo ywo kwogohwa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Yehe awakoma want'hu wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 76:12">na kuwatisa maseuta we si.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s">Kusangalazwa mwe makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Namwiila Mnungu kwa izwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:1">namwiila kwa izwi vileke anive.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Habwiilana na makunt'ho namlombeza Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">nacheleza hachulula mikono yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:2">mna moyo wangu ulemela kusangalzwa.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />We Mnungu, nehikukumbukila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:3">umwo hafanyanya mpaka nengila chevu.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Kunitenda ninde meso kilo chose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:4">nna kiyangayanga naho hikudaha kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Nafanyanya mazuwa ya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:5">nakumbukila myaka yomboke.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Nekilo nakumbukilaga wila nakemaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:6">naho nakeuza mwo moyo wangu,<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Ivi Zumbe Mnungu haakizumile naho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:7">Hakitendele uwedi wakwe naho?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo luhalawa mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:8">Ivi haakint'hize naho kiya alagane?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Haluse nivo Mnungu kajala kunda na mbazi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:9">amaya yakwe yaguha hant'hu he zimbazi zakwe?”<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Niyo nakegamba, “Iki nicho kikunilumiza mwo moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:10">Mnungu mkulu kahituka hakukidamanyila kint'hu naho.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Nenikumbukile makulu ayo udamanye weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:11">henijale vihungi ivo wadamanyaga.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Nenifanyanye zindima zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:12">na kutalaula udamanyi wako mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Sila yako weye Mnungu ikuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:13">ni yuhi Mnungu mkulu enga weye Mnungu ywetu?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Ni weye Mnungu ukudamanya vihungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:14">kulagisa ukulu wako mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Kwa udahi wako kuwayokola want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:15">welekwa wa Yakobo na wa Yusufu.<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Mazi yeze yakuone weye Mnungu yogohaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:16">mazi matali ye bahali yazingizaga.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Mavunde yetilaga vula kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">lukuwa lwevikaga mwo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:17">misale yako yenelaga nt'hendelo zose.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Mtint'hilo wako nowivika mwe mp'heho ikuzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">lumwemwe lwako niyo lwa mweka isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:18">si yazingizaga na kusingisika.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Weye wagendaga mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">lwombokelo lwako mwa mazi matali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:19">hamwenga na kugamba zinyayo zako hazioneke.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Wawalongozaga want'hu wako enga mdimi akulongoza ngoto zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 77:20">kwa ulongozi wa Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu na want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Nyuwe want'hu wangu mwive icho huhiniza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:1">muitegeleze milosi yangu.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Nenilonge na nyuwe kwa malango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:2">mbuli hezamnyikaga kulawa uko kale,<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />ni mbuli kizivile naho kizimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:3">mbuli chasimwiilwagwa ni wakale wetu.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Hekiwafise wana wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">ne kikigambile cheleko kikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">udahi mkulu wa Mnungu no udamanyi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:4">vint'hu va kweheela ivo adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Kawenk'ha imiko want'hu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">niyo awagamba wakale wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">wawahinize wana wawe zisigilizi,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />vileke cheleko kikwiza kizimanye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:6">hamwenga na wana nawelekwe, woho nawo weze wawahinize wana wawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Niho nawamhuwile Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">naho hawajale udamanyi wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:7">mna nawatimile zisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Wasekunda enga wakale wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">cheleko cha wahigani na wasaguke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">hewekumhuwila Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:8">cheleko hekiina uhuwilwa kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Want'hu wa Ifulaimu wakekakile nyuta na misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:9">wanyilikaga mwe dizuwa dye nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Hawatozaga indagano ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:10">walemelaga kutimila sigilizi yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Wajalaga yadya adamanyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:11">vihungi ivo awalagisaga.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Adamanyaga vihungi wakale wawe wakasinya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:12">uko Soani kwe isi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Aipangaga ibahali niyo awombosela uumwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:13">aitendaga ibahali ikimale enga lukazi.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Nomsi awalongozaga ne divunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:14">kilo chose awalongozaga kwa ung'azi walawaga mwo moto.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Alutulaga uluwe mwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:15">niyo awanywesa mazi yabindile wingi enga mazi ya bahali.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Atumbulaga mazi kulawa mwo luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:16">niyo yaseela enga mto.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Mna wagendeelaga kumtendela wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:17">naho niyo wasaguka kudya kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Wamgezaga Mnungu kwa kasidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:18">kwa kuunga nk'hande iyo waungaga woho.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Walonga vihile kwa Mnungu wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:19">“Ivo Mnungu adaha kukink'ha nk'hande mwe dijangwa?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Ni kindedi, Mnungu autowaga uluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">niyo mazi yatumbuka enga mto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">mna adaha kukink'ha nk'hande?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:20">na kuwenk'ha want'hu wakwe nyama?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Naivo niyo Mnungu anda na maya kwajili yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">niyo moto wa maya yakwe wakwelezwa mwa welekwa wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:21">naho helelwe nawo want'hu wa Izilaeli,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />kwaviya hawamhuwilaga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:22">naho hawahuwile udahi wakwe wo kuwakombola.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Hata ivo alongaga no ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:23">na kukomola zinyivi za kwe mbingu,<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />niyo awetiila mana vileke wadye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:24">akwenk'ha nk'hande ya kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Ivo want'hu wadyaga nk'hande ya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:25">naho Mnungu awenk'haga ludyo lwa kuwakint'ha.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Alekelaga mp'heho ya ulailo wa zuwa ivumile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:26">naho kwa udahi wakwe kaitenda imp'heho ya kwa mwenye mzi nayo ivumile,<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Awegaiala want'hu wakwe nyama nyingi enga luvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:27">uwingi we videge enga msanga wa mnk'handa mwe bahali,<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Mnungu avitomosaga videge ivo mwe nk'hambi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:28">na kila hant'hu kuzunguluka mahema yawe yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Ivo want'hu wadyaga na kusigaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:29">kwaviya Mnungu awenk'haga kiya waungaga.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Mna umwo wandaga wakei kubinda ink'hande iyo waiungaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:30">naho yandaga ikei mwe milomo yawe,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />maya ya Mnungu nayemukwaga kwajili yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">niyo awakoma want'hu wata ludole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:31">na kuwakinya wabwanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Hamwenga na aya yose wagendelaga kudamanya wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:32">hamwenga ne vihungi vakwe hawamhuwile.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Ivo elo, akant'hikizaga miaka yawe enga muye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:33">wikazi wawe kwa file za kwitukiza.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Naho Mnungu eze awakome wamwenga wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">wadya wasigale wamuuiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:34">wakweiilaga niyo wamhitukila kwa mioyo yawe yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Wakumbukilaga naho kugamba Mnungu nuyo unyilikilo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:35">naho Mnungu ekulanga niye mkombozi ywawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Mna wamdant'hiizaga kwa ayo wamgambilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:36">milosi yawe kwakwe yandaga ni lulimi du.<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />Hawandaga naye kwa kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:37">wandaga hiyo wahuwilwa kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Mna Mnungu andilisaga na mbazi kwa kwa want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">Awausilaga wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">hawakomile pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">nk'hanana zose avuzaga kunyuma usengelo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:38">aselezaga amaya yakwe yatendese.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Akumbukilaga kugamba woho ni want'hu du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:39">wekala enga luheho du lukomboka holwiikuuya naho.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Nk'hanana nyingahi wandaga wakamsaguka kudya kwe nyika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:40">naho wamgelesaga kinyulu kudya kwe dijangwa!<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Naho wandaga wakauiya uiya kumgeza Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:41">na kumgela usungu uyo Akukile ywa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Hawakukumbukila udahi wakwe mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:42">kwe dizua awalavaga kwa wank'hondo wawe,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />mwe dizuwa alagisaga vihungi kudya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:43">mbuli za kweheela kudya kwe isi ya Soani.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Imito aitendaga kunda sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:44">Wamisili hawadahaga kunywa mazi ya mwe mito yawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Awakupuilaga matuluma ya sofulo yawagelaga nk'huswa nk'huswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:45">na majula ayo yabanangaga isi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Naho awegailaga mp'hasi zadyaga vihandwa vawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:46">na sige zabanangaga ulozo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Fula ya maiwe yakocholaga zizabibu zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:47">heho kulu niyo dyakungudisa maziti yawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Alekaga zing'ombe zawe zinyeelwe ni fula ya maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:48">niyo ayatowa mafyo ye mifugwa yawe kwa lukuwa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Ayalekelaga maya yakwe mwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:49">maya yatendese, kuihiwa kwakwe, makunt'ho, enga fyo dya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wo ubanangi.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Alekelaga maya yakwe yagendeele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">hawahonyile wase kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:50">mna awakomaga na maine.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Awakomaga nt'hula sasu wose wa Wamisili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:51">wose welekwe nk'hongo mwe mp'huga ye dihema dya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Niyo awasamiza want'hu wakwe enga fyo dya mifugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:52">awalongozaga mwe dijangwa enga ngoto.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Awalongozaga vedi haheina kogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:53">mna ibahali niyo yawakubila wank'hondo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Awegalaga kwe isi ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:54">kwe milima aitahaga mwenye kwa udahi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Awagulusaga want'hu wa si nt'huhu kwajili yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">niyo awapangila isi inde ukipe wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:55">na kuwahumuza Izilaeli mwe isi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Mna wamgezaga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">naho wasaguka kwa Mnungu mta udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:56">hawatimile zisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Nivo wandaga wakale wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">wandaga waiha naho hi wa kukawiilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:57">wandaga enga uta hewiina ndima.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Wamwiihizaga Mnungu kwa vilingo vo kuivika milungu yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:58">wakwezelaga wivu wakwe kwajili ya mahili yawe.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Mnungu engilaga maya eze ayaone ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:59">niyo awalemela Izilaeli kindedindedi, kugamba hiyo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Aulekaga ukalo wakwe kudya Shilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:60">dihema adiikaga mgati mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Adilekelaga disanduku dye ndagano ditahigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:61">ung'azi wakwe mwe mikono ya wank'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Niyo awenk'hiza want'hu wakwe wachinjigwe kwa sime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:62">na kuuihiya ukipe wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Moto wawakomaga wana kilume wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:63">wanakike wawe hawakemelwe mila ya ndoza.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Walavant'hambiko wawe wakomwagwa ni zisime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:64">wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe walemezwagwa kuhongeza.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Niho Zumbe anukaga enga ivo mnt'hu akulawa mwe zint'hongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:65">enga mtowani akuleukwa mwe mwo ukozi.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Awatowaga wank'hondo na kuwahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:66">niyo awagela soni za mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Mna wawalemelaga welekwa wa Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:67">naho dikabila dya Ifulaimu hadisagule,<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />vituhu vakwe kasagula dikabila dya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:68">no mnima wa Sayuni uwo auungisaga.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Ahazengaga hakukile hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">enga kaya yakwe ya kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:69">itogile mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Amsagulaga Daudi mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:70">amlavaga uko kwa madimilo ye zingoto,<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />kulawa mwo udimi we zingoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">amtendaga ande mdimi ywa want'hu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:71">mdimi ywa Izilaeli awo wakipe wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Daudi awadimaga kwa moyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:72">na kuwalongoza kwa mizungu.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo kwajili ya uyokozi wa si</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />We Mnungu, want'hu watakwiza waikump'hukila isi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">waigela usavu Nyumba yako ikukile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:1">waitenda Yelusalemu kunda hame.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Vimba va wandima wako, waink'hiza idigwe ni madege ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:2">vimba vawe va want'hu wako vinda nk'hande ya makala mbago.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Wetila sakame ya want'hu wako enga mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">itilwa enga mazi mwe Yelusalemu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:3">naho hahali yeyose ywa kuwamosela msanga awo wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Kinda kint'hu cha soni mwe si zimgihi na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:4">wakiseka na kukitendela lubezo.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Zumbe noukifiile maya mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:5">Maya yako nayagendeele kukweela enga moto?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Wakuuile maya yako kwa si heziikukuvika weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:6">kwa want'hu hewekulombeza zina dyako,<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />kwaviya wawakoma want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:7">naho wabananga pele zikaya zawe.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Usekukisulumiza kwo wavu wa wakale wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">Usunguze kukionela mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:8">kwaviya chaza kawiilo.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Uchambize weye Mnungu mkombola ywetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kiyokole na kukiusila wavu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:9">kwajili ye nt'hogola yako weye mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Nii want'hu wa si nt'huhu wakiuze kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">“Ekuhi Mnungu ywenyu?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">Ukilagise ivo ukuwalihiza want'hu wa si nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:10">wakomi wa wandima wako.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Uitegeleze indilo ya wavugailwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:11">uwaike ulekelwa awo wasengelwe kukomwa.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Uwalihize nk'hanana mfugate awo wa hagihi na suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:12">awo wakubeile weye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Naswe want'hu wako, zingoto za madimilo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">nekikutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 79:13">na kukutunya lupisi lwose lukwiza.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwajili ya want'hu wa si</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Ukitegeleze weye mdimi ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">weye ukumlongoza Yusufu enga fyo dya ngoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:1">uking'azile weye wikale mwe viumbwa vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi,<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />mwa makabila ya Ifulaimu, Benjamini na Manase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">lwinule ludole lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:2">wize ukiyokole.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Weye Mnungu, ukivuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">ukikaule kwa mbazi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:3">naswe nekiyokolwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:4">nouheleze ini kufiila maya want'hu wako wakukulombeza?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Kukink'ha ludyo lwa kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:5">kukinywesa masozi yamemile mwe kiyamp'ha.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Kinda wank'hondo kwa wadya wakizunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:6">waihi wetu wakitendela ubezo.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Ukivuze weye Mnungu mta ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:7">kionele mbazi naswe nekiyokolwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Kuuleta mzabibu kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kuwagulusa want'hu wa si nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:8">kuuhanda woho mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Wauhaiilaga vileke ukule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:9">nawo wengizaga maizi niye wenela mwe isi yose.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Kizuli chakwe chagubikaga milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:10">niyo matambi yakwe yaigubika mielezi mikulu.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Matambi yakwe yageendelaga mpaka kwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:11">masukiza yakwe nayo mpaka kwo mto Eufulate.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Haluse nii ukalumola lukazi lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:12">vikuleka kila akombokela aho anonola zizabibu zakwe?<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Nguluwe za kwe mbago zaukochola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:13">naho makala ya kwe nyika yapata ludyo.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Kiuiye weye Mnungu mta udahi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">hake ukaule kulawa kwe mbingu vileke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:14">uudime mzabibu uno,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />ni mti uuhandile kwa mkono wako wo kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:15">mwana umleile kwajili yako mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Waukant'ha na kuutimp'ha moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">wakaule kwa maya yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:16">uwabanange pele.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Mkono wako umwamile mnt'hu umsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:17">mwana mnt'hu umuumbile kwajili yako mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Hake kileke naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:18">kink'he ugima suwe kikuvike.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi wose, ukivuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 80:19">kionele mbazi naswe nekiyokolwe.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa zuwa dya kinyemi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Mkemeleni Mnungu ywo ludole lwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:1">kemeni mila ya nt'hogola Mungu ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Ukongeni uwila mkatowa malimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:2">toweni zeze na kinubi kwa izwi dyedi.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Toweni magunda ya mp'hembe ze zingoto mwe dizuwa dya kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:3">dyo kufosa mnenge na mwo mnenge ukint'hile,<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />ivi nivo kili kihendo kwa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:4">sigilizi ya Mnungu ywa Yakobo.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Awenk'haga malagizo Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:5">umwo aitowaga isi ya Misili.<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />“Miye namtulaga zint'wika zako mwa maega yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:6">mikono yakwe niyo yanda hainule nt'hangulu izamile.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Wanitanga niyo nakuyokola umwo wandaga na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">nakwitikaga kwa kutint'hila kulawa kwo ufiso wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:7">Miye nawagezagani kudya kwa mazi ya Meliba. <verse eid="PSA 81:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />Nitegelezeni,nyuwe want'hu wangu, miye namikanyani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:8">Hegu nevinda vedi mwanitegeleze Waizilaeli!<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Kusekunda na mnungu mtakwiza kwenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:9">usekumvika mnungu mtuhu.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Ni miye Mnungu ywako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">uyo akulavile kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:10">wasame mnomo wako name nohwank'hize.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />Mna want'hu wangu hawanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:11">Izilaeli hawaungile kuniva.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Elo hiwaleka wagendeele ne zink'hani zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:12">watimile zifanyanyi zawe.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />Nevinda vedi want'hu wangu wanitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:13">naho viwagilwa wanitimile yadya huunga,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />hegu nehisunguza kuwatowa wank'hondo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:14">naho udahi wangu hegu nouwahiga awo wakuwasulumiza.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Naho wose wakumwiihiya Zumbe nawengile kinyulu wakadugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:15">masulumizo yawe ya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Mna nyuwe Izilaeli nehiwenk'hani ludyo lwa ngano yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 81:16">na kuwegusani na uki ukulawa mwe mp'hanga ya luwe.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Mnungu akimaila he kitala chakwe kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:1">alava usengelo mwe midugano ya milungu.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />“Nouheleze ini kusengela haheina uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:2">na kuwagombela want'hu wavu!<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Wenk'heni uwagilwa wawe heweina ludole na wana nk'hiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:3">waoneleni mbazi wakuhujilwa na heweina kint'hu.”<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Myokoleni kulawa mwa want'hu waihile.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />“Nyuwe hammanyize chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">mmema kuhujila uuko du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:5">uwagilwa haumuli mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Nehigamba, ‘Nyuwe milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:6">naho mwi wana wa Mnungu ekulanga vitendese.’<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Nombanike enga ivo wakubanika want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:7">ugima wenyu una uheelo enga wakulu wowose watuhu.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Mnungu so uwasengele want'hu wa si yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 82:8">kwaviya si yose ni ukipe wako.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s">Izilaeli walombeza kuwahuma wank'hondo wawe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />We Mnungu usekunyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:1">usekuhumula, usekwikala kinyamaile.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Wank'hondo wako wegala nk'humbizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:2">hewekukuunga wenula mitwi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Waika mizungu kinyele wawalumize want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:3">wafanyanya kuwakoma want'hu wako ukuwaungisa.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Wakagamba,“Soni kiwabanange pele Waizilaeli awa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:4">vileke wasekukumbukilwa naho.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Heiye, waika mzungu kwa hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:5">waika kilapi wakuhige weye.<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Want'hu wa Edomu na Waishumaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:6">want'hu wa Moabu na Wahagali,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />want'hu wa Gebali, want'hu na wa Amoni, na Waamaleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:7">Wafilisiti na Watilo.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Waashulu, nawo waivana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:8">wawambize welekwa wa Lutu.<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Watendele enga ivo wawatendile Wamidiani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:9">naho enga kwa Sisela na Yabini kudya kwo mto wa Kishoni.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />Wadya wawakomaga pele kudya Edoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:10">niyo vimba vawe vanda enga nt'hagata mwe sanga.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Watende vilongozi wawe enga ivo uwatendile Olebu na Zeebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:11">watende wakulu wawe enga ivo uwatendile Zeba na Zalimuna.<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />Awo nawo wagambile, “Kiitahe isi ina madimilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:12">wakeguhile isi ya Mnungu inde yawe.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />We Mnungu, wamwaganise awo enga nt'hifu ya sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:13">naho wande enga mabuwa yakupuputiswa ni mp'heho ya kasungula.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Enga ivo moto ukoka mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:14">naho enga ndilija za moto zikoka nyasi za milima,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />elo, wakulumbuze na mjubwaniso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:15">na kuwagela lukeng'ent'ha kwa heho dya nk'hung'unt'ho.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Wagele soni mwe vihanga vawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:16">vileke wauzungule udahi wako.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Nawageligwe soni na kinyulu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:17">wasile pele haheina kuonelwa mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Wamanye kugamba ni weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 83:18">weye niwe wi kulanga vitendese kujink'ha wose.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s">Nk'hwina za kunda mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Nyumba yako ina utana uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:1">weye Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi.<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Miye nna nk'hwina kwikala mwo mzengwe we Nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">naho moyo no mwili wangu wose wakema kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:2">na kumuwangila Mnungu mta udahi.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Hata machole yose yapata ukalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">mbayumbayu nazo zizenga masasa yao uumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">ziwanguila makinda yawe uumwo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">hagihi ne kilingo chako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">weye Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:3">Mnungu ywangu, Seuta ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Wana kinyemi wose wakwikala mwe nyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:4">mazua yose wakukukemela mila ya nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Kinyemi ni chawe wadya wakupata ludole kulawa kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:5">wakumunk'hilwa kuita kwo mnima wako Sayuni, kwa kukutunya.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Wakomboka mwe dikolongo dinyaile dya Baka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">wadihitula kunda hant'hu ha nc'hoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:6">naho fula za vuli zafukula makawa ya mazi.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Wagendeela kupatisa ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:7">naho nawamuone Mnungu ywe milungu uko Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi, nitegeleze kiya hukulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:8">Weye Mnungu ywa Yakobo unive.<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Weye Mnungu, umvikile seuta ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:9">seuta uyo umsagule.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Kwikala zuwa dimwenga mwe Nyumba yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">ni vedi kujink'ha kwikala mazua alufu hant'hu hatuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">Nivedi vitendese nandile mwamizi ywo mzengwe ye Nyumba ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:10">kujink'ha kwikala kwe zinyumba za want'hu waihile.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Zumbe Mnungu niye ung'azi wetu utendese na nk'hindo yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">akivikila kwa yedi na nt'hunyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">hakuwanyima vint'hu vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 84:11">kwa wose wakudamanya yakwelela.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Weye Zumbe ywo udahi, wana kinyemi wose wakukuhuwila.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza uvikilwa wa isi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Zumbe kunda ywedi kwa want'hu wako wa mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:1">kuwatenda want'hu wako wa Izilaeli kunda wapati.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Kuusa wavu wa want'hu wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:2">weye kuyagubikiza maihi yawe wadamanye.<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Kuyaika hale maya yako mwa suwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:3">kuvuza kunyuma luhahila lwa maya yako.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Ukivuze weye Mnungu myokozi ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:4">ukimalise maya yako mwa suwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Togola noukionele maya mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:5">Nougendeleze maya yako kwe vyeleko vose?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Weye kukinula na kukink'ha ugima naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:6">vileke want'hu wako waone kinyemi kwako?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />We Zumbe, kilagise lukunde lwako ho lukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:7">ukink'he no uyokozi wako.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Nenimwive kiya akulonga Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">alagana utondowazi kwa suwe want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:8">uneva hakina uiye kwe zimbuli zetu ze kihezi.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Ikindedi, uyokozi uhagihi na wose wakumwogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:9">vileke ung'azi wakwe wikale mwe isi yetu.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Lukunde holukusila hamwenga na uhuwilwa vekala hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:10">uwagilwa hamwenga na utondowazi vahamp'hikana.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Uhuwilwa wasukila kulawa mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:11">uwagilwa wakaula hasi kulawa kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Heiye, Zumbe naakink'he uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:12">isi nayo neinde na ulozo.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Wawagilwa nawamlongoele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 85:13">na kumwiikila lumwe sila yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Unitegeleze weye Mnungu niyo wanihitula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:1">kwaviya miye ni mkiwa hiina wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Uuhonye ugima wangu miye kwaviya nakukawiila weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:2">niyokole miye mndima ywako hukawiila kwako.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Ni weye Mnungu ywangu, nionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:3">miye nakwiila weye msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Nink'he kinyemi weye Zumbe ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:4">kwaviya makawiilo yangu ye kwako.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Weye Zumbe u ywedi naho wawausila want'hu masa yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:5">kumema lukunde kwa wose wakukulombeza.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Unitegeleze kulombeza kwangu, weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:6">unitegeleze miye huiila wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Makunt'ho yakaniziila nakwitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:7">kwa viya weye wanitika.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Hakuli mnungu mtuhu enga weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:8">naho hahali adamanye enga ayo ukudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Want'hu wose wa isi zose uwaumbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">naweze kwako na kwinamiza vihanga vawe hasi ya aho wili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:9">nawabwelekeze ukulu we dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Kwaviya weye ywi mkulu naho wadamanya va kweheela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:10">weye wikedu niwe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Zumbe ywangu, nihinize kudamanya viya ukuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:11">name neniyatimile kwa uhuwilwa,<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Nohutogole kwa moyo wangu wose weye Zumbe, Mnungu ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:12">neniutunye ukulu we dizina dyako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Lukunde lwako kwangu lukulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:13">Kuniyokola miye kulawa kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Mnungu, want'hu wakukeduvya wanikump'hukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">fyo dya makwank'hwalu waunga wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:14">ni want'hu hewe kukogoha weye.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu ni mta mbazi naho uywedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">weye hukukump'huka mwa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:15">weye kumema lukunde na uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Nihitukile unionele mbazi, nigele ludole naho uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:16">kwaviya miye ni mndima ywako enga ivo andaga mnala.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, nilagise ivo wili uwedi wako kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">wose hewekuniunga nawengile soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 86:17">aho wakaona kugamba kunambiza na kunihumuza.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Mnungu kazenga mzi wakwe kwo vinenengwa ve milima ukukile<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Zumbe Mnungu kauungisa zink'hili za Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:2">kujink'ha wikalo mtuhu wowose.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Mbuli za nt'hogola zasimwuilwa mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:3">weye mzi wa Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />“Want'hu wa Misili na Babeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">ni hamwenga na watuhu wanimanyize miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">want'hu wa Filisiti, want'hu wa Tilo, na Isiopia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:4">Awa wose welekwa wa Sayuni.”<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Naho mwa Sayuni neilongwe kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">want'hu wa si zose ni wa hadya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:5">naho mta udahi ywa kulanga naamwink'he ludole.<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Zumbe Mnungu naawandike mwe kitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">umwo akawawaza want'hu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:6">Uyo kelekwa uko.<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Wakakema na kuvina</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 87:7">“Sayuni ni chotoko cho uvikilwa wetu.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu myokozi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:1">miye nakuiila kilo na msi.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Unive kiya hulombeza kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:2">nitegeleze hakulombeza wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Higubikwa ni makunt'ho mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:3">naho haluse nihagihi na kubanika.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Hinda enga wose wakuita kwe isi ya wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:4">ludole lwose lunisila.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Hijaligwa hamwenga na wabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">enga wachinjigwe walambale kwe vikuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">hewe kukumbukilwa naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:5">heweemuli mwo udimi wako.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Kuniduula kwo mnyongomela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:6">kwe mwina una ziza dititihale.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Maya yako yanizamila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:7">kunizinganiza ne mijubwaniso yako.<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Kuwatenda wambuya zangu waninyilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">kunitenda ywa kuihiza kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:8">hivugailwa kundani hiikudaha kunyilika.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Meso yangu hayakukaula vedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">kila zuwa nakuiila weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:9">naho nenula mikono yangu kwako halombeza wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Togola vihungi vako wawalagisa wabanike?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:10">Woho wenuka kwiza kukutogola?<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Togola lukunde lwako lwabilikizwa kwe vikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:11">hegu uhuwilwa wako watambulwa hant'hu ha ubanangi?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Vihungi vako vamanyika kwe diziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:12">hegu uwedi wako kwe isi ijaligwe?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Mna miye nalombeza wambizi kwako Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:13">kila mtondo kulombeza kwangu kwevika kwako.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Zumbe Mnungu, nii waniduula hale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:14">Nii kukefisa hale na miye?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Hidugana na masulumizo hagihi na kubanika kukongela ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:15">hidugana na wogofi wako niyo nengila chevu.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Maya yako yakutisa yanombokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:16">wogofi wako unibananga pele,<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />msi wose yanizunguluka enga ugubiko wa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:17">higubikwa nt'hendelo zose.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Wambuya zangu na weyangu wose wanasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 88:18">ziza ditithale dinda nidyo dimbuyangu.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s">Ndagano ya Mnungu ywa Daudi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, miye nenikeme mbuli yo lukunde lwako lukulu holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:1">nenibilikize uhuwilwa wako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Nabilikiza kugamba, lukunde lwako lukulu lwekala mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:2">uhuwilwa wako lutoga enga ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Nokugamba, “Hiika ndagano na mnt'hu ywangu nimsagule;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:3">hiika kilapi kwa mndima ywangu Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />‘Mazuwa yose nenimwiike mwelekwa ywako kunda seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:4">neniutende useuta wako unde wa mazuwa yose.’”<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Mbingu zitogole mbuli zako za kweheela ukudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:5">want'hu wakukile wakeme nt'hunyo zako weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Uko kwe mbingu, ni ani akudaha kuliganyizwa na weye Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:6">Ni ani enga weye mwe viumbwa vose va kwe mbingu?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Mnungu wogoheswa mwe kitala cha wakukile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:7">watisa kujink'ha wose wakukuzunguluka.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Hahali mdahi enga weye Zumbe Mnungu ywo udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:8">weye Zumbe Mnungu, ywi mhuwilwa mwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Weye wekaila bahali ina mjubwaniso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:9">mazi yakwe yakajubwanika weye wayatondowaza.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Weye wamntigint'haga Lahabu niyo anda enga kakomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">niyo wawamwaganisa wank'hondo wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:10">kwa mkono wako una ludole.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Mbingu na si vose vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:11">ni weye waumbaga si na vose vimndani mwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Waumbaga uko kusini na kasikazini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:12">mnima Taboli na Helimoni wadionela kinyemi dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Weye ni mdahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:13">ludole lwako lukulisa.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Uwagilwa no usengelo niyo ink'hongelo yo useuta wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:14">lukunde no uhuwilwa wako vakelagisa mwo udamanyi wako wose.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Wana kinyemi wadya wakukuvika kwa kukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:15">wakwikala mwo ung'azi wo undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Wangila dizina dyako msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:16">kwa uwagilwa wako want'hu watunywa.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Kwaviya weye ni ung'azi na ludole lwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:17">naho kwo uwedi wako kulung'aza ludole lwetu.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Kwaviya nk'hindo yetu ni ya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:18">uyo akukile ywa Izilaeli heena miyawe ni Zumbe Mnungu ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano dya Mnungu kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Aho kale walongaga na wandima wako wahuwilwa kwa sila ya maona ukagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">“Himwink'ha ludole mtowani yumwenga mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:19">hink'hiza ukulu kwa uyo nimsagule kulawa mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Himwink'ha useuta mndima ywangu Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:20">himwink'ha mwo undima kwa kumkumba mavuta yakukile.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Mkono wangu noumtozeleze mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:21">udahi wangu noumtende atoge.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Wank'hondo wakwe hawamdahe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:22">waihi hawadahe kumhuma.”<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Miye neniwahonde wank'hondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:23">neniwakome wose wakumwiihiya.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Lukunde lwangu no uhuwilwa wangu nevinde kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:24">kwa zina dyangu naapate uhumi mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Useuta wakwe neniukuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:25">kulawa kwe bahali mpaka kwe mito.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Naye naanitange akanigamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">Ni weye Tate Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:26">ni weye mwamizi myokozi ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Naho nenimtende ande nt'hula sasu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:27">akulise kujink'ha maseuta wose mwe si yose.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Lukunde lwangu kwakwe nolugendeelo mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:28">ndagano yangu na yehe neitoge.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Nenikigendeze cheleko chakwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:29">useuta wakwe enga mbingu heziikusila.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />“Mna uneva welekwa wakwe wanaileka imiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:30">hawanekale viligane ne zisigilizi zangu,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />wanabananga imiko yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:31">niyo waleka kutimila iyo huunga,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />neniwasulumize kwajili yo wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:32">na kuwatowa kwa maihi wadamanye,<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />mna henileke kumuunga Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:33">naho heniuse lagano dyangu kwakwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Miye henibanange ndagano yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:34">henihitule yadya nilongile.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Hikelisa lumwenga du kwa kukuka kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:35">naho henimdant'hilize Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Welekwa wakwe hawande na uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:36">useuta wakwe kwangu nounde enga zuwa,<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />nounde wa mazuwa yose enga mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:37">mlonga uwona uhuwilwa mwo ulanga.”<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhongezela mihumilwe ya Seuta.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Mna haluse weye Mnungu kumlemela na kumduula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:38">kumwiihiya uyo umsagule.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Kwiihizwa hamwenga ne ndagano yo mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:39">kuigela usavu nk'hofia yakwe ye kiseuta na kuiduula hasi.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Kumola zink'handula zakwe zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:40">magomela yakwe kuyatenda mahame.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Wose wakumwombokela hagihi wauguhaga ugoli wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:41">kanda ni ywa kubeligwa ni wambuyaze.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Wank'hondo wakwe kuwenk'ha uhumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:42">wadya wakumsulumiza kuwenk'ha kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Ikindedi, ukutwa kwe sime yakwe kukutenda fifigu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:43">naho humwambize mwe nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Kuuheleza udahi wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:44">kumhoka useuta wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Kumtenda asunguze kudalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:45">naho niyo wamgela uhuza.<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza ukombola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, neukefise mazuwa yose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:46">Maya yako nayakwele enga moto mpaka ini?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />We Zumbe Mnungu, ukumbukile wikazi wangu ivo wili mguhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:47">ni kihi kilekile mnt'hu akaumbwa!.<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Ni mnt'hu ywani neekale haheina kubanika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:48">Naho ni ani akudaha kunyilika mwe kikuta?<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Zumbe, lwikuhi haluse lukunde lwako ludya lwa nk'hongo holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:49">ludya wamwiikilaga kilapi kwa uhuwilwa uyo mndima ywako Daudi?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Zumbe Mnungu, kumbukila ivo mdima ywako akuhomolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:50">ivo hufinyiliza ukulongwa vihile ni want'hu hewekumanyize.<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Wank'hondo wako wanimtendela lubezo mndima ywako umsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 89:51">wamsimanga kila aho akuita.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Atunywe Zumbe Mnungu, mazuwa yose!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 89:52" />
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:52">Taile! Taile!<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">KITABU CHA KANE</para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu kunda ukalo wetu kwa vyeleko vose.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Hata aho milima yandaga ikei kuumbigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">hegu aho si yose yandaga ikei kuumbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">weye wandaga ywa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:2">naho ni weye Mnungu hwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Weye wawavuza want'hu mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:3">ukakigamba, “Nyuwe want'hu, uyeni umwo mwalawaga.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Kwako weye miyaka alufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">ni enga zuwa dimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">ni enga zuwa dya gulo dyomboke kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:4">ni enga luzo lumwenga lwa kilo kimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Wawakubila want'hu mwe isi wanda enga nt'hongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">Want'hu wanda enga mani mahya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:5">enga sukwe ya nomtondo,<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />yasuka kwa uhya aho mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:6">mna ikabula kisingi yanyuluka na kunyala.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Maya yako yakiusa pele mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:7">naho luhahila lwako lukiika mwo wagofi.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Maihi yetu kuyaika aho wili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:8">wavu wetu wa kwe kinyele wi ho unga'zi wo undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Kwaviya mazua yetu yose yombokela mwo luhahila lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:9">miyaka yetu yasunguza kusila enga muye.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Mazuwa yo wikazi wetu ni milongo mfungate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">uneva nekinde na ludole neibule milongo mnane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">mna hamwenga na ayo kimwa makunt'ho na masulumizo du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:10">naho vasunguza kusila niyo chagiila tolwa.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Niani amanyize udahi wa maya yako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:11">kwa viya luhahila lwako lukulisa viwagilwe suwe kukogoha.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Elo kihinize suwe kimanye kuwaza mazuwa yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:12">vileke kinde na moyo wa mizungu.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Maya yako nayasile ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:13">Unde na mbazi kwa wandima wako weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Ukiguse kwa lukunde lwako kila mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:14">naswe nekikeme na kwanga mwo wikazi wetu wose.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Kink'he kinyemi viligane na mazuwa wakisulumizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:15">enga ivo lupisi lwa makunt'ho chayaonaga.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Wandima wako wauwone udamanyi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:16">welekwa wako nawo wauone ung'azi wako utendese.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Uwedi wa Zumbe Mnungu ywetu unde mwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 90:17">ukink'he upati mwe zindima kikudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye akwachamila</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Yeyose naande mwo wamizi wa Mnungu ekulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:1">akuunga ekale mwo udimi wo mta udahi,<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />nenimgambile Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">“Ni weye unyilikilo na gomela dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:2">niwe Mnungu ywangu, weye dikawiilo dyangu.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Naakuyokole ne mitego winikilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:3">na kukulava mwe maine yakukoma.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Naakugubike na mazoya yakwe na mawawa yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">houbwiilwe ni maihi ukanda mwo udimi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:4">uhuwilwa wakwe noukwamile na kukudima.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Howogohe wogofi wa kilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:5">hegu misale ikulasa nomsi,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />enga mavuma yakwiza mwo lwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:6">maihi yakukoma nomsi.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Hata uneva want'hu alufu wanagweela hagihi na weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">naho watuhu alufu mlongo wagweele kulume kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:7">weye houlumizwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Weye noukaule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:8">niyo waona ivo wakusulumizwa want'hu hiwawagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Kwaviya Mnungu kanda unyilikilo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:9">kumtenda uyo ekulanga kunda hant'hu hako ha kwikala,<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />hayakuli makunt'ho nayakwiziile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:10">hegu nk'huswank'huswa mwe kaya yako.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Kwaviya naawagambe watumigwa wakwe wa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:11">nawakudime mwe zisila zako zose.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />nawakwinule mwe mikono yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:12">unase kukobadisa ikiga chako mwe iwe.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Noujate simba na mazoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:13">simba zina maya na mazoka yana usungu.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Neniwayokole wadya wakuniunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:14">neni wamile kwaviya wamanya kugamba ni miye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Umwo wakanitanga neniwetike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">neninde nawo umwo wakadugana na makunt'ho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:15">Neniwayokole na kuwatunya.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Neniwenk'he kwikalisa mwe isi na kuwenk'ha va kwigusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 91:16">naho neniwayokole.<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Ni mbuli yedi ya kumtogola Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:1">na kukukemela nt'hunyo weye Mnungu ywa kulanga.<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />Kubwelekeza mtondo lukunde lwako holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:2">no uhuilwa wako aho nekilo,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />kwa ukemi wa zeze na sindamgunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:3">na maizwi dya kinubi.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Kunitenda ninde na kinyemi kwa udamanyi wako mkulu weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:4">nenizikemele kwa kwanga zindima zako zose udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Udamayi wako ukulisa weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:5">fanyanyi zako ni lufyambo lukulise.<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Mnt'hu mhezi hakudaha kulufyambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:6">heiina ubala hakudaha kukombaganya.<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />Want'hu hiwawagilwa nawande wapati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">naho wakudamanya yaihile nawapatise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:7">mna uheelo wawe ni kubanika pele.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Mna weye Zumbe kukuka mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Kwaviya wank'hondo wako weye Zumbe, nawabanike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:9">naho wakudamanya uwihi nawamwaganiswe.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Kunink'ha ludole enga jeku dya mbogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:10">kunivikila kwa kunink'ha kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Hiona ukutoigwa kwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:11">naho hiva ndilo kwa wadya wakudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Wawagilwa nawatime enga mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:12">nawande enga ziti dikwitangwa muelezi wa uko Lebanoni,<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />wanda enga maziti yahandigwe mwe nyumba ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:13">nawagendeele kukula mwe Nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Nawande na cheleko hata wakadalahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:14">mazuwa yose nawande wateke na usula mwingi,<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />wakabwelekeza kugamba Zumbe ni muwagilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 92:15">naho niye digomela dyangu hediina wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye Seuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Zumbe Mnungu ni seuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">kavala ukulu na kukekaka ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">si iikwa itogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:1">heidahike kuusigwa.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Useuta wako watogaga kukongela aho nk'hongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:2">naho weye wandaga uuko umwo misimo yandaga ikei kukonga.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />We Zumbe Mnungu mito ilave mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">mito yakweza maizwi yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:3">mito yakweza kuvumila kwawe.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Zumbe Mnungu ni mkulu kujink'ha mvumilo wa mazi mengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kakulisa kujink'ha mjubwaniso wa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:4">kakulisa heviikuligana na mvumilo wa malao.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Zumbe, sigilizi zako zina udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">Nyumba yako ikukisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 93:5">mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye akuwasengela want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Zumbe Mnungu, ni weye Mnungu akulihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:1">laila vileke uwasulumize.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Weye ukuwasengela want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:2">Laila uwalihe kiya kiwawagile wakukeduvya!<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Zumbe Mnungu, waihi nawagendeele mpaka ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:3">Want'hu hi wawagilwa nawagendeele kukeduvya mpaka ini?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Awa walonga milosi ya kukeduvya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:4">naho wakefenyela wiihi wawe.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, want'hu wako wakomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:5">wawasulumiza want'hu weli ugoli wako.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Wawakoma wabanikilwe ni walume zawe na watakwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:6">na kuchinja heweina tate yawe.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Waihi awo wagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu hakuona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:7">Mnungu ywa Izilaeli hamanyize.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Nyuwe wahezi mwa want'hu, fanyanyeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:8">Nyuwe wabwalasi, nomnde wabala umwo ini?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Togoleni, Mnungu aumbile magutwi yetu haadahe kwiva?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:9">Naho uyo akink'hile ameso hakudaha kuona?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Akuwaogola awant'hu asekuwafank'hila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:10">Akuhiniza want'hu aswesa umanyi?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Mnungu kamanya zifanyanyi za want'hu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:11">Kamanya kugamba fanyanyi zawe hazina dyodyose.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Ana kinyemi yudya ukuogolwa ni weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:12">yudya ukumhiniza zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Nouwenk'he kinyemi wakalawa mwa makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:13">mpaka aho waihi nawasimbilwe bome.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Mnungu haawaleke want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:14">haawajale weli wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Usengelo nowomboswe kwa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:15">naho wata miyoyo yedi nouwelele.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Niani akuunga anambize mwa waihi kwajili yangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:16">Niani akunga awahige wakutenda uwihi?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Yandile Zumbe Mnungu hanambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:17">miye hegu nehisunguza kuita kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Aho nize nigambe, “Nateela.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">Lukunde lwako holukusila weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:18">nulo lunambize.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Nize nindilise na kiyangayanga mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:19">weye nokunink'ha utondowazi na kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Weye hukunda hamwenga na walamuzi wakuhujila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:20">Wakuzaganya uwagilwa wa want'hu wakamila wiihi wawe,<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />waika mizungu iihile kwa want'hu heweina malema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:21">na kusengela kukomwa kwa heweina masa.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu niye mwamizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:22">Mnungu ywangu niye akunidima.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Naawalihize kwa wiihi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">na kuwakoma pele kwa wavu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 94:23">Zumbe Mnungu ywetu naawabinde pele.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Soni kimkemele Zumbe Mnungu kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:1">kimwangile kwa kinyemi yehe akuchamila na kukiyokola.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Kiite kwakwe kwa nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:2">kimwangile kwa mila ya kumtunya.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu niye Mnungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:3">niye seuta mkulu mwe milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Si yose imwo udahi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:4">vinenengwa ve milima vose ni vakwe.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Bahali ni yakwe niye aidamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:5">naho yehe niye aumbile si.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Soni, kifunamize vihanga hasi kimvike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:6">kifike madi ha Zumbe Mnungu akiumbile.<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />Yehe niye Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">naswe kiwant'hu wakwe akukidima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">ni enga ngoto zo madimilo yakwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:7">Ni vedi mtegeleze kiya akulonga Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />“Msekunda wank'hani enga ivo wandaga wakale wenyu kudya Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:8">enga ivo wandaga kudya Masa kwe dijangwa,<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />aho wakale wenyu wanihimaga na kunigeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:9">hamwenga nakugamba waonaga ayo nawadamanyilaga.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Cheleko iki chanigelaga kinyulu kwa miaka milongo mine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">niyo nagamba, ‘Ikindedi awa ni want'hu wasaguke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:10">Hawazimanyize sila zangu.’<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Nengilwagwa ni maya niyo nakelisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Wasekwingila mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 95:11">nehaunga niwenk'heni wahumule.’”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye seuta mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu wila mhya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:1">Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu weye si yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu na kuditunya dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:2">bwelekezeni uyokozi wakwe mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Wabwelekezeni want'hu wa si, ukulu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:3">wagambileni want'hu wose zimbuli zakwe za kwehela.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu ni mkulu, atogolweswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:4">yehe ni ywa kwogoheswa kujink'ha milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Kwaviya milungu ya si nt'huhu hiyo kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:5">mna Zumbe Mnungu niye adamanye zimbingu.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Ukulu na ung'azi vi ho undiilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:6">udahi no uwedi vihakukile hakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Want'hu wa si zose, mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:7">utogoleni ukulu no udahi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Mwink'heni Zumbe Mnungu ukulu we dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:8">igaleni malavo mkengile mwe nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Mvikeni Zumbe Mnungu ho ung'azi wo ukulu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:9">want'hu wa si yose, zingizeni ho undiilo wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Wagambileni want'hu wa si yose, “Zumbe Mnungu niye seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">kaitenda si, itoge, haikudaha kusingisika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:10">Naawasengele want'hu wa si kwa uwagilwa.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Mbingu zinde na kinyemi, si nayo neyange.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:11">Bahali ivumile na vose vimndani.<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />Nk'honde na kila kiyumo vange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:12">maziti yose yemndani yakeme kwa kinyemi,<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />viumbwa vose vinde na kinyemi ho undiilo wakwe kwaviya eza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">eza aisengele si.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">Naaisengele si kwa uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 96:13">want'hu nawo mwe kindedi chakwe.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mnungu niye seuta ywa maseuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Zumbe Mnungu niye seuta, si neione kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:1">visiwa vingi vange kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Mavunde na ziza tilili dimzunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:2">uwagilwa ne kindedi nizo zink'hongelo ze difumbi dyakwe dye kiseuta.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Moto umlongoela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:3">niyo wawoka wank'hondo nt'hendelo zose.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Lumwemwe lwakwe lwaing'aza si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:4">want'hu wa mwe isi zose waluona na kuzingiza.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Milima yalungulumka ho undiilo wakwe enga nt'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:5">aho naande Zumbe Mnungu ywe si yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Zimbingu zabilikiza ukindedi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:6">naho want'hu wose wauona ukulu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Wakuvika mahili wose nawageligwe soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:7">naho wakuketogoela milungu misokezi, milungu yose yakefunamiza hakwe.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />We Zumbe Mnungu want'hu wa Sayuni wana kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">want'hu wa Yuda wanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:8">wanga kwajili yo usengelo wako.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Kwaviya weye Zumbe Mnungu ywi mkulu kujink'ha wose mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:9">naho kutunyiswa mwe milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Zumbe Mnungu awaungisa wakwiihiya wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">amila ugima wa want'hu wakwe wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:10">naho awayokola kulawa mwo udahi wa want'hu waihile.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Ung'azi wawazangazila want'hu wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:11">kinyemi ni kwa wata miyoyo yedi.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Wawagilwa wose mmuonele kinyemi Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 97:12">naho ditunyeni dizina dyakwe dikukile.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye mkulu ywe si yose</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu wila mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">kadamanya vint'hu va kweheela!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">udahi akwe na ludole lwakwe lukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:1">vimwink'ha uhumi.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Zumbe Mnungu kaulagisa uyokozi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:2">kautenda uwagilwa wakwe umanyike mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Kakumbukila lukunde lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">no uhuwilwa wakwe kwa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:3">want'hu wose mwe si wauwona uyokozi wa Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Want'hu wose mwe si mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:4">mtunyeni kwa mila ya kinyemi kwa kwanga.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Kemeni nt'hogola kwa Zumbe Mnungu kw mazee</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:5">hamwenga na mazeze mumtogole kwa maizwi yakwelela.<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />Hata kwa magunda na miluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:6">yatoweni kwa kinyemi ho undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu seuta ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Bahali na kila kimndani mwakwe nevivumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:7">si na vose vimnanga mwako navo vikeme.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Nyuwe mito na toweni magasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:8">milima ikeme hamwenga kwa kinyemi kwa Zumbe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />kwaviya eza kuisengela si kwa uwagilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">na want'hu we si</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 98:9">kwa uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye seuta mkulu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Zumbe Mnungu kaikaila si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">want'hu nawo wazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">kekala mwe viumbwa vina mawawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:1">si nayo yasingisika.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Uko Sayuni Zumbe Mnungu niye Mkulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:2">ana nt'hunyo kujink'ha si yose.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Kila yumwenga naatogole ukulu wakwe no kutisa kwe dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:3">Yehe niye Akukile.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Seuta mdahi; waungisa uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">uwagilwa kuutenda utoge mwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:4">kwigala uzumilwa no uwedi.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">fikeni madi na kufunamiza vihanga venyu aho heviga vakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:5">yehe niye Akukile.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Musa na Haluni wandaga mwa walavant'hambiko wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">Samweli naye andaga yumwenga mwa awo wandaga wakamlombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:6">awo wose wandaga wakamlombeza naye niyo aweva.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Alongaga nawo kulawa mwe mkola we divunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:7">watimilaga imiko ne zisigilizi awenk'haga.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu, wawahitulaga want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">wawalagisaga kugamba ni weye Mnungu ukuusila wavu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:8">Hamwenga na yo wawasulumizaga kwo wavu wawe.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Mtogoleni Zumbe, Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">mvikeni aho ho mnima wakwe ukukile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 99:9">Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywetu kakuka.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hunyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Mwangileni Zumbe Mnungu kwa kinyemi want'hu wa si yose.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Mvikeni Zumbe Mnungu kwa wila wa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:2">mwize aha eli kwa kukema. <verse eid="PSA 100:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Manyeni kugamba Zumbe niye Mnungu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">Ni yehe akiumbile, naswe kiwant'hu wakwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:3">suwe kiwant'hu wakwe, ki fyo dyake.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Ingileni kwe zink'hili ze Nyumba yakwe kwa nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">iteni kwe lwazo lwakwe kwa kumtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:4">mtogoleni na mditunye dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Zumbe ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 100:5">naho uhuwilwa wakwe haukusila.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s">Uhuwilwa wa seuta</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Nenikeme mbazi zako no uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:1">nohukemele nt'hunyo weye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Neninde na wengele haheina wikazi wa nk'halalizi kwa wambizi wako.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:2">Nenikale kwa moyo wedi na want'hu wa mwe nyumba yangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Naho heniuzumile uwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:3">naihiya ndima za wasaguke kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Unk'hani hounde mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:4">nenikeike hale na kila uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Akumziga miyawe kwa kinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">uyo nenimbanange,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">mta meso ya lubezo na moyo wa kukeduvya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:5">henifinyilize kwajili yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Neniwakaulise wahuwilwa mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">awo nawekale ho undiilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">wose hewekukalalizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:6">nawo nawanivike miye.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Mta nyambi heekale hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:7">mtondwe haasigale ho undiilo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Neniwakome mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">wakudamanya maihi mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">neniwabanange pele wose wakudamanya maihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 101:8">kulawa mwo mzi wa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa mnt'hu mta makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Zumbe Mnungu unitegeleze ivo hulombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:1">uive indilo yangu unambize!<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Usekuleka kunikaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">umwo handa na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">unitegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:2">hakwitanga usunguze kunink'ha uhituzi.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Kwaviya wikazi wangu watazuka enga mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:3">mavuha yangu yakweela enga moto wa nunda.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Moyo wangu wahuma, unyuluka enga mani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:4">hikukeiva hata kudya nk'hande.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Kwajili yo kuugula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:5">nk'handa yangu ikenamatiza mwa mavuha.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Hinda enga kungwi dya kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:6">enga kungwi mwa mahame.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Nacheleza meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:7">hinda enga kadege ike mnanga mwe nyumba.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Wank'hondo wangu wanibela msi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:8">wose wakuniihiya wanibela na kuniligita.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Maivu yanda niyo ink'hande yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:9">masozi yangu yakehanganya na mazi yangu yo kunywa,<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />kwajili ya maya yako yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:10">kuninula niyo waniduula.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Wikazi wangu ni enga kizuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:11">enga mani yanyaile.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu, ywi seuta ywa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:12">nt'hunyo zako zagendeela vyeleko vose.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Nowinuke na kuionela mbazi Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">habula hokumlagisa uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:13">lupisi lwe kindedi lubula.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Kwaviya wandima wako wayazumila maiwe yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">hamwenga na kugamba yamoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:14">wamuonela mbazi hata uneva kanda mahame.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Want'hu wose nawamwogohe Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:15">maseuta wose wa si nawogohe ukulu wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />umwo Zumbe Mnungu akauzenge uhya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:16">niyo akelaviliza mwo ukulu wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />umwo neeve kulombeza kwa wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:17">naawategeleze kulombeza kwawe.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Ino iwandikwe kwajili ye cheleko kikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:18">vileke wadya nawelekwe weze wamtunye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kakaula kulawa hakukile hakwe he kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:19">kaisungiila isi kulawa uko kwe mbingu,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />vileke eve kuugula kwa wavugailwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:20">na kuwalekela awo wasengelwe kukomwa.<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Ivo dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu dibwelekezwe uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:21">ne zint'hunyo zakwe uko Yelusalemu,<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />aho mafyo ya want'hu yakeza kukeduganya hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:22">no useuta ukeza kumvika Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Anihungulaga ludole umwo handa mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:23">autendaga wikazi wangu unde mguhi.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Nenigambe, “Weye Mnungu ywangu use kuniusa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">handa hinati nikule,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 102:24" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:24">weye Zumbe Mnungu wekala vyeleko na vyeleko.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Aho nk'hongo waumbaga si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:25">zimbingu nazo ni ndima ye mikono yako.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Ivi nevagiile mna weye ni ywa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">nevisakale enga valo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">nouvisakanye enga suke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:26">navo nevize viusigwe.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Mna ni weye ni uyudya mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:27">wikazi wako hauna uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Wana wa wandima wako nawekale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 102:28">welekwa wawe nawande wadahi.”<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s">Lukunde lwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Moyo wangu utogole Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:1">vose vi mwangu viditunye dizina dyakwe dikukile!<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />We moyo wangu mtogole Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:2">naho usekujala ukise wose ananawo.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Akuusila wavu wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:3">na kukuhonya manyonge yako yose.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Akukombola ugima wako, unasekwingila kwe kikuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:4">akuvala nt'hunyo ya lukunde na kukuonela mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Mwo ugima wako awigusa vint'hu vedi viya ukuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:5">ubwanga wako uvuzwe uhya enga wa ndege nyika.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Zumbe Mnungu niye akudamanya mbuli za uwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:6">na usengelo wa kindedi kwa wose wakuhujilwa.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Amlagisaga Musa sila zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:7">na udamanyi wakwe kwa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Zumbe ni mta mbazi na lukunde</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">hakusunguza kunda na maya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:8">lukunde lwakwe lutendesa.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Yehe hi ywa kufank'hila mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:9">hana maya ya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />Ivo akukitendela haviligane no wavu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:10">naho hakulihiza viligane no uwihi wetu.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Enga ivo wili uhale utendese we mbingu kulawa kwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:11">nivo vili lukunde lwakwe kwa wose wakuvika,<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />enga ivo vili vipangane hale ulailo wa zuwa na usweelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:12">nivo akuusila hale wavu ulawe mwetu,<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />enga ivo eli tate akuwaonela mbazi wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:13">nivo eli Zumbe kwa wose wakumwogoha,<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />kwaviya kamanya ivo kiumbigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:14">akumbukila kugamba suwe kilawa mwe nt'hifu yo ulongo.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Wikazi wetu mwe si ni enga mani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:15">yekala enga mabwali ya kwe nk'honde,<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />nk'hung'unt'ho yakung'unt'ha niyo yakeagila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:16">hant'hu hakwe hahaoneke naho.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Mna kwa wadya wakumvika Zumbe Mnungu, lukunde lakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:17">naho uwedi wake lwekala vyeleko na vyeleko,<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />kwa wahuwilwa wose we ndagano yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:18">na wakutimila zisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Zumbe Mnungu kaika difumbi dyakwe kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:19">yehe niye seuta ywa vint'hu vose.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Mtogoleni Zumbe nyuwe watumigwa wakulu wa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">nyuwe wadahi mkuzitoza zisigilizi zakwe;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:20">mkutegeleza yadya akulonga.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu nyuwe fyo dyose dya kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:21">Nyuwe wandima wakwe mkutenda yadya akuunga.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Nyuwe watumigwa vakwe wakulu wa kwe mbingu wose, mtogoleni Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">kila hant'hu mwo useuta wakwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:22" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 103:22">Weye moyo wangu mtogole Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s">Mtogoleni Zumbe Muumbi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Weye moyo wangu mtogole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">Zumbe Mnungu ywangu weye ywi mkulu kujink'ha wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:1">kuvala ung'azi utendese na ukulu,<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />kukegubika ung'azi enga valo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:2">zimbingu kuzikuzumbula enga hema,<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />na kuizenga kaya yako mnanga mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">na kuyatenda mavunde yande gali dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:3">kukwikala mnanga mwa mawawa ya mp'heho ikukung'unt'ha.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Wautenda nk'hung'nt'ho enga wegala ulosi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:4">ndilija za moto kunda watumigwa wa kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Aizengaga si mwe zink'hongelo zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:5">haikudahika kuuswa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Waigubikaga si kwa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:6">mazi ye mnanga mwe milima mitali.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Mna amazi yanyilikaga aho wize uyafank'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:7">izwi dyako dikwinga lukuwa mazi yanyilikaga.<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />Yaselaga mwe milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:8">niyo yaseleza kwa makolongo uko wayaikilaga.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Waikaga mihaka heyekudaha kwomboka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:9">yase kuigubika si naho.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Azitenda nc'hoko zitile mazi kwa makolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:10">mazi yakubwiluka mwe milima.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Numo yakunywa makala yose ye mwe mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:11">mp'hunda za kwo luwala nuko zikubindila zink'hilu zawe.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Madege ulanga yazenga vyaila mnk'handa mwa mazi.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Womela mazi mwe si kulawa kwe milima yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:13">naho waigusa si kwa ndima zako ukudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Atenda mani yahote nk'hande ya makala ye hengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:14">ne vihandwa enga ludyo lwa want'hu,<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />ne divai ya kutondowaza miyoyo ya want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">mavuta ya zeituni yakutelemeza zink'handa zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:15">mikate nayo ya kuwagela ludole.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Maziti ya Zumbe Mnungu yomeelwa vedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:16">miti ya mielezi ya Lebanoni iyo aihandile.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Numo madege yakuzenga vyaila vawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:17">nk'holongo nazo zazenga masasa mwa maziti yakwitangwa misonobali.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Ngulugulu zekala mwe milima mitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:18">unyilikilo wawe ni mwe zinyasi.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Kudamanya mnenge ukupanga misimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:19">zuwa nadyo dimanya lupisi lwakwe lwo usweelo.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Kwigala ziza niyo kwanda nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:20">makala mbago yose yafosa.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Simba zabuma zikongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:21">zazungula nk'hande zikwink'higwa ni Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Zuwa dikasomoka, nazo zakeitila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:22">na kutambala kwe zimp'hanga zawe.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Niho want'hu nawo waita kwe zindima zawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:23">kwo udamanyi wawe mpaka kisingi.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Zumbe Mnungu kudamanya vint'hu vibindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">kuvidamanya vose kwa mzungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:24">si imema viumbwa vako.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Iyuko uko bahali nk'hulu naho izangalamkise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">umwo mkwikala viumbwa vibindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:25">vina ugima vikulu na vidodo,<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />mashuwa na meli zagenda zaita na kuuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:26">hamwenga na Eliatani umuumbile asezige uumwo.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Vose ivo vakukawiila weye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:27">uvink'he ludyo lwawe, aho vikaunga kudya.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Wavink'ha niyo vadya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:28">wavink'ha nk'hande niyo veguta.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Huna vikaule vengilwa ni wogohi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">unavihoka umuye wako vaswesa ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:29">vauya mwo luvumbi.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Mna unavink'ha muye wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:30">wegala ugima mhya mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Ukulu wa Zumbe Mnungu wikale mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:31">Zumbe Mnungu naaonele kinyemi zindima zakwe adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Uyo akuikaula si niyo yasingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:32">akuikwafa milima niyo yalava mosi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Nenimkemele Zumbe Mnungu wikazi wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:33">Nenimkemele Mnungu ywangu mwa mazuwa yo wikazi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Kufanyanya kwangu kumwelele yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:34">haona kinyemi mwa yehe.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Want'hu wata wavu nawabanangwe pele mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">want'hu waihi wasekugendeela,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35">Mtogole Zumbe Mnungu we moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 104:35">mtogole Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu na want'hu wakwe Mis 16:8-22</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe bilikizeni ukulu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:1">wagambileni want'hu wa isi kiya adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Kemeni nt'hunyo kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:2">simuileni va kwehela viya adamanye.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Kefenyeleni dizina dyakwe dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:3">miyoyo ya wose wakumzungula, neinde na kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Mzunguleni Zumbe na udahi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:4">zunguleni undiilo wakwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Kumbukileni mbuli za kweheela adamanyaga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:5">vihungi vakwe na usengelo alongile,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />nyuwe welekwa wa Ibulahimu mndima wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:6">nyuwe welekwa wa Yakobo mndima ywakwe amsagule.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Yehe niye Zumbe Mnungu ywetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:7">usengelo wakwe umwe si yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Naakumbukile Indagano yakwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:8">kiya alagane ni kwa vyeleko alufu.<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Indagano aikile na Ibulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:9">ikilapi akekilisile kwa Isaka.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Zumbe Mnungu kaika ndagano na Yakobo inde sigilizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:10">na Izilaeli inde ndagano ya mazuwa yose,<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />agambaga, “Nohwink'he isi ya Kanaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:11">inde ukipe wenyu mwenye.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Want'hu wa Mnungu wandaga wageke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:12">watakwiza mwe isi ya Kanaani,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />wangadikaga isi na isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:13">seuta kwiita kwa seuta mtuhu.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Hamlekele yeyose awahujile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:14">hata maseuta awakanyaga kwajili yawe,<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />Akawagamba, “Msekuwakwafa wandima wangu niwasagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:15">mse kuwatendela maihi walotezi wangu.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Zumbe aletaga gumbo mwe isi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:16">niyo abananga nk'hande yose waihuwilaga.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Awalongolezelaga mnt'hu kulongole kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:17">uyo Yusufu atagwagwa uko kwo utumwa,<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />viga vakwe vanyinywagwa mp'hingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:18">ne minyololo ya kilama mwe singo yakwe,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />mpaka aho ulosi wakwe wize unde kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:19">kulagana kwa Zumbe kwize kukint'he kugamba kindedi yehe ni muwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Seuta ywa Misili awagambaga want'hu wamlohole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:20">mkulu ywa want'hu amlekelaga.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Amwiikaga kunda mkimalizi mwe nyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:21">na mta udahi mwe ugoli wose wa seuta.<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />Awalangilizaga vilongozi wose enga ivo aungile yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:22">na kuwahiniza mizungu wadala wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Izilaeli engilaga Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakobo andaga mtakwiza mwe isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Zumbe awagenyezaga want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:24">awatendaga wandilise na ludole kujink'ha wank'hondo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Awatendaga Wamisili wawaihiye want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:25">wawatendelaga ukwank'walu wandima wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Amtumaga mndima ywakwe Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:26">hamwenga na Haluni uyo amsagulaga.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Wadamanyaga kilagiso na vihungi va mwe isi ya Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:27">va kweheela mwe isi ya Hamu.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Mnungu agubikaga lwiza mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:28">mna Wamisili wagendelaga kusaguka.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Ayatendaga mazi yawe kunda sakame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:29">niyo akoma zisamaki zawe zose.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Majula yamemeaga mwe isi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:30">nyumba ya seuta nayo yamemaga aayo du.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Zumbe Mnungu asigiilaga niyo yeza matuluma ya sofulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:31">maboi niyo yamema mwe isi yose,<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />fula yawe aitendaga inye ya maiwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:32">lumwemwe na nk'huwa mwe isi yawe yose.<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />aibanangaga mizabibu na mitini yawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:33">avunaga maziti yose ye isi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Asigiilaga niyo sige zeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:34">na ngeda heziikuwazika.<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />Zadyaga maziti yose yekwani mwe isi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:35">zalubutulaga kila kihandwa chawe mwe isi.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Awakomaga nt'hula sasu wose mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:36">matunda ya nk'hongo yo ubwanga wawe.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Zumbe awalavaga want'hu wakwe Izilaeli uko Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">wakanda waguha masawa na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:37">hakwandaga na yeyose akobadikaga.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Wamisili waonaga kinyemi weze wahalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:38">kwaviya wawogohaga Waizilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Mnungu awagubikaga want'hu wakwe ne divunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:39">no moto wawazangazilaga umwo kwandaga nekilo.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Walombezaga niyo awegaila nk'wale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:40">awegusaga kwa nk'hande ya kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Alutulaga uluwe niyo kwatumbuka mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:41">yaseelaga mwe dijangwa enga mto.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Kwaviya akumbukilaga kulagana kwakwe kukukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:42">aiikaga kwa Ibulahimu mndima wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Wat'hu wakwe awalavaga Misili kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:43">wadya awasagule wakemaga na kwanga.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Awenk'haga isi ya want'hu ya watuhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:44">niyo waguha viya vidamanywe ni watuhu,<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />vileke watimile imiko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 105:45">naho watende viligane ne zisigilizi zakwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45">Zumbe atogolwe!<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s">Uwedi wa Zumbe kwa want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe kwa viya ni ywedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:1">lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Ni ani akudaha kusimuila mbuli nk'hulu zina Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:2">hegu kubwelekeza kwa kindedi?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Wana kinyemi wose wakutimila imiko yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:3">na kudamanya yakuwagila mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Zumbe, unikumbukile miye umwo ukawambiza want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:4">name ninde uumwo ukawayokola,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />vileke niuwone upati wa want'hu wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">name ninde mwe kinyemi cha want'hu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:5">hutogole hamwenga na want'hu wako,<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />kidamanya wavu hamwenga na wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:6">kidamanya wiihi na mbuli ziihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Uko Misili wakale wetu hawakombaganyaga mitendele ya kwehela ya Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">wandaga wahufu kujala uwedi wakwe ubindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:7">wasagukaga kwakwe uko kwe bahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Hamwenga na ayo awayokolaga viligane na ivo alagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:8">vileke alagise udahi wakwe mkulu.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Aigambaga ibahali ya Shamu inyale niyo yanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:9">awombosaga umwo mwandaga na mazi matali, enga mwe dijangwa.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Awayokolaga kulawa mwa want'hu hewe waungaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:10">awakombolaga mwa wank'hondo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Mazi yawagubikiza wank'hondo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:11">hakwandaga na yeyose asigalaga.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Niho wayahuwila kwa ayo alaganaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:12">niyo wamkemela kwa nt'hogola.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Mna wasunguzaga kujala kiya awatendelaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:13">hawaungaga ulangilizi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Kudya kwe dijangwa wamemaga kumunk'wamunk'wa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:14">niyo wamgeza Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />ivo awenk'haga kiya walombezaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:15">naho awegailaga maine yaihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Uko kwe nk'hambi awaonelaga finju Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:16">na Haluni wandima wazumilwe ni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Sanga yagubukaga niyo yawamela Datani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:17">niyo yawamosa Ibulamu na weyawe,<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />moto wakimp'hukaga mwa wamwenga wa awo wandaga wakawatimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:18">moto niyo wawoka pele awo waihi.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Wasanaga hili dya zahabu dyandaga enga ndama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:19">niyo wadivika.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Wauhitulaga ukulu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:20">kwe dihili dya kala dikudya mani.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Wamjala Mnungu uyo awayokolaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:21">kwa udahi mkulu uko Misili,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />vihungi vikulu uko Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">mbuli za kwitusa uko kwe bahali ya Shamu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:22">Aho Mnungu eze agambe naawakome want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Musa mndima ywakwe amsagule akimalaga na kumhiga Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:23">na kuikindila maya ya Zumbe ase kuwakoma pele.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Niyo waibela idya isi iyedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:24">ni kwaviya hawahuwilaga kiya alagane Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Wandaga na nk'halalizi mwa mahema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:25">hawamtegelezaga Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Ivo enulaga mkono wakwe kulanga niyo akelisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:26">kugamba naawakome pele uwo mwe dijangwa,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />na kuwatenda welekwa wawe wasambale mwa want'hu wa isi nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:27">na kuwaleka wabanikile mwe isi za want'hu watuhu.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Want'hu wa Mnungu wakelungaga mwe kumvika Baali uko Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:28">niyo wadya nt'hambiko zalavilwagwa milungu heiina ugima.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Wayakwezaga maya ya Zumbe Mnungu kwa mbuli zawe ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:29">niyo wenukilwa ni maine yaihile.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Mna Finehasi akimalaga niyo alava usengelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:30">maine ayo niyo yahalawa.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Ino yamtendaga yehe kunda muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:31">kwa vyeleko vose mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Want'hu wamtendaga Zumbe Mnungu ande na maya uko kwe vizuto va Meliba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:32">niyo Musa apata makunt'ho kwajili yawe,<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />kwaviya wasagukaga kwa Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:33">vamtendaga Musa alonge aheina kufanyanya.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Izilaeli hawawakomaga want'hu we zi isi nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:34">enga ivo Zumbe Mnungu awagambaga watende,<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />mna woho wakehanganyaga nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:35">watimilaga vihendo vawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Wavikaga mahili yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:36">uwo lwinika wa kuwakoma pele.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Wawalavaga wana wawe wakilume na wana kike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:37">kunda nt'hambiko kwe mahili ya Kanaani.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Wawakomaga wana hawandaga na masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:38">isi niyo yalemelwa kwajili ye sakame ya wana wawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />waketendaga wenye walemelwe kwajili yo udamanyi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:39">na kunda hi wahuwilwa kwa Mnungu enga wahabwasi.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Ivo Zumbe awaihiyaga want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:40">na kuuihiya ukipe wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Awenk'hizaga kwo udahi wa want'hu wa isi nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:41">niyo wekailwa ni wank'hondo wawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Wank'hondo wawe wawatendelaga ukwank'hwalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:42">niyo wawaika hasi yo udahi wawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Kwa luholuho, Mnungu awoyokolaga want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">mna woho wasagulaga kusaguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:43">niyo wagiila mwo kutenda wavu.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Hata ivo awategelezaga aho wamwiilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:44">niyo awambiza mwa makunt'ho yawe.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Aikumbukilaga indagano kwajili yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:45">naho kwajili yo lukunde lwakwe, awonelaga mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Awatendaga wose wawakunt'hizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:46">wawaonele mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Kionele mbazi Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">kivuze kulawa kwe zi isi nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">vileke kikefenyele nt'hunyo ye dizina dyako dikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:47">na kwanga na kukutogola.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">mtogoleni ivi haluse na mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Kila yumwenga agambe,“Taile!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 106:48">Mtogoleni Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola kwajili yo uwedi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:1">lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Wadya wakombolwe ni Zumbe wasimuile aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">wadya wose wayokolwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:2">kiwahonyani kulawa mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wenyu,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />naho kawavuzani kulawa isi za hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:3">kulawa ulailo wa zuwa na usweelo wa zuwa, kwa mwenye mzi na kwa mkoma mahanya.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Wose wangadikaga mwe dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:4">hawonaga sila ya kuwavuza kwo mzi wa kwikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Wandaga na sala na nk'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:5">naho wazehukaga.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Niho wamwiilaga Zumbe kwajili ya makunt'ho yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:6">naye awayokolaga mwa masulumizo yawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Awombosaga mwe sila ichumile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:7">yawabuzaga kwo mzi wo kwikala.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Kwa lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:8">kwa mbuli za kweheela awadamanyile,<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />kwaviya awanywesa wata nk'hilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:9">na kuwegusa wata sala kwa vint'hu vedi.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Wadya wekalaga mwo lwiza na ziza ditithale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:10">wavugailwa nawo mwa masulumizo na minyololo,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />kwaviya wasagukaga kwe zisigilizi za Mnungu mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:11">naho walemelaga malagizo yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Awatumagizaga kwa ndima ndala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:12">wakobadikaga mna hawaonaga ywa kuwambiza.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Niho wamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:13">naye niyo awayokola mwa makunt'ho yawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Awalavaga mwo lwiza na ziza ditithale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:14">na kuikant'ha kant'ha minyololo yawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Nivedi wamtogole Zumbe Mnungu kwa lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:15">kwa mbuli za kweheela awadamanyile want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Kwaviya kazibogozola zinyivi ze shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:16">na kuyakant'ha madanga ya kilama.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Kusaguka kwakwe kuwatenda wamwenga wande wahezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:17">niyo wapata makunt'ho kwajili ya maihi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Haungile kudya nk'hande yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:18">wandaga haguhi na kubanika.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Mwa makunt'ho yawe wamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:19">niyo yehe awayokola mwo kwangadika kwawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Awegailaga ulosi wakwe na kuwahonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:20">niyo awayokola wasekubanika.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Nivedi wamtogole Zumbe Mnungu kwa lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:21">na kwa mbuli za kweheela awadamanyile.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Wamlavile malavo ya nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:22">na kusimuila zimbuli zakwe kwa kukema.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Wakugenda mwe bahali wakanda mwe meli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:23">wakudamanya ndima zawe mwa mazi mengi,<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />nawo wazionaga zindima za Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:24">na mbuli za kweheela mwa mazi matali.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Kwaviya alongaga niyo nk'hung'unt'ho yalaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:25">na kwinula mawimbi ya bahali.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Yenulwagwa kulanga kwo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:26">naho niyo yaselezwa hasi kwa mazi matali,<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />wakobadikaga niyo wayuga yuga enga akoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:27">umanyi wawe niyo waluheleza.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Niho wamwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu kwajili ya makunt'ho yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:28">naye niyo awayokola mwa makunt'ho yawe.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Aunyamaza mjubwaniso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:29">niyo mawimbi yanyamala.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Niho waonaga kinyemi kwaviya yanyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:30">niyo awalongoza kwe bandali iyo waiungisaga.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Nivedi wamtogole Zumbe Mnungu kwa lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:31">kwa mbuli zakwe za kweheela awadamanyile.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Ni vedi wamtunye ho mdugano wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:32">naho wamvike ho undiilo wa wadala.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Aitendaga mito inde jangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:33">nc'hoko za mazi kunda hant'hu hanyaile.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Isi ina ulozo niyo aitenda kunda ulongo wo munyu heina ndima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:34">kwajili ya uwihi wa wadya wekalaga uumwo.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Ahitulaga dijangwa niyo dyanda makawa ya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:35">sanga inyaile kunda nc'hoko za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />awegalaga wata sala niyo wekala umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:36">wazengaga mzi niyo wekala umo.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Walimaga nk'honde niyo wahanda mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:37">walozolaga ulozo ulozoke.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Want'hu wakwe awavikilaga niyo wanda na wana wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:38">mifugwa yawe hayahungukaga.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Umwo weze wande wageke na kuhungulwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:39">ni ukwank'walu, makunt'ho na sungusungu,<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Zumbe awatendelaga lubezo wakulu wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:40">niyo awatenda wangadike mwe dijangwa hediina ha kombokela.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Mna awayokolaga wakiwa kulawa mwa makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:41">agenyezaga zimp'huga zawe enga mafyo ya ngoto.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Wawagilwa nawayaone niyo welelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:42">mna waihi wose hawande na dya kulonga.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Wata mizungu wose wategeleze zimbuli izi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 107:43">walufanyanye lukunde lwa Zumbe Mnungu holwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s">Kukegombela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Mnungu, moyo wangu haukogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:1">nenikeme na kukutunya kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Zeze na kinubi setukeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:2">nenikusetule kutandazuka.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />We, Zumbe Mnungu nohutogole mgati mwa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:3">nohukemele nt'hunyo mwa want'hu wa si.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Kwaviya lukunde lwako ni lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">lukulisa mpaka kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:4">uhuwilwa wako hata kwo ulanga.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Mnungu utunywe uko kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:5">ukulu wako unde mwe si yose.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Kiyokole na kuchambiza kwa udahi wako mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:6">vileke wose ukuwaunga wayokolwe.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Mnungu kalonga kulawa hakukile hakwe, “Neniipange Shekemu kwa kwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:7">kolongo dya Sukoti nenidihime vigemogemo.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Gileadi na Manase zose zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">Ifulaimu niyo ink'hofia yangu itogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:8">Yuda naye niye ink'home ikulagisa useuta wangu.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Moabu ni lwiga lwangu lwa kuhakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">neniiduile kilatu changu uko Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">kulagisa kugamba nayo ni yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:9">nenigute lukunga lwa uhumi uko Filisiti.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Niani naanigale kwo mzi una gomela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:10">niani naanilongoze kuita Edomu?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Weye kukileka lekeleke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:11">Hukuunga kuitanya na watowani watu?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Kink'he wambizi kiwahige wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:12">wambizi wa want'hu hicho kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Kinandanya na Mnungu nekinde wahumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 108:13">yehe naawajatangize wank'hondo wetu.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s">Kulabila kwa mta makunt'ho</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Nakutunya weye Mnungu, use kunyamala,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />kwaviya want'hu waihile na walulimi wanikump'hukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:2">walonga mbuli za kudant'ha mwa miye,<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />waniziga mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:3">wanihamant'ha haheina masa.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Icho wakuniliha kwa lukunde lwangu, ni kunilongeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:4">hata ivo miye nawalombezela ayedi.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Hamwenga na ayo waniliha wiihi kwa uwedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:5">waniihiya kwajili yo lukunde lwangu.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Sigiila mwiihi yumwenga awahige wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:6">mlongelezi naakimale kwa udahi.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Akasengelwa aoneke kunda na masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:7">kulombeza kwakwe kumgele mwe dilema.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Mazuwa yo wikazi wakwe nayahunguke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:8">mnt'hu mtuhu aguhe hant'hu ho ulongozi wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Wanawe nawande wana nk'hiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:9">mkaziwe naye ande abanikilwe ni mgosi.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Wanawe wangadike wakanda vilombezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:10">waguluswe wamlawe mwa mahame wekalaga.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Mnt'hu akumtigiza naaguhe vose ananavo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:11">upati wakwe noutahigwe ni wata kwiza.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Asekuona uwedi kulawa kwa yeyose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:12">hegu kumuonela mbazi mwana nk'hiwa ywakwe.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Welekwa wakwe nousile pele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:13">mazina yawe yasekuoneka mwe cheleko kikwiza.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Zumbe Mnungu akumbukile wiihi wa wakale wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:14">naho use kuusa wavu wa nine.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Mazuwa yose Zumbe akumbukile wavu wawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:15">mazina yawe yajaligwe mwa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Kwaviya alemelaga kunda na mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">awasulumizaga na kuwakoma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:16">wakiwa na heweina kint'hu na mnt'hu aswesile wambizi.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Aungisa kuligita, aligitwe mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:17">Hakuunga kuvikila, naye asekuvikilwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Maligito yandaga enga valo dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">ligito nedimwingile mwo mwili enga mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:18">na mwa mavuha yakwe enga mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Ligito dinde enga kavaligwa suke nt'hali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:19">enga mkowa umzinganize mwe kigudi.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Zumbe, walihe ayo wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:20">awo wakunilonga vihile.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu nambize enga ivo unilagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:21">uniyokole kwajili yo uwedi wo lukunde lwako.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Kwaviya miye ni mkiwa hiina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:22">naho moyo wangu ulumizwa.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Nomboka enga kizuli cha kisingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:23">napuputiswa enga sige.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Mavindi yangu yasokela kwa kufunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:24">mwili wangu ubunt'hikisa.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Hinda mnt'hu wa kubeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:25">wakaniona wasingiza mitwi yawe.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu ywangu nambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:26">niyokole viligane no lukunde lwako holwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Want'hu nawamanye kugamba ni weye mdahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:27">Zumbe Mnungu uyadamanye aya.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Wakaligita weye vikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">wakahamant'ha, wagele soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:28">naho mndima ywako ange.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Wasezengi wangu wavaligwe uhuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:29">soni zinde nidyo divalo dyawe.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Nenimtogolese Zumbe Mnungu kwa mnomo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:30">nenimtunye mwo mdugano wa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Yehe akimala kulume kwa heweina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 109:31">ayokole ugima wawe kulawa kwa wadya wakuwaziga masa.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mnungu na seuta amsagule</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Zumbe amgamba zumbe ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">“Ikala kulume kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:1">mpaka niwaike wank'hondo wako hasi ye viga vako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Zumbe Mnungu kagamba naaugendeze useuta wako kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:2">naho agamba, “Unde seuta mgati mwa wank'hondo wako.”<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Umwo ukaita kwe nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">want'hu wako nawakwiziile kwa kuunga wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">nounde kuvaligwa valo dikukile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">naho ludole lwako nalutendwe luhya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:3">kila zuwa enga mnyuzu wa mtondo.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Zumbe Mnungu kakuikila kilapi naho haakihitule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:4">“Nounde mlavant'hambiko ywa mazuwa yose enga ivo andaga Melekizedeki.<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Zumbe e kulume kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:5">naawahonde maseuta aho akeza kunda na maya.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Naasengele want'hu mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">na kukoma want'hu wabindile wingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:6">naawatowe maseuta mwe si yose.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Seuta naanywe mazi ya kazuto mwe sila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 110:7">na kugelwa ludole, naande mhumi.”<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s">Zitunywe ndima za kweheela za Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Zumbe Mnungu Atunywe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">Nenimtunye Zumbe Mnungu kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:1">ho mdugano wakumogoha Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Ni za kweheela ndima za Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:2">wose wakwelelwa nazo nawaunge kuzikombaganya.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Kila kiya akudamanya kimema ukulu na nt'hunyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:3">uwagilwa wakwe ni wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Mbuli zakwe za kwehela kazitenda zikumbukilwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:4">Zumbe ana ukise na mbazi,<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />awenk'ha nk'hande wose wakumvika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:5">akumbukila indagano yakwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Kawalagisa want'hu udahi we zindima zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:6">kawenk'ha isi ya want'hu wa isi nt'huhu.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Ndima zose akudamanya ni uhuwilwa na uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:7">sigilizi zakwe zose ni za kukawiilwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Ni za uhuwilwa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:8">zitimilwe kwa uhuwila naho kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Kawegaila want'hu wakwe ulekelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">asigiilaga indagano yakwe ulo naulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:9">Yehe kakuka naho atisa.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Kumvika Zumbe ni chotoko cha mzungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">wose kutimila zisigilizi zakwe wabala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 111:10">Nt'hunyo zakwe ni za mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s">Uvikilwa wa mnt'hu ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Zumbe atogolwe!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">Kavikilwa mnt'hu akumwogoha Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:1">mnt'hu akweleleswa kutimila sigilizi za Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Wanawe nawande wadahi mwe isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:2">welekwa wakwe nawande wavikilwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Mp'huga iyo neinde na ulozo na ugoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:3">uhuilwa wawe nounde wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Hata kukanda na lwiza, ung'azi wawezila wahuilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:4">wata mbazi wakise na wawagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Ana kinyemi yudya akwink'hiza matundu yakwe kwa ukise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:5">mnt'hu akudamanya ndima zakwe kwa uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Ikindedi heeze asingisike!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:6">Muwagilwa naakumbukilwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Haogohe kutegeleza mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:7">moyo wakwe utoga, mwo kumhuwila Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Moyo wakwe wadimwa haawogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:8">mpaka awaone wank'hondo wakwe wahumwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Awenk'haga kwa ukise heweina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">uwedi wakwe hauna uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:9">naande na udahi na kuhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Waihi nawayaone ayo na kufa maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">nawagwegwejule meno niyo wagiila hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 112:10">makawiilo ya waihi yaganika.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo zo uwedi wa Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">nyuwe wandima wa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:1">togoleni dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Zina dya Zumbe divikilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:2">ivi haluse na mazuwa yose<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Kulawa ulailo wa zuwa mpaka usweelo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:3">ditogoleni dizina dya Zumbe, <verse eid="PSA 113:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Zumbe kenulwa kulanga ye si yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:4">ukulu wakwe ukulanga kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Ni ani naande enga ni Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:5">uyo akwikala mwo useuta wa kulanga,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />akufunama hasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:6">aikaule zimbingu na si.<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Awenula wakiwa kulawa mwo luvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:7">na heweina kint'hu kulawa mwe dizala.<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />na kuwaika hamwenga na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:8">wakulu wa want'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Amwiika mvele mgumba mwe nyumba yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">amtenda ande na kinyemi kwa kumwink'ha wana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 113:9">Zumbe atogolwe!<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s">Vihungi va Mnungu mwo utafi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Umwo want'hu wa Izilaeli walawaga Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:1">aho welekwa wa Yakobo wayasaga isi yo utakwiza,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />isi ya Yuda yandaga hant'hu hakukile ha Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:2">Izilaeli yandaga useuta wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Bahali yakaulaga niyo yanyilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:3">mto wa Yolodani wauyaga kunyuma!<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Mnima wapilika enga dolome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:4">vigulu navo enga wana ngoto.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Kibwai kikunyilise weye bahali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:5">Nawe Yolodani mazi yako yavuzwagwa kunyuma niani?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Nyuwe milima nikihi kikuwapilisani enga dolome?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:6">Vigulu nanywe mwapiliswa nii enga wana ngoto?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />We si, zingiza aho eli Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:7">ho undiilo wa Mnungu ywa Yakobo,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />akuhitula luwe kunda kawa dya mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 114:8">iwe ditogile kunda nc'hoko za mazi.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu yumwenga ywe kindedi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Ni weye wikedu Zumbe Mnungu ywa kutunywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">suwe hakiwagilwe kwink'wa ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:1">kwajili yo lukunde lwako no uhuwilwa wako houkusila.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Nii want'hu wa si wakiuze kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:2">“Ekuhi Mnungu ywenyu?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Mnungu ywetu ekwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:3">adamanya yakumwelela.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Mna mahili yawe ni ya masawa na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:4">yatile kudamanywa ni want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Yana milomo mna hayakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:5">yana meso mna hayakuona,<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />yana magutwi mna haya kwiva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:6">yana mp'hula mna haya kuhefya,<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />yana mikono mna hayakudaha kukwafa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">yana viga mna hayakudaha kugenda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:7">Malaka yawe hayakudaha kulava maizwi.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Wose wakuyadamanya wenye nawo ni enga ivo yeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:8">naho nivo weli awo wakuyakawiila.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Nyuwe Izilaeli mkawiileni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:9">uyo niye mwambizi naho nk'hindo yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Nyuwe mp'huga ya Haluni mkawiileni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:10">uyo niye mwambizi naho nk'hindo yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Nyuwe mkumvika Zumbe Mnungu mkawiileni yehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:11">uyo niye mwambizi na nk'hindo yenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Zumbe Mnungu akikumbukila na kukivikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">naawavikile want'hu wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:12">naaivikile imp'huga ya Haluni.<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />Naawavikile wose wakumwogoha Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:13">wakanda wose wakulu na wadodo.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Zumbe Mnungu awagenyezeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:14">nyose hamwenga na welekwa wenyu.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Mvikiliwe ni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:15">uyo aumbile Mbingu na si.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Mbingu ni za Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:16">mna si kawenk'ha want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Wabanike hawakudaha kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:17">na yeyose akuseela hasi kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Mna suwe wagima nekimvike Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">kukongela ivi haluse na mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 115:18">Zumbe atunywe!<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola kwa kuhonywa maine</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Namuunga Zumbe kwaviya kaniva</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:1">izwi dyangu na kulombeza kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Yehe kanikingila digutwi dyakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:2">ivo nenimwitange wikazi wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Sigi zikukoma zanizinganizaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">naonaga usungu mkulu wa kwe isi ya wabanike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:3">nehizamilwa ni makunt'ho na kinyulu.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Aho niho namwitangaga Zumbe hamgamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:4">“Weye Zumbe nakulombeza, yokola ugima wangu!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Zumbe ni ywedi naho muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:5">Mnungu ywetu kamema mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Zumbe Mnungu awamila heweina ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:6">anihonyaga umwo nandaga mwo kwangamila.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Weye moyo wangu, uya hant'hu hako ho kuhumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:7">kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kanda ywedi kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Zumbe Mnungu aniyokolaga mwo kubanika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">ainyamazaga indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:8">no kunamila nesekukobadika iviga vangu.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Haluse nagendela mwo undiilo wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:9">mwe isi ya wagima.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Nakuhuwilaga niyo nagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:10">miye hisulumiziswa,<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />hata umwo nandaga mwo kwangadika nagambaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:11">“Want'hu wose hawana ukindedi.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Nimwink'hei Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:12">kwo uwedi wose anidamanyile?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Nenimlavile Zumbe Mnungu kiyamp'ha cha mazi ya zabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:13">na kumtogola kwa kuniyokola.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Nenikint'hize yadya nilongile kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:14">ha want'hu wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Kubanika kwa muwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:15">kuna nt'hunyo kwa Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Zumbe Mnungu, ikindedi miye ni mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">nadamanya zindima zako enga ivo atendaga mnala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:16">kuniyokola kulawa mwe file.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Nohulavile nt'hambiko yangu ya nt'hogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:17">no kulombeza kwa zina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Nenikint'hize kiya nimlagane Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">mwo mdugano wa want'hu wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:18">ho undiilo wa want'hu wakwe wose,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />mwo lwazo lwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">mgati mwako weye Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 116:19">Zumbe atunywe.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s">Kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Zumbe Mnungu atogolwe nyuwe isi zose!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:1">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu nyuwe want'hu wose!<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Kwaviya lukunde lwakwe kwetu ni lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">naho uhuwilwa wakwe Zumbe Mnungu ni wa mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 117:2">Zumbe atogolwe!<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s">Kulava nt'hogola kwajili ya uhumi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu kwo uwedi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:1">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Izilaeli naalonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:2">kugamba, “Lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Welekwa wa Haluni walonge elo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:3">kugamba, “Lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Wose wakumvika walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:4">“Lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Mwa makunt'ho yangu namlombezaga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:5">anink'haga uhituzi na kunitenda mlekelwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Zumbe ehamwenga na miye henogohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:6">mnt'hu naanitende vivihi?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Zumbe ehamwenga na miye, naho niye akunambiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:7">neniwaone wank'hondo wangu wakahumwa.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Ni vedi kunyilikila kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:8">kujink'ha kumkawiila mnt'hu.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Ni vedi kunyilikila kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:9">kujink'ha kukawiila vilongozi wa want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Want'hu wa si zose wanizungulukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:10">mna kwa zina dya Zumbe nawakomaga wose.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Wanizungulukaga nt'hendelo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:11">mna kwa zina dya Zumbe, nawakomaga wose.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Wanizungulukaga enga tuluma dya nyuki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">mna wasunguzaga kuhya enga kasaka ka miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:12">nawakomaga kwa zina dya Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Wazungulaga kila mzungu wanikome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:13">mna Zumbe anambizaga.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Zumbe anitendaga mdahi na mta ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:14">yehe kanda niye uyokozi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Mila na kinyemi cha uhumi vakemwa mwe nk'hambi ya want'hu wa Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:15">Udahi mkulu wa Zumbe udamanya aya.<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Udahi mkulu wa Zumbe utunywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:16">Udahi mkululu wa Zumbe wadamanya makulu.<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Miye henibanike, neninde mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:17">name nenisimuile makulu adamanye Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Zumbe kanisulumizisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:18">mna hanilekile nibanike,<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Nikomoele ink'hili ya wawagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:19">neningile na kumtogola Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Ino ni nk'hili ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:20">wawagilwa numwo wakwingiila.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Nakutogola Zumbe kwaviya kuniva,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:21">naho kunink'ha uhumi.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Iwe wadilemelaga wazesi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:22">dinda iwe hediikuungwa kusweswa.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Mbuli ino ilawa kwa Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:23">nayo ni ya kweheela kwetu.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Idi nidyo dizuwa didamanywe ni Zumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:24">Kinde na kinyemi na kwanga.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Kiyokole weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:25">ukivikile weye Zumbe Mnungu kikanda mwe nyumba yako.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Kavikilwa akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:26">chawavikila kulawa kwe nyumba ya Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Zumbe niye Mnungu,kanda ywedi kwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">kongeni wila mkanda na mahuto mwe mikono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:27">niyo mwagenda kuzunguluka hant'hu ha kulavila nt'hambiko.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Ni weye Mnungu ywangu, nohutogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:28">weye Mnungu nohutunye.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 118:29">lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s">Miko ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Wavikilwa heweina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:1">wakutimila malagizo ya Zumbe. <verse eid="PSA 119:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Wavikilwa wakutimila sigilizi zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:2">wakumzungula kwa mioyo yawe yose,<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />hewekutenda dyodyose diihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:3">lugendo lwawe ni mwe sila za Zumbe.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Kukink'ha sigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:4">kukigamba kizitimile kwa uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />Nevinda vedi wikazi wangu wandile utoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:5">mwe kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Ivo henigeligwa soni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:6">hazitimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Nohutunye weye kwa moyo wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:7">hakehiniza zisigilizi zako zina uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Nenitimile imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:8">use kunasa,<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila imiko ya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Ni kwa vivihi mbwanga autende wikazi wakwe kunda wedi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:9">Ni kwa kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Nenikuzungule kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:10">usekunileka haita hale ne miko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Mbuli yako imwo mwo moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:11">vileke nise kukutendela wavu.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Utunywe weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:12">unihinize zisila zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Kwa mnimo wangu nenisimuile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:13">sigilizi zose ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Naonela kinyemi kutimila sigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:14">enga kundilisa na ugoli.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Miye nafanyanya zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:15">na kuzitimila zisila zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Naonela kinyemi zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:16">imbuli yako nayo heniibele.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuonela kinyemi mwe sigilizi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Nitendele ayedi mwo wikazi wangu mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:17">nidahe kutimila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Finyula meso yangu vileke nikaule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:18">mbuli zo kweheela mwe miko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Miye nimwe si kwa lupisi du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:19">usekunifisa zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Moyo wangu wamunk'hilwa munk'hilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:20">waungisa zisigilizi zako kila lupisi.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Kuwakwank'hila wakukefenya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:21">waligitwe ni wadya wahale ne miko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Usekuwaleka wanibele na kunikalaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:22">kwaviya nazitoza zisigilizi zako,<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />hata uneva wakulu wekala na kunilonga yaihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:23">miye mndima ywako nenifanyanye zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Miko yako yanelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:24">yanink'ha ulangilizi wedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamuzi wa kutimila miko ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Hilambalikwa hasi mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:25">setula ugima wangu enga ivo ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Nakugambilaga ayo nitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">niyo weye wanink'ha uhituzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:26">haluse nihinize imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Nihinize nikombaganye miko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:27">miye nenifanyanye udamanyi wako wa kweheela.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Miye hihwa kwa kinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:28">nigele ludole viligane ne Mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Niike hale na mbuli za udant'hi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:29">kwa uwedi wako unink'he kukombaganya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Hisagula sila ye kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:30">moyo wangu utozeleza zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />Zumbe Mnungu, hitozeleza zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:31">usekuleka hagelwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Nenitimile imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:32">kwaviya nounink'he kukombaganyisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza ukombaganyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Zumbe Mnungu, nihinize sigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:33">name nenizitoze mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Nink'he ukombaganyi, nizitoze zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:34">na kuzitimila kwa kindedindedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Nigendeze mwe sila ye miko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:35">kwaviya umwo numo mne kinyemi changu.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Utende moyo wangu uungise zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:36">kujink'ha kunda ugoli.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Meso yangu yahituile hale na mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:37">unink'he ugima kwombokela mwe mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Mkint'hizile mndima ywako kiya umlagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:38">lagano uwenk'hile wadya wakukogoha.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Niusile zisoni zikunitisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:39">kwaviya sigilizi zako ni zedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Naungisa kutimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:40">nink'he ugima mhya kwaviya weye umuwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuwila miko ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Zumbe Mnungu, nilagise lukunde lwako holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:41">uyokozi wako viligane na ivo walongaga.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Aho niho neni wahitule wadya wakunitendela lubezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:42">kwaviya naihuwila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Unink'he kulonga ikindedi mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:43">kwaviya nahuwila usengelo wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Nenizitimile zisigilizi zako mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:44">heiye, naho mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Name nenigende kwa ulekelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:45">kwaviya natimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Neniilonge imiko yako kwa maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:46">naho heninde na soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />Naonela kinyemi imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:47">kwaviya naiungisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Naitimila naho naiunga imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:48">naho nenizifanyanye zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makawiilo mwe miko ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Kumbukila yadya wanigambilaga miye mndima ywako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:49">kwaviya kunink'ha kawiiilo.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Icho nicho kikunisangalaza mwa makunt'ho yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:50">kugamba kulagana kwako kwanink'ha ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Wata wefenyi wanilongesa vihile haheina mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:51">hamwenga na ayo hikuileka sigilizi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Zumbe Mnungu, miye nazikumbukila zisigilizi zako za aho kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:52">zanisangalaza.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Nna maya yatendese hawakaula waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:53">awo walekile zigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Sigilizi zako zinda wila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:54">kila aho huita ho utakwiza.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Zumbe, umwo nekilo, nakumbukila dizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:55">aho naitimila isigilizi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Uno nuwo wikazi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:56">kuzitoza zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kogoha sigilizi ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Zumbe Mnungu, weye niwe upasi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:57">nakulagana kutimila ayo ukulonga.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Nakulombeza kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:58">unionele mbazi enga ivo ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Hifanyanya mwa sila zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:59">hihituila lugendo lwangu kwe zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Nenisunguze haheina kwikalisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:60">kutimila imiko yako,<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />hata uneva waihi wananizinganiza kwa sigi za uihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:61">miye henijale zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Nenuka kilo gati hutunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:62">kwaviya sigilizi zako ni uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Wambuya zangu ni wadya wakukuvika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:63">yeyose akutimila sigilizi zako. <verse eid="PSA 119:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />Zumbe, lukunde lwako luimemeza si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:64">unihinize zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uhuwilwa we miko ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Mtendele uwedi mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:65">Zumbe, viligane na ivo ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Nihinize kutalaula vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:66">miye nahuwila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Umwo nandaga nikei kusulumizwa naganikaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:67">mna haluse natimila mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Weye uywedi naho ayo ukudamanya nayo yedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:68">nihinize zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Wakukeduvya waniziga mbuli ziihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:69">mna miye natoza kwa kindedi ayo yose ukulonga,<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />wana mioyo ya nk'hani na uhezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:70">mna miye miko yako yanelela.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Masulumizo yako ni yedi kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:71">yanihiniza kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Sigilizi ukulonga ni kint'hu kikulu kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:72">zijink'ha matundu yose mwe si.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwagilwa we zisigilizi za Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Ni weye wanitendaga miye handa uuko, weye waniumbaga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:73">Nink'he ukombaganyi, nikombaganye zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Wakukuvika welelwe umwo wakaniona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:74">miye nahuwila mwe yadya ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />We Zumbe, miye himanya zisigilizi zako ni za uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:75">kunigaila masulumizo kwo uhuwilwa unanawo.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Lukunde lwako holukusila lunisngalaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:76">viligane na ivo unilagane mndima ywako.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Unionele mbazi ninde mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:77">kwaviya zisigilizi zako zanelela.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Wakukefenya wagelwe soni kwa kunilongeleza haheina kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:78">mna miye neni ifanyanye imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Wakukogoha wahitukile kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:79">awo wose wakukombaganya imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Niitimile imiko yako kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:80">vileke nisekugeligwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuyokolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Miye hifachevu hagoja uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:81">mna hiika kawiilo dyangu mwe mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Meso yangu yakupila hagoja yadya ulagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:82">hauza, “Nounambize ini?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Hinda enga kizembe ho mosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:83">mna hijaile imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Mndima ywako nenigojele mpaka ini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:84">Ni ini nouwasulumize wakunisulumiza?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Wakukekweza, hewekuunga kutimila imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:85">wanisimbila bome tali nihubugile uumwo.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Imiko yako yose ni kindedi naho zahuwilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:86">want'hu wanisulumiza haheina lema, nambize.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Want'hu awo wandaga hagihi na kunibanaga pele mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:87">mna miye hilekile kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Uniyokole kwa uwedi wako houkusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:88">name nenitimile zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi ya Mnungu ni ya kuhuwilwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Mbuli yako weye Zumbe ni ya ulo naulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:89">dyakimala ngungulu kwe mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Uhuwilwa wako wagendeela kwe vyeleko vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:90">kuumba si, nayo ikei iyaho mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Imiko yako igendeela mpaka dielo idi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:91">kwaviya vint'hu vose ni wandima wako.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Vandile miko yako hayanelele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:92">hegu nehibanika mwa makunt'ho yangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Heniijale imiko yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:93">kwaviya kwe miko iyo kunivuzila ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Miye ni ywako, uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:94">kwaviya nakombeka kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Hata waihi wakanongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:95">mna miye nenizifanyanye zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Hibunk'hula kugamba hahana hekiina uheelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:96">mna imiko yako haina mihaka.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiunga imiko ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />Naziungisa zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:97">nazifanyanya msi wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Miko yako ihamwenga na miye lupisi lwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:98">initenda mta mizungu kujink'ha wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Miye nakombaganyisa kujink'ha wahinizi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:99">kwaviya sigilizi zako nizo huzifanyanyisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Nna umanyi kujink'ha wadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:100">kwaviya natimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Hikeika hale na wikazi wa wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:101">vileke nitimile imbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Hizilekile zisigilizi zako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:102">kwaviya weye niwe unihinize.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Yadya unigambile yana mwile kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:103">mwile wakwe mwo mnomo wangu ujink'ha mwile wo uki.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Sigilizi zako nazikombaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:104">naivo naihiya kila lugendo lwiihile.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ung'azi ukulawa mwe Sigilizi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Mbuli yako yanizangazila mwo lugendo lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:105">ung'azi we zisila zangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Hikelisa kwa kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:106">miye nenitimile sila zako zo uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Zumbe, miye hionesa makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:107">nivuzile ugima wangu enga ivo ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Zumbe uhokele zint'hogola hukulavila kwa kuunga mwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:108">unihinize imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Hata uneva wikazi wangu umwe kuhoswa mazua yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:109">henijale zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Want'hu waihile wanitegela mitego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:110">mna hilekile kutimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Zigilizi zako zinda ukipe wangu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:111">izo nizo kinyemi cho moyo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Hilamula kutimila zisiglizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:112">mpaka kwo uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwe sigilizi ya Mnungu wiyuko wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Nawaihiya want'hu watondwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:113">mna naiunga isigilizi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Ni weye unyilikilo wangu na nk'hindo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:114">kawiilo dyangu dimwe mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Halaweni aha hangu nyuwe mkudamanya maihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:115">vileke nitimile imiko ya Mnungu ywangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Unilele vedi viligane ne ivo ulongile, name neninde mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:116">usekuleka kawiilo dyangu dikauswa.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Nambize miye niyokolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:117">name nenizitoze zisigilizi zako lupisi lwose.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Wawalemela wose hewekutimila zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:118">nyambi zawe hazina dyodyose.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Waihi wa mwe si wawaduula enga nt'hagata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:119">Ivo elo naziungisa zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Nehingila kizingizo kwa kukwogoha weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:120">nogohesa sigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutimila miko ya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Hidamanya chedi na cha uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:121">usekunileka mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Nilagane kunambiza miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:122">usekuwaleka wata weduvi wanihujile.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Meso yangu yahwa kwa kukawiila wambizi wo uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:123">kuuhuwila uwagilwa wako ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Unitendele miye mndima ywako viligane ne zimbazi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:124">unihinize ne miko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Unink'he kukombaganya miye mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:125">vileke nimanye zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Zumbe, lupisi lwo kudamanya lubula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:126">kwaviya want'hu hawakutimila sigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Naungisa imiko yako kujink'ha zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:127">kuijink'ha zahabu isunt'hiswe.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Naho kwaviya natimila zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:128">naziihiya zisigiizi zose zikwazaganya.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuungisa kutimila sigilizi ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Mbuli yako yakwehela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:129">ivo elo miye nazitimila.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Utambalisi wa mahinizo yako wegala ung'azi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:130">wamwink'ha ubala mnt'hu heemanyize.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Hyasama mnomo hatwetuila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:131">kwaviya naungisa zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Nihitukile naho nionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:132">enga ivo ukuwatendelaga wose wakukuunga.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Longoza zink'hacho zangu enga ivo ulongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:133">usekuleka wavu wowose unikaile.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Nikombole kulawa mwo ukwank'walu wa want'hu waihile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:134">vileke nidahe kutimila imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Unikaule kwa lukunde lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:135">naho unihinize zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Mito ya masozi yaseela mwa meso yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:136">kwaviya zisigilizi zako hazikutimilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunkint'ha kwa sigilizi ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Weye Zumbe umuwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:137">zisigilizi zako hazikwazagula.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Zisigilizi zako wiikile ni za uwagilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:138">ni za kuhuililwa kwa kindedi.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Maya yanoka enga moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:139">kwaviya wank'hondo wangu wabela zimbuli zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Lagano dyako dikukisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:140">kwa ivo mndima ywako nadiungisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Hamwenga na kugamba miye ni mdodo naho nabeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:141">mna hikuleka sigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Uwagilwa wako ni wa mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:142">sigilizi zako ni za kindedi mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Makunt'ho na masulumizo viniziila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:143">mna zisigilizi zako ni kinyemi changu.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Sigilizi zako ni mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:144">unitende nikombaganye vileke ninde mgima.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kukombolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Hikwitanga kwa moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:145">nihitule name nenitimile imiko yako weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Nakwitanga uniyokole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:146">miye nenitimile zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Nakelauka mwo kwinuka hulombeze wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:147">miye nakawiila yadya ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Kilo chose nanda meso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:148">hafanyanya yadya ulagane.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Zumbe unive diizwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:149">kwa uwagilwa wako nivuzile ugima.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Wadya wakuika mizungu ya wiihi wehagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:150">awo ni want'hu hewekutoza zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Mna weye Zumbe Mnungu wihagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:151">naho imiko yako yose ni za kuhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Kukongela aho kale nakehinizaga malagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:152">ayo uyaikile yande ya mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Kaula dikunt'ho dyangu uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:153">kwaviya hijaile sigilizi yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Nigombele mwe dikunt'ho dyangu unikombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:154">niyokole enga ivo ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Uyokozi wihale na waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:155">kwaviya hawakutimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Mna Zumbe Mnungu kundilisa na mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:156">nink'he ugima naho kwa kutimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Want'hu wengi wanisezenga na kunisulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:157">mna hidunduge kutimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Hikwelelwa hawakaula wakutenda wiihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:158">kwaviya hawakutimila imiko zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Miye naungisa sigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:159">nivuzile ugima wangu kwa lukunde lwako holukusila.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Mbuli zako zose ni za kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:160">no usengelo wako wa uwagilwa ni wa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuikwa kwe miko ya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Wakulu wanihujila haheina lema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:161">mna moyo wangu wogoha zimbuli zako du.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Naonela kinyemi mbuli yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:162">enga mnt'hu atahile utahigwa mwingi.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Naihiya udant'hi wose, naho nawiihiya vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:163">mna naungisa zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Nakutogola nk'hanana mfungate kwa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:164">kwaviya zisigilizi zako ni za uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Wana utondowazi wa kindedi wose wakuziunga sigilizi yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:165">naho hakihali kint'hu kikudaha kuwakobadisa.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, naugojela uyokozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:166">naho nadamanya viligane ne zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Natimila malagizo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:167">nayaungisa kwa moyo wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Natimila malagizo yako ne zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:168">kwaviya sila zangu zose kuzimanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Ndilo yangu ya kulombeza wambizi ikubwiile weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:169">nink'he kukombaganya viligane ne mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Kulombeza kwangu ukutegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:170">uniyokole viligane ne mbuli yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Nohutunye mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:171">kwaviya wanihiniza zisigilizi zako,<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />nenikeme zisigilizi zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:172">kwaviya miko yako ni za uwagilwa.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Keike lumwe unambize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:173">kwaviya hisagula imiko yako.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Miye nna nk'hwina na uyokozi wako weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:174">zisigilizi zako zanink'ha kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Nink'he ugima hutunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:175">zisigilizi zako zinambize.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Nangadika enga ngoto yagile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">so unizungule mndima ywako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 119:176">kwaviya hijaile zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Mwa makunt'ho yangu namwiilaga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:1">naye niyo anihitula.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />We Zumbe Mnungu, uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:2">na milomo ya wadant'hi na nyimi zina nyambi.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Weye wink'higwei?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">Naho udamanyilwei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:3">weye lulimi lwa udant'hi?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Noulasigwe ni misale ya wadahi isongoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:4">nowokigwe na makala ya moto wink'hundu.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Hangi miye mwenye kwaviya ni mtakwiza uku Mesheki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:5">naho nekala mwa mahema ya Kedali.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Kwa lupisi lutali nehekala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:6">mwa want'hu wakuuihiya utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Miye ni mnt'hu ywa utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">mna kila halonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 120:7">woho waunga nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Mnungu niye nk'hindo yetu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Nakaula kwe milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:1">wambizi wangu noulawehi?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Wambizi wangu noulawe kwa Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:2">azidamanye mbingu ne isi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Haakuleke ukobadike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:3">mwamizi ywako emeso mazua yose.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Kwaviya yehe akuyamila Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:4">hakukupila naho hakugona nt'hongo.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Zumbe mwenye niye akukudima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:5">kakimala hamwenga na weye enga kugubikwa ni kizuli.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Hadihali zua nedikoke nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:6">hegu mwezi aho nekilo.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Zumbe Mnungu naakudime na maihi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:7">naawamile ugima wako.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Yehe naakudime ukaita na ukauya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 121:8">kukongela ivi haluse na mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo za Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Naonaga kinyemi weze wanigambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:1">“Kite kwe kaya kwa Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Haluse viga vetu vikimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:2">he zink'hili zako weye Yelusalemu.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Yelualemu uzengigwa utogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:3">mzi ulunganywe hamwenga kwa hagihi.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Uko nuko makabila nayaite</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">makabila ya Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">yakamtunye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:4">viligane ne sigilizi ivo ikulonga.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Uko niko yaikigwe mafumbi yo usengelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:5">mafumbi yo useuta we mp'huga ya Daudi.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Ilombezeleni utondowazi Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:6">“Wose wakukuunga wekale kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Kundani kwe zink'handula zako kunde na utondowazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:7">na kwamilwa vedi kwe zinyumba zako.”<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Kwajili ye mp'huga yangu na wambuya zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:8">Nagamba, “Mnde na utondowazi.”<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Kwajili ye nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 122:9">nawalombezeleni yedi.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuonelwa mbazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Zumbe Mnungu nakukaula weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:1">uko kwe mbingu ukwikaila.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Ni enga mndima akumkawiila mkulu ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">enga ivo eli mndima ywa kike akumkawiila mkulu ywakwe ywa kivele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">Nivo meso yetu yakumkawiila Zumbe Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:2">mpaka akionele mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Ukionele mbazi Zumbe Mnungu, kionele mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:3">kitendeleswa lubezo.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Wagoli wakibela kwa lupisi lutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 123:4">na kuonwa hi kint'hu ni want'hu wakukeduvya.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s">Mnungu niye nk'hindilo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Hegu nokulailai wandile Zumbe Mnungu hachambize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:1">nihituleni nyuwe Waizilaeli,<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />“Wandile Zumbe Mnungu hachandanye kwetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:2">umwo kikakump'hukilwa ni wank'hondo,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />hegu nekimeligwa kikanda wagima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:3">aho weze wande na maya na suwe,<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />nekigubikwa na mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:4">malao nayakikubila,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />hegu malao ya mazi nayakibulumula.”<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Zumbe Mnungu atogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:6">yehe hawakekile wank'hondo wetu wakilumize.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Kichupuluka enga kadege mwo lwinika wa mwongozi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 124:7">lwinika upochoko niyo suwe chachupuluka.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Wambizi wetu ulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu aumbile mbingu na si.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s">Kwamilwa kwa want'hu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Wakumhuwila Zumbe ni enga mnima wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:1">uwo houkusingisika, wekala mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Enga ivo Yelusalemu izungulukwe ni milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">nivo Zumbe Mnungu awazunguluke want'hu wakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:2">kukongela ivi haluse na mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Want'hu waihi hawekaile si ya wahuilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:3">sema wawagilwa nawo watende wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Zumbe Mnungu unde ywedi kwa want'hu wedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:4">kwa wose wakutimila zisigilizi zako.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Umwo ukawafyalika waihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">fyalika hamwenga na hewekutimila zisila zako.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 125:5">Utondowazi unde na Izilaeli!<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwajili ya kukombolwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Umwo Zumbe Mnungu akawavuza Yelusalemu watahigwa wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:1">yandaga enga sozi,<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />chasekeelaga na kukema kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">want'hu wa si nt'huhu niyo wagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:2">“Mnungu kawatendela mbuli nk'hulu.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Ikindedi Zumbe Mnungu kakitendela suwe mbuli nk'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:3">chandilisaga na kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Zumbe Mnungu, kivuzile want'hu wetu watahigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:4">enga vizuto vikuseleza mazi uko kwe isi inyaile ya Negebu.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Wadya wakuila umwo wakahanda zimbeyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:5">nawavune wakakema kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Akugenda kuhanda uku akaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">naauye akanga kwa kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 126:6">wakavuza kaya ulozo.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s">Kuutunya uwedi wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Zumbe hanaizengile inyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">akuizenga aizenga haheina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">uneva Zumbe hana wamile umzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:1">akuwamila acheleza haheina kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Mwakeangadisa haheina kint'hu kwenyu, mkacheelwa kwo kugona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">mkangadikila uludyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:2">Yehe awenk'ha nt'hongo wose wadya akuwaunga.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Wana ni ukipe kulawa kwa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:3">ni geleko dyakwe kwetu.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Ni enga mtowani mdahi atozile misale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:4">Ivo nivo weli wana welekwe ni mnt'hu mwo ubwanga hegu undele wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Ana kinyemi uyo amemeze dichaka dyakwe misale enga iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">haawogohe wank'hondo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 127:5">umwo wakeza kukint'hana he nk'hili.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s">Geleko dya wakumvika Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Wana kinyemi wadya wakumvika Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:1">awo wakutimila zisigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Zindima zako nezikwink'he cho kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:2">uvikilwa na upati nevinde vako.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Mkaziyo naande enga mzabibu ukweleka mwe kaya yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">wanao nawande enga masukiza ya mizeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:3">wakazunguluka imeza yako.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Ivo nivo naavikilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:4">mnt'hu akumvika Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">naho uuone uvikilwa wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:5">mazua yose yo wikazi wako.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />Nawe wink'higwe ugima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">uone wezukuluwo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 128:6">Utondowazi unde mwe Izilaeli!<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kuwahiga wank'hondo wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Wanisulumizisa kukongela ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:1">Izilaeli alonge ivi haluse.<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />Wanisulumizisa kukongela ubwanga wangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:2">mna hawanihumile,<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />wanilumiza mwo mgongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:3">waika mikologombe yawe mitali.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Mna Zumbe niye muwagilwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:4">kanilohola nifose mwe zisigi zo wiihi.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Wadya wose wakuiihiya Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:5">wahumwe na kuvuzwa kunyuma kwa soni.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Nawande enga mani ya mnanga mwe nyumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:6">ayo yakunyala yakanda yakei kukula,<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />hayakudaha kumema mwe mikono yo mvuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:7">naho hayakumemeza kifumba cha mnt'hu.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Hehali naamboke hagihi naawagambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">“Zumbe Mnungu akuvikile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 129:8">chakuvikila mwe dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Uko nili hasi vitendese, naiila wambizi wako weye Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Zumbe Mnungu unive indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:2">unive hakwitanga unambize!<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Zumbe Mnungu uneva unawaza maihi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:3">ni ani naadahe kukimala?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Mna kwako kuna kuuusilwa wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:4">vileke suwe kikogohe.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Namgojela Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:5">naho naihuwila mbuli yakwe.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Namgojela Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:6">namgojelesa kujink'ha mwamizi akuugoja mtondo.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Izilaeli mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">kwaviya kwa Zumbe Mnungu wiyuko lukunde holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:7">mazuwa yose aungisa kuyokola.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Naawayokole want'hu wakwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 130:8">kulawa mwo wavu wawe wose.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s">Kumkawiila Mnungu kwa utondowazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Zumbe Mnungu, moyo wangu haukuketunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">meso yangu hayana weduvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">hikutimila mbuli hiikuzidaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:1">hegu mbuli hezikudahika.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Mna hikehumuza haheina kukehosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">enga mwana egute konk'ha ahumule mwe kifua cha nine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:2">nivo uhumule umoyo wangu mwangu.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Izilaeli mhuwile Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 131:3">ivi haluse na mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo ye nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Zumbe Mnungu mkumbukile Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:1">na makunt'ho yose afinyilize.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Zumbe kumbukila kiya alaganaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:2">ne kilapi akuikilaga weye Mnungu ywa Yakobo mta udahi.<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />“Heniite kaya hegu kwo lusazi,<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />henihumule hegu kukupila,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />mpaka nihapate hant'hu kwajili ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:5">kaya kwajili ya Mnungu mta udahi ywa Yakobo.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Kaula nekiva zimbuli ze Disanduku dye Ndagano uko Efulata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:6">naho nekidiona uko kwe zink'honde za Yealimu.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Chagambaga, “Hake nekiiteni kwe nyumba yakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:7">kikafike madi na kinamize vihanga vetu he difumbi dyakwe dye kiseuta.”<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Inuka weye Zumbe Mnungu hant'hu hako ho kuhumula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:8">winuke ne disanduku dyako dyo udahi.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Walavant'hambiko wako wadamanye uwagilwa mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:9">want'hu wako nawo wakeme kwa kinyemi!<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Walaganaga na mndima ywako Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:10">usekumlemela uyo umkumbile mavuta.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Zumbe amwiikilaga Daudi kilapi che kindedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">kulagana uko hokukuhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">“Nenimtende yumwenga ywa welekwa wako ande seuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:11">neeze ande niye mkulu hant'hu hako.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />Wanawo uneva wananda wakindedi kwe Ndagano yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">ne zisigilizi huwenk'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:12">wana wawe we kilume nawo weza kunda maseuta hant'hu hako.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kaisagula Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:13">kaungisa ekale uumwo.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />“Aha nihio hant'hu hangu ho kuhumula ulo naulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:14">nenikale aaha enga ivo ulongile.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Nenihavikile na kuwenk'ha want'hu wakwe kiya wakuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:15">wakiwa wakwe neniweguse na nk'hande.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Neniwavikile walavant'hambiko wakwe kwa yose wakudamanya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:16">want'hu wakwe nawakeme na kwanga kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Aha nenimtende asukile mdahi ywo lukolo lwa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:17">enga ivo lukukweela lumuli, nenimtende seuta uyo nimsagule akangale.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Wank'hondo wakwe neniwavale soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 132:18">mna yehe neni mvale unga'zi utendese wa kiseuta.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s">Uwedi wo uhamwenga wa want'hu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Vandilisa vedi naho vawagilisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:1">umwo wandugu wakekala hamwenga naho kwa uhamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ni enga mavuta ya yombe kulu yagidigwe mwo mtwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">yakuseela mwe zindevu za Haluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:2">kubwiluka mwo ukosi we divalo dyakwe.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ni enga mnyuzu wa kwo mnima wa Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">ivo ukugwa mwe vigulu va Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">kwaviya uko nuko Zumbe alagane uvikilwa wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 133:3">ugima hewiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">nyuwe wandima wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:1">nyuwe nyose mkudamanya ndima mwe nyumba yakwe umwo nekilo.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Henuileni mikono aho hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:2">na kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Zumbe Mnungu adamanye mbingu na si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 134:3">awavikileni kulawa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hunyo kwe dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Zumbe Mnungu atunywe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:1">Ditunyeni dizina dyakwe nyuwe wandima wakwe Zumbe Mnungu,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />nyuwe mkukimala mwe nyumba ya Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya ni ywedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:3">dikemeleni dizina dyakwe kwaviya ni dyedi.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kakesaguila Yakobo kunda mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:4">want'hu wa Izilaeli kwajili yakwe mwenye.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />Kwaviya himanya kugamba Zumbe Mnungu ni mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:5">naho Zumbe Mnungu ywetu kawajink'ha milungu yose.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Adamanya kila icho akuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">kwe mbingu na mwe isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:6">mwe bahali ne mina yakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Niye akuyatenda mavunde yakwele kulawa kwo uheelo we isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">amwekeza lumwemwe hamwenga ne fula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:7">aleta nk'hung'unt'ho kulawa mwe kindolo chakwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Awakomaga nt'hula sasu wose uko Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:8">wa want'hu na makala hamwenga.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Egalaga vilagiso na mbuli za kweheela kwa weye Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:9">kamsulumiza Falao na na wambizi wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Azibanangaga si nyingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:10">naho akomaga maseuta wana udahi.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Sihoni uyo seuta ywa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">Ogu seuta ywa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:11">na maseuta wose wa Kanaani,<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />isi yawe awenk'haga ukipe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:12">ukipe wa Izilaeli awant'hu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Zina dyako ni dya mazuwa yose Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:13">kukumbukilwa kwako ni kwa vyeleko na vyeleko.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Zumbe Mnungu naawatowanile want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:14">naawaonele mbazi wandima wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Milungu ya si nt'huhu idamanywa kwa masawa na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:15">itakudamanywa ni want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Ina milomo mna haikulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:16">ina meso mna haikukaula,<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />ina magutwi mna haikwiva</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:17">mwe milomo yawe du haina muye.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Wose waidamanye wakeiga nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:18">ni hamwenga na awo wakuihuwila.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:19">nyuwe walavant'hambiko mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu!<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Nyuwe Walawi mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:20">mtunyeni nyuwe nyose mkumvika!<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu uko Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">uko Yelusalemu kwo ukalo wakwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 135:21">Mtunyeni Zumbe!<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s">Nt'hogola kwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Mtogoleni Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya ni ywedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:1">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Mtogoleni Mungu ywa milungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:2">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Mtogoleni Zumbe ywa mazumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:3">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Ni yehe ekedu akudamanya vihungi vikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:4">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Yehe aumbile zimbingu kwa umanyi wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:5">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Yehe aumbile si mnanga mwa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:6">kwaviya lunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Yehe aumbile dizuwa no mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:7">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Zuwa dilangaze nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:8">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Mnenge ne zint'hondo zilangaze nekilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:9">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Yehe awakomaga nt'hula sasu wa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:10">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Awalongozaga Izilaeli kulawa Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:11">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Kwa mkono uchululwe una ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:12">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Yehe aipangile bahali ya Shamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:13">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Na kuwombosa Izilaeli mgati e bahali iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:14">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Umwo mwe bahali amtufikaga Falao ne difyo dyakwe dya watowani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:15">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Niyo awalongoza want'hu mwe dijangwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:16">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Uyo awatoile maseuta wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:17">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />niyo awakoma maseuta amanyikise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:18">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Sihoni seuta ywa Waamoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:19">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Ogu seuta ywa Bashani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:20">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Isi yawe kawenk'ha want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:21">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />ni ukipe kwa Izilaeli mndima ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:22">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Uyo akikumbukile umwo chaswesile ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:23">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Niyo akiyokolaga kulawa mwa wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:24">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Enk'hiza nk'hande kwa viumbwa vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:25">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose;<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Mwink'heni nt'hogola Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 136:26">kwaviya lukunde lwakwe ni lwa mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s">Izilaeli wahongeza uko kwo utumwa</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Chekalaga hasi hwo lwega lwo mto wa Babeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:1">chailaga kize kiikumbukile Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Chahasikaga mazeze yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:2">mwa maziti ye isi idya.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Kwaviya wadya wakitahaga waungaga kiwagele kinyemi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">wakiungaga kiwakemele wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:3">wakigambaga kiwakemele wila umwenga wa Sayuni.<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Kikeme vivihi wila wa Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:4">mwe isi yo utakwiza?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Uneva hakujala weye Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:5">mkono wangu wo kulume ujale kutowa zeze,<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />lulimi lwangu lunde luzama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">uneva hina kukumbukile weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">uneva hina kufanyanye weye Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:6">kugamba ni kinyemi changu kikulu.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu kumbukila ivo Waedomu watendaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">mwe dizuwa diya Yelusalemu yatahagwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">Kumbukila ivo wandaga wakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:7">“Imoleni Yelusalemu hata ne zink'hongelo zakwe!”<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Weye Babeli, noubanangwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">Wana kinyemi wadya wakuunga wakulihize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:8">kwa yadya ukitendele.<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Ana kinyemi uyo akuunga awagwile wanawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 137:9">niyo awahamizila mwo luwe.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">Kwink'hiza nt'hogola</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Nakwink'ha nt'hogola weye Zumbe Mnungu kwo moyo wangu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:1">nenikeme nt'hogola zako ho undiilo we milungu.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Nafunamiza kihanga changu hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">hahinga kwe Nyumba yako ikukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">kwajili yo lukunde lwako holukusila hamwenga no uhuwilwa wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:2">Kwaviya kulagisa kugamba dizina dyako ne mbuli zako vikulisa.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Umwo nakwitangaga weye wanitikaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:3">wautondowazaga umoyo wangu kwa kunitenda ninde na ludole.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Maseuta wose mwe si nawaditunye dizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:4">aho wakeva icho noulonge.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Nawakeme ivo adamanye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:5">kwaviya un'gazi utendese wa Zumbe ukulisa.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, hata uneva ywi kulanga mwa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">mna wawakaulisa wadya hewee kukekweza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:6">mna awakombaganya kwa hale wose wakukekweza.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Umwo nazungulukagwa ni makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">wanidimaga vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">wayahigaga maya ya wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:7">kwa mkono wako wa kulume wanilihizila.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Noudamanye kila kiya ulagane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">lukunde lwako weye Zumbe Mnungu ni lwa mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 138:8">Use kuzileka zindima zako ukudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe niye mmanyi ywa kila kint'hu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Zumbe Mnungu kunipelemba naho kunimanyisa,<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />weye kumanya ukwikala kwangu na kugenda kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:2">kuzimanya zifanyanyi zangu kukongela hale.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Weye kulumanya lugendo lwangu hegu kuhumula kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:3">kuzimanya zisila zangu zose.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Umo handa hinati kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:4">weye kukombaganya kale icho huunga nilonge.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Weye kunizunguluka nt'hendelo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:5">wanamila kwa kunigeleka mkono wako.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Umanyi wako nawehelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:6">ukulisa, miye hikudaha kuukombaganya.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Nenigulukilehi hakunyilika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:7">uko hudaha kukefisa no undiilo wako?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Uneva nna ita kwe mbingu uko wiyuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:8">hagamba nigulukile kwe isi ya wabanike weye wiyuko.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Nna puulukila hale ulailo wa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:9">na kwikala nt'hendelo za hale za uheelo wa bahali,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />uko nako wiyuko udahi wako wanilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:10">mkono wako wa kulume wanitozeleza.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Hata uneva nnadigamba diziza dinigubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:11">dinizunguluke hant'hu ha ung'azi,<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />uumwo mwe diziza weye wading'aza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">naho nekilo kwako kwang'ala enga nomsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:12">kwako weye kilo na nomsi vose ni viligana.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Ni weye udamanye vilungo vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:13">naho wanilunganyaga mwe mbeleko ya mnala.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Nakutunya weye kwaviya kuniumba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">kwa udamanyi wako wa kwehela na kwa kutisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:14">ayo hiyamanyisa kwa vedi.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Weye wanionaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">umwo haumbwa kwa kinyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">aho naumbwagwa kwa umanyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:15">niyo naikwaa mwe mbeleko ya mnala.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />Weye wanionaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">hata umwo nandaga hinati kwelekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">mazuwa yangu ayo wanipangilaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:16">yawandikwagwa mwe kitabu chako umwo yandaga hayanati yalaile hata zuwa dimwenga.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Weye Mnungu, fanyanyi zako zikulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:17">hazikadahika kuwazigwa.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Uneva nayawazile hegu nayakanda mengi kujink'ha msanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:18">naho henuka nikei hamwenga na weye.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Weye Mnungu, hegu nevinda vedi wawakomile want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:19">nivedi wakomi wahalawe hangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Walonga yaihile mwa weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:20">wasimuila maihi mwe dizina dyako.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />We Zumbe, togola niwaihie wakukuihiya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:21">niwabele wadya wakusaguka kwako?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Nawaihia vitendese wakukusaguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:22">wank'hondo wako ni wank'hondo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Unipelembe weye Mnungu uumanye umoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:23">unihime uzimanye zifanyanyi zangu.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Unikaule uone uneva mwangu yeyuko yakuihiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 139:24">unilongoze mwe zisila za mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wamizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />We Zumbe, niyokole mwa want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:1">namile na want'hu makwank'walu.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Waika mizungu ya wiihi kila zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:2">naho waika mizungu iihile mwe mioyo yawe,<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />zinyimi zawe zalubutula enga nyoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:3">usungu wa nyoka mifune imwe milomo yawe.<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Zumbe uniyokole mwe mikono ya want'hu waihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">unamile mwa want'hu makwank'walu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:4">wakuika mizungu ya kunikinya.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Wakuketogola waninikila mitego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">watega imitego yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:5">mitego yawe kila hant'hu mwe sila hwombokela.<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />We Zumbe nakugamba, “Ni weye Mnungu ywangu.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:6">Wive izwi dye ndilo yangu unionele mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu, udahi wo uyokozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:7">kunink'ha wamizi mwe dizuwa dye nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Zumbe, waihile usekuwenk'ha yadya wakuunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:8">nyambi zawe zise kukint'ha wanase waketogole.<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Wank'hondo wangu wabanangwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:9">uwihi we milomo yawe uwauiye wenye.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Nk'hala za maiwe ye moto ziwakupukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:10">waduulwe kwo moto kwe dibome tali, wanase kufosa naho!<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Wakuwaziga weyawe mbuli, wasekunda na kint'hu mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:11">uwihi uwongole wakwank'hwalu na kuwabananga.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />Zumbe, miye himanya weye wamila uwagilwa wa wakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:12">naho wawagombela heweina kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Ikindedi, wawagilwa nawatunye dizina dyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 140:13">wahuwilwa nawekale ho undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kwa mwalagulo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Nakwitanga weye Zumbe Mnungu sunguza kwiza kwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:1">Wive diizwi dyangu hakwitanga.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Kulombeza kwangu kukubwiile enga ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:2">mikono yangu hwinula inde enga nt'hambiko ya kisingi.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Zumbe, nink'he wamizi milosi yangu umwo halonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:3">unamile mwe nk'hili yo mnomo wangu.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Use kuulekela umoyo wangu uguhigwe ni mbuli ziiile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">na kukeika hamwenga na want'hu waihile mwa maihi yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:4">naho nisekunda ndala nawo mwe zifugo zawe.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Ni vedi muwagilwa aniogole kwa lukunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">akanifank'hila ni enga mavuta mwo mtwi wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:5">Hata ivo mazuwa yose kulombeza kwangu havikuivana na wakudamanya uwihi.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Wakulu wawe nawawaduule hasi kulawa kwa maluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:6">waihi nawakehenize kugamba ayo nalongaga ni kindedi.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Nawagambe, “Vikala enga mlimi ivo akulima na kutula makazi, nivo mavuha yetu nayamwaganiswe kwo mwingiilo we kikuta.”<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Mna miye nakukaula weye Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">weye niwe nk'hindo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:8">usekuleka wanikome.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Unamile ne mitego waniikile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:9">na matasi ya waihi.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Waihi wagwiligwe wenye mwe mitego yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 141:10">umwo homboka haheina kulumizwa.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza wambizi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Namwiila Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:1">namlombeza anionele mbazi.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Namwigaila yehe indilo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:2">naho namgambila makunt'ho yangu yose,<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />aho miye hafa chevu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">kamanya icho nehaunga nidamanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">Mwe sila iyo hwombokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:3">wank'hondo wangu wenitegela mitego.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Umwo hakekaula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">hikuona yeyose ywa kunambiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">hahali ywa kunamila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:4">Hahali hata yumwenga ywa kukaula wikazi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Nakuiila weye Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">miye nagamba ni weye unyilikilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:5">naho ni weye upasi wangu mwe isi ya wagima.<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Unitegeleze indilo yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya hinda hiina kint'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">niyokole na wadya wakunongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:6">kwaviya wanihuma ludole.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Nilave mwo uvugailwa uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">name nohutogole ho wingi wa want'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 142:7">kwajili yo uwedi wako kwangu.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza kukombolwa kulawa kwa wank'hondo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu unitegeleze ukulombeza kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">unive aya hulombeza kwa uhuwilwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:1">unink'he uhituzi kwa uwagilwa wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Usekunigela mwo usengelo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:2">kwaviya hahali yeyose muwagilwa mta ugima ho undiilo wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Kwaviya mnk'hondo anikulumbuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">anisigint'hila hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:3">anitenda nikale mwo lwiza viligane na wadya wabanikaga aho kale.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Naivo miye hifa chevu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:4">moyo wangu wingila kinyulu na kogoha.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Miye nakumbukila mazuwa ya kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nafanyanya zindima zako zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:5">nakaula zindima izo wadamanyaga.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Nachulula mikono yangu kwako halombeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:6">moyo wangu wakuonela nk'hilu enga sanga inyaile.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Sunguza kunihitula we Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">moyo wangu uhwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">use kukefisa hale na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:7">nnase kunda yumwenga ywa wadya wakuita kwe isi ya wabanike.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Kukanda mtondo nigaile mbuli ya lukunde lwako holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">kwaviya mhuwi wangu wi kwako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">unilagise sila ya kutimila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:8">naho kwako niko niikile dikawiilo dyangu.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Zumbe Mnungu niyokole mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:9">nanyilikila kwako vileke unifise.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Nihinize kudamanya yakukwelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">kwaviya weye niwe Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:10">muye ywako uywedi anilongoze mwe isi ya nt'hindiga.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Kwajili ye dizina dyako weye Zumbe Mnungu niyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:11">niyokole mwa makunt'ho yangu kwa uwedi wako.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Uwabanange wank'hondo wangu kwa lukunde lwako holukusila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">wakome pele wose wakunigela makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 143:12">kwaviya miye ni mndima ywako.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s">Seuta amwink'ha nt'hogola Mnungu kwa uhumi wakwe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Atogolwe Zumbe Mnungu eli nyilikilo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">akunihiniza kutowana mwe nk'humbizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:1">na kuniikila lumwe kwa nk'hondo.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Yehe ni Mnungu ywangu ywo lukunde na gomela dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">gomela dyangu naho myokozi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">nk'hindilo yangu iyo humyilikila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:2">akuwaika want'hu wa si mwo udahi wangu.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Zumbe Mnungu, ivi mnt'hu ni kint'hu chani vikuleka umkaulise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:3">katendesai vikuleka umfanyanye?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Yehe ni enga muye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:4">mazuwa yakwe ni enga kizuli kikomboka.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Zumbe Mnungu, zipange zimbingu zako useele uku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:5">ikwafe milima vileke ilave mosi.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Igala lumwemwe na lukuwa uwa mwaganise wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:6">walase ne misale yako uwakulumbuze.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Chulula mikono yako kulawa kulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">nilave mwa mazi matali uniyokole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:7">nihonye mwe mikono ya watakwiza,<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />wata milomo ikudant'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:8">ne mikono yawe ya kulume ina nk'huluta.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Nohukemele wila mhya Mnungu ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:9">nenikeme hatowa zeze dya nyuzi mlongo,<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />ni kwa yehe akuwenk'ha uhumi maseuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:10">uyo amuyokole mndima ywakwe Daudi kwa sime ikutwa.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Nikombole miye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">uniyokole mwo udahi wa watakwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">wata kulonga lulimi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:11">mikono yawe nayo ya kulume yakuluta.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Niho wana wetu mwo ubwanga wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">nawande enga vihandwa vileligwe vedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">wana wetu wa kike nawande enga mikola ikizigwe mahambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:12">ihambe dizumba dye kiseuta.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Magulu yetu nayameme</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">ulozo wi hengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:13">ngoto zetu nazo nezeleke milongo ya maalufu.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />Mifugwa yetu neidamane na kunda ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">heilave nda naho neyeleke kwa lupisi lukint'hile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:14">hokunde na kutahigwa hegu ndilo za makunt'ho mwe zisila zetu.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Wana kinyemi want'hu wa ivo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 144:15">naho wana kinyemi want'hu wakumtenda Zumbe kunda Mnungu ywewe.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa kumtunya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Weye Mnungu Zumbe ywangu, nohutunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:1">nenidivike dizina dyako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Nohwink'he nt'hogola kila zuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:2">na kuditunya dizina dyako mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Zumbe Mnungu niye mkulu ywa kutunywa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:3">ukulu wakwe hauku kombaganyika.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Udamanyi wako noutunywe ni vyeleko vose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:4">nawabilikize mbuli nk'hulu udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Neniusimuile ukulu no udahi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:5">nenifanyanye ya kweheela ayo udamanye.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Want'hu nawasimuile udamanyi wako wa kweheela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:6">nawaubilikize ukulu wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Nawakutunye wakakumbukila ukulu wo uwedi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:7">naho wakabwelekeza uwedi wako kwa kinyemi.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Zumbe Mnungu ni mta lukunde na mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:8">hiyo mhufu wa maya, lukunde lwakwe halukusila.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Yehe ni ywedi kwa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:9">ana mbazi kwa kila kint'hu akiumbile.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Viumbwa vose vakutunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:10">want'hu wako wahuwilwa nawakuvikile.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Nawasimuile ukulu wo useuta wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:11">naho nawalonge mwe mbuli yo udahi wako,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />vileke want'hu wose nawamanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:12">no ukung'ala kwo ukulu wo useuta wako.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Weye wekaila mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">useuta wako haukusila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">Zumbe Mnungu ni mhuwilwa mwa malagano yakwe yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:13">ni ywedi mwo udamanyi wakwe wose.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Zumbe Mnungu awambiza wose wakugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:14">awenula awo wagwele hasi.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Meso ya viumbwa vose yasinya kwako kwa kawiilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:15">nawe wawenk'ha nk'hande kwa lupisi lukuungwa.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Wakunjula mkono wako kwa ukise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:16">kila kint'hu kigima wakink'ha ivo kikuunga.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Zumbe Mnungu ni muwagilwa mwe zisila zakwe zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:17">naho mhuwilwa kwa kila icho ukudamanya.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Zumbe Mnungu he hale na wose wakumwitanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:18">wakumwitanga kwa uhuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Wose wakumvika awenk'ha yadya wakuyaunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:19">aiva indilo yawe niyo awayokola.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Yeyose akumuunga, yehe amwamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:20">mna waihi naawabanange.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Nenimtunye Zumbe Mnungu mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 145:21">viumbwa vakwe viditogole dizina dyakwe dikukile mazuwa yose.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s">Kumtunya Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:1">moyo wangu mtunye Zumbe Mnungu!<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Nenimtunye Zumbe Mnungu mazuwa yangu yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:2">nenikeme nt'hunyo kwa Mnungu mwa mazuwa yo ugima wangu wose.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Usekumhuwila mkulu ywa want'hu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:3">awo ni want'hu du hewekudaha kuyokola.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Umwo wakabanika wauya mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:4">mwe dizuwa idyo mizungu yawe yose yanda hiyo kint'hu.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Wavikilwa wano wambizi ukulawa kwa Mnungu ywa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:5">wano mhuwi kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywawe,<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />uyo muumbi ywe mbingu ne bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">na vose vimndani mwamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:6">mazuwa yose yehe ni mhuwilwa mazuwa yose,<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />yehe awenk'ha uwagilwa wakuhujilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">na kuwegusa heweina cho kudya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:7">Zumbe Mnungu awakomwoela wavugailwa,<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />awatenda mant'hunt'hu wakaule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">Zumbe Mnungu awenk'ha nt'hunyo wose wakufika madi na kufunamiza vihanga vawe hasi ho undiilo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:8">yehe awaungisa want'hu wakumvika.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Awamila watakwiza mwe isi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">awalela wana nk'hiwa na wavele wabanikilwe ni walume wawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:9">mna awegala waihi kwo kubanangwa.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Zumbe Mnungu ekala mazuwa yose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">Mnungu ywenyu nyuwe Sayuni kwe vyeleko vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 146:10">mtunyeni Zumbe!<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s">Kumtunya Mnungu ywo udahi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:1">kwaviya ni vedi kumkemela Mnungu ywetu, kwaviya ni kwedi kutunya naho kwa wagila.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Zumbe Mnungu aizenga naho Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:2">awavuza want'hu wekwe kulawa kwe samo.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Awalagula walumizwe miyoyo yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:3">awa zinganiza vitambala mwe zink'wenge zawe.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Kaziwaza zint'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:4">niyo azitambula mazina ywe kila imwenga.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Zumbe ywetu ni mkulu naho mta udahi utendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:5">ukombaganyi wakwe hauna uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Awenula wakukeseleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:6">mna waihi awakinya mpaka hasi.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Mkemeleni Zumbe kwa kumtogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:7">mtoweleni mazeze Mnungu ywetu.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Ulanga augubika kwa mavunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">aitenda fula inye mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:8">niyo mani yahota mwe milima.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Ayenk'ha makala nk'hande yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:9">na makinda ya makungulu yakaila.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Yehe hakuonela kinyemi ludole lwa falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:10">hegu kubwedezwa ni viga va watowani wadahi,<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />mna awabweda wadya wakumwogoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:11">wakuika mhuwi wawe mwo lukunde lwakwe holwiina uheelo.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />We Yelusalemu mtunye Zumbe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:12">Mtogole Mnungu ywako weye Sayuni!<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Ayatogeza madanga ye nk'hili yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:13">na kuwavikila awo we mndani yo lukandula lwako,<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />akwink'ha utondowazi kwe mihaka yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:14">naho awegusani na ngano yedi.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Asigiila mbuli mwe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:15">naho kiya alongile chasunguza kulaila.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Anjaza ibalafu enga sufi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:16">mnyuzu nawo enga maivu,<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />egala fula ya maiwe enga mp'halamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:17">hahali akudaha kufinyiliza imp'heho yakwe!<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Naho egala mbuli yakwe niyo ya lungulumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:18">egala nk'hung'unt'ho niyo mazi yaseela.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Ulosi wakwe kamwink'ha Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:19">malagizo ne miko yakwe kwa Izilaeli.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Ayo hayadamanye kwa want'hu wa isi nt'hutu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">hawaumanyize umwiko uno.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 147:20">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu!<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s">Si yose imtunye Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:1">mtunyeni yehe kulawa kwe mbingu!<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Mtunyeni watumigwa wakwe wa kwe mbingu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:2">mafyo dyakwe dyose dya kwe mbingu mwink'heni nt'hunyo.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Mtunyeni yehe nyuwe zuwa no mnenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:3">mwink'heni nt'hunyo, nyuwe zint'hondo zose mkwalika.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Mtunyeni yehe nyuwe mbingu mwi kulanga vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:4">nanywe mazi mwi kulanga ye mbingu .<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Vose viditunye dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:5">kwa viya voho vaumbwagwa kwa ulosi wakwe,<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />aviikaga kila kimwenga hant'hu hakwe mazuwa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:6">alavaga sigilizi heikuhitulwa mazuwa yose,<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />mkulawa mwe si, mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">nyuwe viumbwa vikulu va mwe bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:7">hamwenga ne mina yose ye bahali,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />lumwemwe na fula ya maiwe na balafu na mavunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:8">nk'hung'unt'ho na mjubwaniso ivo vikumwiva akalonga,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />milima na vigulu vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:9">maziti ya matunda na matuhu yakwitangwa mielezi,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />makala mbago na mifugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:10">viumbwa vidodo hamwenga na madege ulanga,<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />maseuta wa si na want'hu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:11">wakulu hamwenga na walamuzi wa si,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />wabwanga na wandele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:12">wakulu na wana wadodo.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Awo wose waditunye dizina dya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">kwaviya dizina dyakwe yehe ekedu dikulisa kujink'ha mazina yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:13">ukulu wakwe wi kulanga kujink'ha si ne mbingu.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Kawenk'ha want'hu wakwe ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">nt'hunyo kwa wahuwilwa wakwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">kwajili ya want'hu wa Izilaeli we hagihi naye.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 148:14">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa nt'hunyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Mkemeleni Zumbe Mnungu wila mhya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:1">mkemeleni nt'hunyo zakwe mwo mdugano wa wahuwilwa.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Izilaeli oneni kinyemi mwa muumbi ywenyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:2">want'hu wa Sayuni nawamwangile seuta ywawe.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Tunyeni na kuvina kwajili ye dizina dyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:3">mtoweleni zeze na ngoma mwo kumtunya,<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu elelwa ni want'hu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:4">wakukeseleza awahamba na uhumi.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Wahuwilwa nawaonele kinyemi mwo uhumi uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:5">naho kukema wakanga hata nekilo.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Nawange kwa maizwi wakamtunya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:6">wakanda ne zisime zawe mwe mikono<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />wazitowe si,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:7">na kuwasulumiza want'hu.<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />Wawakake maseuta wawe mwe minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:8">na wakulu wawe wawanyinye mp'hingu za kilama,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />vileke wawasengele want'hu wa si viligane na ivo Mnungu alongile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Ino ni nt'hunyo kwa wahuwilwa wa Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 149:9">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu .<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">Mkemeleni Mnungu mwe nyumba yakwe hakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:1">mwangileni yehe kwe zimbingu zakwe zo udahi.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Mtunyeni kwa makulu akudamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:2">mkemeleni kwa ivo wili ukulu wakwe.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Mtunyeni mkamtowela digunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:3">mtoweleni zeze na kinubi.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Mtunyeni mkamtowela ngoma na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:4">mtoweleni vint'hu vina nyuzi na miluli.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Mtunyeni mkamtowela lupatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:5">mwangileni kwa mp'hatu zikuilisa.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Viumbwa vose vina ugima mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 150:6">Mtunyeni Zumbe Mnungu.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>